s personalizadas","Integración con ULTRATHINK Curated Styles"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de l''API REST","Gestion des membres","Galerie de 120 styles","Conception de système de 120 styles","Plateformes de gestion des membres personnalisées","Intégration avec ULTRATHINK Curated Styles"],"de":["Implementierung von REST-API","Mitgliederverwaltung","Galerie mit 120 Stilen","Entwurf von 120-Style-Systemen","Anpassbare Mitgliederverwaltungsplattformen","Integration mit ULTRATHINK Curated Styles"],"pt":["Integração com o Style Design System Gallery","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Ferramenta de IA para plataformas de gerenciamento de membros","Compatibilidade com React, Python e Node.js","Instalação e configuração fáceis"],"ru":["Интеграция с Style Design System Gallery","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","ИИ Агент для платформ управления участниками","Совместимость с React, Python и Node.js","Лёгкая установка и конфигурация"],"ar":["التكامل مع Style Design System Gallery","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لمنصات إدارة الأعضاء","التوافق مع React و Python و Node.js","تثبيت وضبط سهل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Rest API 设计系统","成员管理平台","AI解决方案","自动化业务流程","如何使用 AI 智能代理","AI 智能代理 vs 传统代理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Rest API デザインシステム","メンバー管理プラットフォーム","AIソリューション","ビジネスプロセスの自動化","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェント vs 伝統的エージェント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Rest API 디자인 시스템","회원 관리 플랫폼","AI 솔루션","비즈니스 프로세스 자동화","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 vs 전통 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar API REST","herramientas de API REST","alternativas a API REST","API REST vs GraphQL","instalación de API REST","guía de configuración de API REST","desarrollo de plataformas de gestión de miembros"],"fr":["comment utiliser l''API REST","outils d''API REST","alternatives à l''API REST","API REST vs GraphQL","installation de l''API REST","guide de configuration de l''API REST","développement de plateformes de gestion des membres"],"de":["wie man REST-API verwendet","REST-API-Tools","Alternativen zu REST-API","REST-API vs GraphQL","Installation von REST-API","Einrichtungsanleitung für REST-API","Entwicklung von Mitgliederverwaltungsplattformen"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","restapi","plataformas de gerenciamento de membros","style design system gallery","como usar restapi","o que é restapi","restapi vs outras ferramentas","instalar restapi","guia de configuração do restapi"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","restapi","платформы управления участниками","style design system gallery","как использовать restapi","что такое restapi","restapi vs другие инструменты","установить restapi","руководство по настройке restapi"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","restapi","منصات إدارة الأعضاء","style design system gallery","كيفية استخدام restapi","ما هي restapi","restapi مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت restapi","دليل إعداد restapi"]}},"owner":"markus41","repo":"lobbi-design-system","repoPath":"markus41/lobbi-design-system","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2025-12-11T02:04:06Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"restapi","description":"REST API design, implementation, and best practices. Activate for API endpoints, HTTP methods, status codes, authentication, and API documentation.","bodyPreview":"# REST API Skill\n\nProvides comprehensive REST API design and implementation capabilities for the Golden Armada AI Agent Fleet Platform.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when working with:\n- API endpoint design\n- HTTP request/response handling\n- API authentication\n- OpenAPI documentation\n- API testing\n\n## REST API Design Principles\n\n### Resource Naming\n\\`\\`\\`\n# Good - nouns, plural\nGET    /agents\nGET    /agents/{id}\nPOST   /agents\nPUT    /agents/{id}\nDELETE /agents/{id}\n\n# Nested r","body":"# REST API Skill\n\nProvides comprehensive REST API design and implementation capabilities for the Golden Armada AI Agent Fleet Platform.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when working with:\n- API endpoint design\n- HTTP request/response handling\n- API authentication\n- OpenAPI documentation\n- API testing\n\n## REST API Design Principles\n\n### Resource Naming\n\\`\\`\\`\n# Good - nouns, plural\nGET    /agents\nGET    /agents/{id}\nPOST   /agents\nPUT    /agents/{id}\nDELETE /agents/{id}\n\n# Nested resources\nGET    /agents/{id}/tasks\nPOST   /agents/{id}/tasks\n\n# Bad - verbs, actions\nGET    /getAgents\nPOST   /createAgent\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### HTTP Methods\n| Method | Usage | Idempotent |\n|--------|-------|------------|\n| GET | Read resource | Yes |\n| POST | Create resource | No |\n| PUT | Replace resource | Yes |\n| PATCH | Partial update | No |\n| DELETE | Delete resource | Yes |\n\n### Status Codes\n\\`\\`\\`\n# Success\n200 OK              - Successful GET, PUT, PATCH\n201 Created         - Successful POST\n204 No Content      - Successful DELETE\n\n# Client Errors\n400 Bad Request     - Validation error\n401 Unauthorized    - Authentication required\n403 Forbidden       - Not permitted\n404 Not Found       - Resource not found\n409 Conflict        - Duplicate/conflict\n422 Unprocessable   - Semantic validation error\n\n# Server Errors\n500 Internal Error  - Server error\n502 Bad Gateway     - Upstream error\n503 Service Unavailable - Temporary overload\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## API Implementation (FastAPI)\n\n\\`\\`\\`python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPException, Query, Path, Depends, status\nfrom typing import List, Optional\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n\napp = FastAPI(title=\"Golden Armada API\", version=\"1.0.0\")\n\n# Models\nclass AgentCreate(BaseModel):\n    name: str = Field(..., min_length=1, max_length=100)\n    type: str = Field(..., pattern=\"^(claude|gpt|gemini)$\")\n\nclass AgentResponse(BaseModel):\n    id: str\n    name: str\n    type: str\n    status: str\n    created_at: datetime\n\n# Endpoints\n@app.get(\"/agents\", response_model=List[AgentResponse])\nasync def list_agents(\n    skip: int = Query(0, ge=0),\n    limit: int = Query(100, ge=1, le=1000),\n    status: Optional[str] = Query(None)\n):\n    \"\"\"List all agents with pagination and filtering.\"\"\"\n    return await agent_service.list(skip=skip, limit=limit, status=status)\n\n@app.get(\"/agents/{agent_id}\", response_model=AgentResponse)\nasync def get_agent(agent_id: str = Path(..., description=\"Agent ID\")):\n    \"\"\"Get a specific agent by ID.\"\"\"\n    agent = await agent_service.get(agent_id)\n    if not agent:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Agent not found\")\n    return agent\n\n@app.post(\"/agents\", response_model=AgentResponse, status_code=201)\nasync def create_agent(agent: AgentCreate):\n    \"\"\"Create a new agent.\"\"\"\n    return await agent_service.create(agent)\n\n@app.put(\"/agents/{agent_id}\", response_model=AgentResponse)\nasync def update_agent(agent_id: str, agent: AgentCreate):\n    \"\"\"Replace an existing agent.\"\"\"\n    existing = await agent_service.get(agent_id)\n    if not existing:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Agent not found\")\n    return await agent_service.update(agent_id, agent)\n\n@app.delete(\"/agents/{agent_id}\", status_code=204)\nasync def delete_agent(agent_id: str):\n    \"\"\"Delete an agent.\"\"\"\n    deleted = await agent_service.delete(agent_id)\n    if not deleted:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Agent not found\")\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Authentication\n\n### JWT Authentication\n\\`\\`\\`python\nfrom fastapi import Depends, HTTPException, status\nfrom fastapi.security import OAuth2PasswordBearer\nfrom jose import JWTError, jwt\n\noauth2_scheme = OAuth2PasswordBearer(tokenUrl=\"token\")\n\nasync def get_current_user(token: str = Depends(oauth2_scheme)):\n    credentials_exception = HTTPException(\n        status_code=status.HTTP_401_UNAUTHORIZED,\n        detail=\"Could not validate credentials\",\n        headers={\"WWW-Authenticate\": \"Bearer\"},\n    )\n    try:\n        payload = jwt.decode(token, SECRET_KEY, algorithms=[ALGORITHM])\n        user_id: str = payload.get(\"sub\")\n        if user_id is None:\n            raise credentials_exception\n    except JWTError:\n        raise credentials_exception\n    return await get_user(user_id)\n\n# Protected endpoint\n@app.get(\"/protected\")\nasync def protected_route(user: User = Depends(get_current_user)):\n    return {\"user\": user.email}\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### API Key Authentication\n\\`\\`\\`python\nfrom fastapi.security import APIKeyHeader\n\napi_key_header = APIKeyHeader(name=\"X-API-Key\")\n\nasync def verify_api_key(api_key: str = Depends(api_key_header)):\n    if api_key != VALID_API_KEY:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=403, detail=\"Invalid API key\")\n    return api_key\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Error Handling\n\n\\`\\`\\`python\nclass ErrorResponse(BaseModel):\n    error: str\n    message: str\n    details: Optional[dict] = None\n\n@app.exception_handler(ValueError)\nasync def value_error_handler(request, exc):\n    return JSONResponse(\n        status_code=400,\n        content=ErrorResponse(\n            error=\"validation_error\",\n            message=str(exc)\n        ).dict()\n    )\n\n@app.exception_handler(Exception)\nasync def general_exception_handler(request, exc):\n    return JSONResponse(\n        status_code=500,\n        content=ErrorResponse(\n            error=\"internal_error\",\n            message=\"An unexpected error occurred\"\n        ).dict()\n    )\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## API Testing with curl\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\n# GET\ncurl -X GET \"http://localhost:8000/agents\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer TOKEN\"\n\n# POST\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/agents\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer TOKEN\" \\\n  -d ''{\"name\": \"agent-1\", \"type\": \"claude\"}''\n\n# PUT\ncurl -X PUT \"http://localhost:8000/agents/123\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"name\": \"updated-agent\", \"type\": \"claude\"}''\n\n# DELETE\ncurl -X DELETE \"http://localhost:8000/agents/123\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer TOKEN\"\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## OpenAPI Documentation\n\n\\`\\`\\`python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI(\n    title=\"Golden Armada API\",\n    description=\"AI Agent Fleet Platform API\",\n    version=\"1.0.0\",\n    docs_url=\"/docs\",\n    redoc_url=\"/redoc\",\n    openapi_url=\"/openapi.json\"\n)\n\n# Access documentation at:\n# - Swagger UI: http://localhost:8000/docs\n# - ReDoc: http://localhost:8000/redoc\n# - OpenAPI JSON: http://localhost:8000/openapi.json\n\\`\\`\\`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:09:43.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API-focused Agents needing comprehensive REST API design and implementation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要全面REST API设计和实现能力的API焦点代理。","ja":"APIに焦点を当てたエージェントが包括的なREST API設計と実装能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 REST API 설계 및 구현 기능이 필요한 API 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en API que necesitan capacidades de diseño e implementación de API REST comprehensivas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''API nécessitant des capacités de conception et de mise en œuvre d''API REST complètes.","de":"Perfekt für API-fokussierte Agenten, die umfassende REST-API-Design- und Implementierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em API que necessitam de capacidades de design e implementação de API REST abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на API, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности проектирования и реализации API REST.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات و الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم و تنفيذ شاملة لبروتوكول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement robust REST APIs with endpoint design, HTTP request/response handling, API authentication, and OpenAPI documentation using protocols like HTTP and JSON.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现强大的REST API的能力，包括端点设计、HTTP请求/响应处理、API身份验证和OpenAPI文档，使用HTTP和JSON等协议。","ja":"エージェントに強力なREST APIを設計して実装する能力を与え、エンドポイントの設計、HTTPリクエスト/レスポンスの処理、APIの認証、OpenAPIドキュメントの生成などを行うことができるようにし、HTTPやJSONなどのプロトコルを使用する。","ko":"에이전트에 강력한 REST API를 설계하고 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 엔드ポイント 설계, HTTP 요청/응답 처리, API 인증 및 OpenAPI 문서 생성 등을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, HTTP 및 JSON 등의 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar API REST robustas con diseño de puntos finales, manejo de solicitudes y respuestas HTTP, autenticación de API y documentación de OpenAPI utilizando protocolos como HTTP y JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des API REST robustes avec une conception de points de terminaison, un traitement de requêtes et de réponses HTTP, une authentification d''API et une documentation OpenAPI en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTP et JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste REST-APIs mit Endpunktdesign, HTTP-Anfrage-/Antwort-Handling, API-Authentifizierung und OpenAPI-Dokumentation unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie HTTP und JSON zu entwerfen und zu implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar APIs REST robustas com design de endpoint, manipulação de solicitação/resposta HTTP, autenticação de API e documentação OpenAPI usando protocolos como HTTP e JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать надежные API REST с помощью проектирования endpoint, обработки HTTP-запросов/ответов, аутентификации API и документации OpenAPI с использованием протоколов, таких как HTTP и JSON.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تصميم و تنفيذ واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST القوية مع تصميم نهاية، و معالجة طلب/استجابة HTTP، و مصادقة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات و توثيق OpenAPI باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing API endpoints for member management platforms","Implementing API authentication and authorization","Generating OpenAPI documentation for API testing"],"zh":["为会员管理平台设计API端点","实现API身份验证和授权","为API测试生成OpenAPI文档"],"ja":["メンバーマネジメントプラットフォームのAPIエンドポイントを設計する","APIの認証と認可を実装する","APIテスト用のOpenAPIドキュメントを生成する"],"ko":["회원 관리 플랫폼을 위한 API 엔드포인트 설계","API 인증 및 인가 구현","API 테스트를 위한 OpenAPI 문서 생성"],"es":["Diseñar puntos finales de API para plataformas de gestión de miembros","Implementar autenticación y autorización de API","Generar documentación de OpenAPI para pruebas de API"],"fr":["Concevoir des points de terminaison d''API pour les plateformes de gestion des membres","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation d''API","Générer la documentation OpenAPI pour les tests d''API"],"de":["Entwerfen von API-Endpunkten für Mitgliederverwaltungsplattformen","Implementierung von API-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung","Erzeugen von OpenAPI-Dokumentation für API-Tests"],"pt":["Projeto de endpoints de API para plataformas de gestão de membros","Implementação de autenticação e autorização de API","Geração de documentação OpenAPI para teste de API"],"ru":["Проектирование endpoint API для платформ управления членами","Реализация аутентификации и авторизации API","Генерация документации OpenAPI для тестирования API"],"ar":["تصميم نهايات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لمنصات إدارة الأعضاء","تنفيذ مصادقة و تفويض واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","توليد توثيق OpenAPI لاختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of HTTP and REST principles","Limited to REST API design and implementation"],"zh":["需要了解HTTP和REST原则","仅限REST API设计和实现"],"ja":["HTTPとRESTの原則を理解する必要がある","REST API設計と実装に限定される"],"ko":["HTTP 및 REST 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요","REST API 설계 및 구현에 한정"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de principios HTTP y REST","Limitado al diseño e implementación de API REST"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des principes HTTP et REST","Limité à la conception et à la mise en œuvre d''API REST"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von HTTP- und REST-Prinzipien","Begrenzt auf das Design und die Implementierung von REST-APIs"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos princípios HTTP e REST","Limitado ao design e implementação de API REST"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов HTTP и REST","Ограничен проектированием и реализацией API REST"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة مبادئ HTTP و REST","محدود بتصميم و تنفيذ واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bf4a913e679643ad6bca01273db563a5789bdcf595f9adb22fb45dbde9a4c295","qualityScore":41}');
