"page-cro مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت page-cro","دليل إعداد page-cro","تطوير المواقع مع page-cro","تحسين الصفحات مع page-cro"]}},"owner":"Monsoft-Solutions","repo":"alluring-website-v1","repoPath":"Monsoft-Solutions/alluring-website-v1","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.707Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"page-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize, improve, or increase conversions on any marketing page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, or blog posts. Also use when the user says CRO, conversion rate optimization, this page isnt converting, improve conversions, or why isnt this page working. For signup/registration flows, see signup-flow-cro. For post-signup activation, see onboarding-cro. For forms outside of signup, see form-cro. For popups/modals, see popup-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page","body":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page Type**: Homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, blog, about, other\n2. **Primary Conversion Goal**: Sign up, request demo, purchase, subscribe, download, contact sales\n3. **Traffic Context**: Where are visitors coming from? (organic, paid, email, social)\n\n---\n\n## CRO Analysis Framework\n\nAnalyze the page across these dimensions, in order of impact:\n\n### 1. Value Proposition Clarity (Highest Impact)\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Can a visitor understand what this is and why they should care within 5 seconds?\n- Is the primary benefit clear, specific, and differentiated?\n- Is it written in the customer''s language (not company jargon)?\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Feature-focused instead of benefit-focused\n- Too vague or too clever (sacrificing clarity)\n- Trying to say everything instead of the most important thing\n\n### 2. Headline Effectiveness\n\n**Evaluate:**\n\n- Does it communicate the core value proposition?\n- Is it specific enough to be meaningful?\n- Does it match the traffic source''s messaging?\n\n**Strong headline patterns:**\n\n- Outcome-focused: \"Get [desired outcome] without [pain point]\"\n- Specificity: Include numbers, timeframes, or concrete details\n- Social proof: \"Join 10,000+ teams who...\"\n\n### 3. CTA Placement, Copy, and Hierarchy\n\n**Primary CTA assessment:**\n\n- Is there one clear primary action?\n- Is it visible without scrolling?\n- Does the button copy communicate value, not just action?\n    - Weak: \"Submit,\" \"Sign Up,\" \"Learn More\"\n    - Strong: \"Start Free Trial,\" \"Get My Report,\" \"See Pricing\"\n\n**CTA hierarchy:**\n\n- Is there a logical primary vs. secondary CTA structure?\n- Are CTAs repeated at key decision points?\n\n### 4. Visual Hierarchy and Scannability\n\n**Check:**\n\n- Can someone scanning get the main message?\n- Are the most important elements visually prominent?\n- Is there enough white space?\n- Do images support or distract from the message?\n\n### 5. Trust Signals and Social Proof\n\n**Types to look for:**\n\n- Customer logos (especially recognizable ones)\n- Testimonials (specific, attributed, with photos)\n- Case study snippets with real numbers\n- Review scores and counts\n- Security badges (where relevant)\n\n**Placement:** Near CTAs and after benefit claims\n\n### 6. Objection Handling\n\n**Common objections to address:**\n\n- Price/value concerns\n- \"Will this work for my situation?\"\n- Implementation difficulty\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\n**Address through:** FAQ sections, guarantees, comparison content, process transparency\n\n### 7. Friction Points\n\n**Look for:**\n\n- Too many form fields\n- Unclear next steps\n- Confusing navigation\n- Required information that shouldn''t be required\n- Mobile experience issues\n- Long load times\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nStructure your recommendations as:\n\n### Quick Wins (Implement Now)\n\nEasy changes with likely immediate impact.\n\n### High-Impact Changes (Prioritize)\n\nBigger changes that require more effort but will significantly improve conversions.\n\n### Test Ideas\n\nHypotheses worth A/B testing rather than assuming.\n\n### Copy Alternatives\n\nFor key elements (headlines, CTAs), provide 2-3 alternatives with rationale.\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Frameworks\n\n### Homepage CRO\n\n- Clear positioning for cold visitors\n- Quick path to most common conversion\n- Handle both \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page CRO\n\n- Message match with traffic source\n- Single CTA (remove navigation if possible)\n- Complete argument on one page\n\n### Pricing Page CRO\n\n- Clear plan comparison\n- Recommended plan indication\n- Address \"which plan is right for me?\" anxiety\n\n### Feature Page CRO\n\n- Connect feature to benefit\n- Use cases and examples\n- Clear path to try/buy\n\n### Blog Post CRO\n\n- Contextual CTAs matching content topic\n- Inline CTAs at natural stopping points\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\nWhen recommending experiments, consider tests for:\n\n- Hero section (headline, visual, CTA)\n- Trust signals and social proof placement\n- Pricing presentation\n- Form optimization\n- Navigation and UX\n\n**For comprehensive experiment ideas by page type**: See [references/experiments.md](references/experiments.md)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current conversion rate and goal?\n2. Where is traffic coming from?\n3. What does your signup/purchase flow look like after this page?\n4. Do you have user research, heatmaps, or session recordings?\n5. What have you already tried?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: If the issue is in the signup process itself\n- **form-cro**: If forms on the page need optimization\n- **popup-cro**: If considering popups as part of the strategy\n- **copywriting**: If the page needs a complete copy rewrite\n- **ab-test-setup**: To properly test recommended changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:36.508Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) analysis and actionable recommendations.","zh":"非常适合需要高级页面转化率优化（CRO）分析和可行建议的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なページコンバージョンレート最適化（CRO）分析と実行可能な推奨事項を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 페이지 전환률 최적화(CRO) 분석 및 실행 가능한 제안이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan un análisis avanzado de optimización de la tasa de conversión de página (CRO) y recomendaciones concretas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin d''une analyse avancée d''optimisation du taux de conversion de page (CRO) et de recommandations concrètes.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Analyse der Optimierung der Seitenkonversionsrate (CRO) und handhabbare Empfehlungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de análise avançada de Otimização da Taxa de Conversão de Página (CRO) e recomendações eficazes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым требуется продвинутый анализ оптимизации коэффициента конверсии страниц (CRO) и действенные рекомендации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم لتحسين معدل تحويل الصفحة (CRO) وتوصيات قابلة للتنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages, identify optimization opportunities, and provide data-driven recommendations using product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and optimizing page elements for improved conversion rates.","zh":"赋予代理分析营销页面、识别优化机会并使用产品营销上下文（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件）提供数据驱动的建议，并优化页面元素以提高转化率。","ja":"エージェントがマーケティングページを分析し、最適化の機会を特定し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルからの製品マーケティングコンテキストを使用して、データ駆動の推奨事項を提供し、コンバージョンレートの向上のためにページ要素を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 마케팅 페이지를 분석하고 최적화 기회를 식별하고 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일의 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 사용하여 데이터 주도적인 제안을 제공하고 전환률 향상을 위한 페이지 요소를 최적화 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar páginas de marketing, identificar oportunidades de optimización y proporcionar recomendaciones basadas en datos utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y optimizando los elementos de la página para mejorar las tasas de conversión.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les pages de marketing, d''identifier les opportunités d''optimisation et de fournir des recommandations basées sur les données en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits à partir de fichiers comme `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en optimisant les éléments de page pour améliorer les taux de conversion.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Marketingseiten zu analysieren, Optimierungschancen zu identifizieren und datenbasierte Empfehlungen unter Verwendung des Produktmarketingkontexts aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` bereitzustellen und Seitenelemente für verbesserte Konversionsraten zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar páginas de marketing, identificar oportunidades de otimização e fornecer recomendações baseadas em dados usando o contexto de marketing de produto de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e otimizando elementos de página para melhorar as taxas de conversão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать маркетинговые страницы, выявлять возможности оптимизации и предоставлять рекомендации, основанные на данных, с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и оптимизации элементов страницы для улучшения коэффициентов конверсии.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحليل صفحات التسويق، وتحديد فرص التحسين، وتقديم توصيات قائمة على البيانات باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وتحسين عناصر الصفحة لتحسين معدلات التحويل."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing marketing pages for conversion rate optimization opportunities","Generating actionable recommendations for page improvement","Identifying key page elements for CRO analysis"],"zh":["分析营销页面以查找转化率优化机会","为页面改进生成可行建议","识别关键页面元素以进行CRO分析"],"ja":["コンバージョンレート最適化の機会を探すためにマーケティングページを分析する","ページの改善のための実行可能な推奨事項を生成する","CRO分析のための重要なページ要素を特定する"],"ko":["전환률 최적화 기회를 찾기 위해 마케팅 페이지를 분석하는 것","페이지 개선을 위한 실행 가능한 제안을 생성하는 것","CRO 분석을 위한 중요한 페이지 요소를 식별하는 것"],"es":["Análisis de páginas de marketing para oportunidades de optimización de la tasa de conversión","Generación de recomendaciones concretas para la mejora de la página","Identificación de elementos clave de la página para el análisis de CRO"],"fr":["Analyse de pages de marketing pour les opportunités d''optimisation du taux de conversion","Génération de recommandations concrètes pour l''amélioration de la page","Identification des éléments clés de la page pour l''analyse de CRO"],"de":["Analyse von Marketingseiten für Chancen zur Optimierung der Konversionsrate","Erzeugung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen für die Verbesserung der Seite","Identifizierung von Schlüsselelementen der Seite für die CRO-Analyse"],"pt":["Analisar páginas de marketing para oportunidades de otimização da taxa de conversão","Gerar recomendações eficazes para melhoria da página","Identificar elementos-chave da página para análise de CRO"],"ru":["Анализ маркетинговых страниц для выявления возможностей оптимизации коэффициента конверсии","Генерация действенных рекомендаций для улучшения страницы","Выявление ключевых элементов страницы для анализа CRO"],"ar":["تحليل صفحات التسويق لفرص تحسين معدل التحويل","توليد توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين الصفحة","تحديد عناصر الصفحة الرئيسية لتحليل CRO"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limited to analyzing marketing pages for CRO"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销上下文文件，例如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","仅限于分析营销页面以进行CRO"],"ja":["`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などの製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルにアクセスする必要がある","CROのためにマーケティングページを分析することのみに限定される"],"ko":["`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일에 접근해야 함","CRO를 위해 마케팅 페이지를 분석하는 것만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limitado al análisis de páginas de marketing para CRO"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits comme `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limité à l''analyse de pages de marketing pour CRO"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Produktmarketingkontextdateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Marketingseiten für CRO"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produto como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limitado à análise de páginas de marketing para CRO"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Ограничен анализом маркетинговых страниц для CRO"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","محدود بتحليل صفحات التسويق لتحسين معدل التحويل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b9d4d2e37d7c90ad73ff1b56c58ef2a92cfdc4f2a4a104941c17ed684f84022e","qualityScore":41}');
