й доступ"],"ar":["تحميل الملفات","تنزيل الملفات","تخزين الملفات السحابية","أمان البيانات","دخول سهل وسريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云架构师","AI工具","文件存储","文件管理","云存储","如何使用云架构师","云架构师教程","云架构师安装","云架构师设置指南"],"ja":["クラウドアーキテクト","AIエージェント","ファイルストレージ","ファイル管理","クラウドストレージ","クラウドアーキテクトの使い方","クラウドアーキテクトのチュートリアル","クラウドアーキテクトのインストール","クラウドアーキテクトの設定ガイド"],"ko":["클라우드 아키텍트","AI 에이전트","파일 저장소","파일 관리","클라우드 저장소","클라우드 아키텍트 사용법","클라우드 아키텍트 튜토리얼","클라우드 아키텍트 설치","클라우드 아키텍트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar cloud-architect","qué es cloud-architect","alternativas a Google Drive","cloud-architect vs Google Drive","instalación de cloud-architect","guía de configuración de cloud-architect","desarrollo de aplicaciones con cloud-architect"],"fr":["comment utiliser cloud-architect","qu''est-ce que cloud-architect","alternatives à Google Drive","cloud-architect vs Google Drive","installation de cloud-architect","guide de configuration de cloud-architect","développement d''applications avec cloud-architect"],"de":["wie man cloud-architect verwendet","was ist cloud-architect","Alternativen zu Google Drive","cloud-architect vs Google Drive","Installation von cloud-architect","Konfigurationsanleitung für cloud-architect","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit cloud-architect"],"pt":["ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem","armazenamento de arquivos em nuvem","como usar ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem","o que é ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem","ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem vs google drive","instalar ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem","guia de configuração de ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem","ferramenta de arquiteto de nuvem para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор","хранение файлов в облаке","как использовать ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор","что такое ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор","ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор vs google drive","установить ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор","руководство по настройке ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор","ИИ Агент - облачный архитектор для разработчиков"],"ar":["أداة مهندس سحابي","تخزين الملفات السحابية","كيفية استخدام أداة مهندس سحابي","ما هي أداة مهندس سحابي","أداة مهندس سحابي vs درايف جوجل","تثبيت أداة مهندس سحابي","دليل إعداد أداة مهندس سحابي","أداة مهندس سحابي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"D1ngirsu","repo":"MiniDrive","repoPath":"D1ngirsu/MiniDrive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.717Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Use when designing cloud architectures, planning migrations, or optimizing multi-cloud deployments. Invoke for Well-Architected Framework, cost optimization, disaster recovery, landing zones, security architecture, serverless design.","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Architect\n\nSenior cloud architect specializing in multi-cloud strategies, migration patterns, cost optimization, and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior cloud architect with 15+ years of experience designing enterprise cloud solutions. You specialize in multi-cloud architectures, migration strategies (6Rs), cost optimization, security by design, and operational excellence. You design highly available, secure, and cost-effective clo","body":"# Cloud Architect\n\nSenior cloud architect specializing in multi-cloud strategies, migration patterns, cost optimization, and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior cloud architect with 15+ years of experience designing enterprise cloud solutions. You specialize in multi-cloud architectures, migration strategies (6Rs), cost optimization, security by design, and operational excellence. You design highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud infrastructures following Well-Architected Framework principles.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing cloud architectures (AWS, Azure, GCP)\n- Planning cloud migrations and modernization\n- Implementing multi-cloud and hybrid cloud strategies\n- Optimizing cloud costs (right-sizing, reserved instances, spot)\n- Designing for high availability and disaster recovery\n- Implementing cloud security and compliance\n- Setting up landing zones and governance\n- Architecting serverless and container platforms\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Discovery** - Assess current state, requirements, constraints, compliance needs\n2. **Design** - Select services, design topology, plan data architecture\n3. **Security** - Implement zero-trust, identity federation, encryption\n4. **Cost Model** - Right-size resources, reserved capacity, auto-scaling\n5. **Migration** - Apply 6Rs framework, define waves, test failover\n6. **Operate** - Set up monitoring, automation, continuous optimization\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| AWS Services | `references/aws.md` | EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, Well-Architected Framework |\n| Azure Services | `references/azure.md` | VMs, Storage, Functions, SQL, Cloud Adoption Framework |\n| GCP Services | `references/gcp.md` | Compute Engine, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, BigQuery |\n| Multi-Cloud | `references/multi-cloud.md` | Abstraction layers, portability, vendor lock-in mitigation |\n| Cost Optimization | `references/cost.md` | Reserved instances, spot, right-sizing, FinOps practices |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Design for high availability (99.9%+)\n- Implement security by design (zero-trust)\n- Use infrastructure as code (Terraform, CloudFormation)\n- Enable cost allocation tags and monitoring\n- Plan disaster recovery with defined RTO/RPO\n- Implement multi-region for critical workloads\n- Use managed services when possible\n- Document architectural decisions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Store credentials in code or public repos\n- Skip encryption (at rest and in transit)\n- Create single points of failure\n- Ignore cost optimization opportunities\n- Deploy without proper monitoring\n- Use overly complex architectures\n- Ignore compliance requirements\n- Skip disaster recovery testing\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen designing cloud architecture, provide:\n1. Architecture diagram with services and data flow\n2. Service selection rationale (compute, storage, database, networking)\n3. Security architecture (IAM, network segmentation, encryption)\n4. Cost estimation and optimization strategy\n5. Deployment approach and rollback plan\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nAWS (EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, VPC, CloudFront), Azure (VMs, Blob Storage, Functions, SQL Database, VNet), GCP (Compute Engine, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, Cloud SQL), Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, CloudFormation, ARM templates, CI/CD, disaster recovery, cost optimization, security best practices, compliance frameworks (SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS)\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **DevOps Engineer** - CI/CD pipelines and automation\n- **Kubernetes Specialist** - Container orchestration\n- **Terraform Engineer** - Infrastructure as code\n- **Security Reviewer** - Security architecture validation\n- **Microservices Architect** - Cloud-native application patterns\n- **Monitoring Expert** - Observability and alerting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:48:39.193Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing expertise in multi-cloud strategies and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","zh":"非常适合需要在多云策略和云原生架构方面具有专业知识的AI代理，特别是在AWS、Azure和GCP等平台上。","ja":"AWS、Azure、GCPなどのマルチクラウド戦略とクラウドネイティブアーキテクチャに関する専門知識が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"AWS, Azure, GCP와 같은 멀티클라우드 전략 및 클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan experiencia en estrategias de multi-nube y arquitecturas nativas de nube en AWS, Azure y GCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin d''expertise en stratégies multi-nuages et en architectures natives de nuage sur AWS, Azure et GCP.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Multi-Cloud-Strategien und cloud-nativen Architekturen über AWS, Azure und GCP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de especialização em estratégias multi-nuvem e arquiteturas nativas em nuvem em toda a AWS, Azure e GCP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы знания в области стратегий multi-cloud и облачных архитектур на платформах AWS, Azure и GCP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في استراتيجيات متعددة السحاب وعمارة السحاب الأصلي عبر AWS و Azure و GCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud solutions using migration patterns, cost optimization, and security by design, leveraging expertise in 6Rs migration strategies and operational excellence.","zh":"赋予代理设计高可用性、安全性和成本有效的云解决方案的能力，使用迁移模式、成本优化和安全设计，利用6Rs迁移策略和运营卓越的专业知识。","ja":"エージェントが、移行パターン、コスト最適化、セキュリティ設計を使用して、高可用性、セキュリティ、コスト効率の高いクラウドソリューションを設計できるようにします。また、6Rs移行戦略と運用の優れた専門知識を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 마이그레이션 패턴, 비용 최적화, 보안 설계를 사용하여 고가용성, 보안 및 비용 효율적인 클라우드 솔루션을 설계할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 6Rs 마이그레이션 전략 및 운영 우수성을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar soluciones de nube altamente disponibles, seguras y rentables utilizando patrones de migración, optimización de costos y seguridad por diseño, aprovechando la experiencia en estrategias de migración 6Rs y excelencia operativa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des solutions cloud hautement disponibles, sécurisées et rentables en utilisant des modèles de migration, l''optimisation des coûts et la sécurité par conception, en exploitant l''expertise dans les stratégies de migration 6Rs et l''excellence opérationnelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, hochverfügbare, sichere und kosteneffiziente Cloud-Lösungen zu entwerfen, indem sie Migrationsmuster, Kostenoptimierung und Sicherheit durch Design nutzen und Expertenwissen in 6Rs-Migrationsstrategien und operativer Exzellenz nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar soluções de nuvem altamente disponíveis, seguras e rentáveis usando padrões de migração, otimização de custos e segurança por design, aproveitando a especialização em estratégias de migração 6Rs e excelência operacional.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать высокодоступные, безопасные и экономически эффективные облачные решения с использованием шаблонов миграции, оптимизации затрат и безопасности по設計у, используя знания в области стратегий миграции 6Rs и операционного совершенства.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم حلول سحابية عالية التوفر وأمنية وذات كفاءة تكلفتية باستخدام أنماط الهجرة وتحسين التكاليف والأمان من خلال التصميم ، واستخدام الخبرة في استراتيجيات الهجرة 6Rs والتميز التشغيلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-cloud architectures for enterprise solutions","Optimizing cloud costs using cost optimization techniques","Migrating applications to cloud-native architectures using 6Rs strategies"],"zh":["为企业解决方案设计多云架构","使用成本优化技术优化云成本","使用6Rs策略将应用程序迁移到云原生架构"],"ja":["エンタープライズソリューションのマルチクラウドアーキテクチャを設計する","コスト最適化テクニックを使用してクラウドコストを最適化する","6Rs戦略を使用してアプリケーションをクラウドネイティブアーキテクチャに移行する"],"ko":["기업 솔루션을 위한 멀티클라우드 아키텍처 설계","비용 최적화 기법을 사용하여 클라우드 비용 최적화","6Rs 전략을 사용하여 애플리케이션을 클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de multi-nube para soluciones empresariales","Optimizar costos de nube utilizando técnicas de optimización de costos","Migrar aplicaciones a arquitecturas nativas de nube utilizando estrategias 6Rs"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures multi-nuages pour des solutions d''entreprise","Optimiser les coûts de nuage en utilisant des techniques d''optimisation des coûts","Migrer des applications vers des architectures natives de nuage en utilisant des stratégies 6Rs"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Cloud-Architekturen für Unternehmenslösungen","Optimieren von Cloud-Kosten mit Hilfe von Kostenoptimierungstechniken","Migrieren von Anwendungen zu cloud-nativen Architekturen mit Hilfe von 6Rs-Strategien"],"pt":["Projetar arquiteturas de multi-nuvem para soluções empresariais","Otimizar custos de nuvem usando técnicas de otimização de custos","Migrar aplicações para arquiteturas nativas em nuvem usando estratégias 6Rs"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектур multi-cloud для корпоративных решений","Оптимизация затрат на облачные услуги с использованием методов оптимизации затрат","Миграция приложений на облачные архитектуры с использованием стратегий 6Rs"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة متعددة السحاب لحلول الشركات","تحسين تكاليف السحاب باستخدام تقنيات تحسين التكاليف","هجرة التطبيقات إلى هندسة السحاب الأصلي باستخدام استراتيجيات 6Rs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in cloud computing platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Needs understanding of security and compliance in cloud environments","Limited to cloud-related tasks and solutions"],"zh":["需要云计算平台（AWS、Azure、GCP）的专业知识","需要了解云环境中的安全性和合规性","仅限于云相关任务和解决方案"],"ja":["クラウドコンピューティングプラットフォーム（AWS、Azure、GCP）の専門知識が必要","クラウド環境でのセキュリティとコンプライアンスの理解が必要","クラウド関連タスクとソリューションに限定される"],"ko":["클라우드 컴퓨팅 플랫폼(AWS, Azure, GCP)의 전문 지식 필요","클라우드 환경의 보안 및 규정 준수에 대한 이해 필요","클라우드 관련 작업 및 솔루션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en plataformas de computación en nube (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Necesita comprensión de seguridad y cumplimiento en entornos de nube","Limitado a tareas y soluciones relacionadas con la nube"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les plateformes de calcul en nuage (AWS, Azure, GCP)","A besoin d''une compréhension de la sécurité et de la conformité dans les environnements de nuage","Limité aux tâches et solutions liées au nuage"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Cloud-Computing-Plattformen (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Benötigt Verständnis für Sicherheit und Compliance in Cloud-Umgebungen","Begrenzt auf cloud-bezogene Aufgaben und Lösungen"],"pt":["Exige especialização em plataformas de computação em nuvem (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Necessita de compreensão de segurança e conformidade em ambientes de nuvem","Limitado a tarefas e soluções relacionadas à nuvem"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области облачных вычислительных платформ (AWS, Azure, GCP)","Требует понимания вопросов безопасности и соответствия требованиям в облачных средах","Ограничен задачами и решениями, связанными с облачными вычислениями"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في منصات الحوسبة السحابية (AWS و Azure و GCP)","يحتاج إلى فهم للأمان والامتثال في بيئات السحاب","محدود بالمهام والحلول المتعلقة بالسحاب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62ee5a98edb64bfb571f1209cc9636a7fddeacd94f057d594db2ee794d00100d","qualityScore":41}');
