},"description":{"zh":"nav-stats AI智能工具，通过优化会话稳定性，实现会话次数从7次增加到20+，为开发者提供更好的体验","ja":"nav-stats AIエージェントは、会話の安定性を高め、開発者に優れた体験を提供する","ko":"nav-stats AI 에이전트는 세션 안정성을 최적화하여 개발자에게 더好的 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Nav-Stats es una herramienta de AI que permite sesiones más largas y estables, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Nav-Stats est un outil d''IA qui permet des sessions plus longues et plus stables, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Nav-Stats ist ein KI-Tool, das längere und stabilere Sitzungen ermöglicht und die Benutzererfahrung verbessert","pt":"Nav-Stats é uma ferramenta de IA que aprimora a engenharia de contexto para Claude Code, permitindo sessões mais longas e estáveis","ru":"Nav-Stats - это инструмент ИИ, который улучшает контекстную инженерию для Claude Code, позволяя более длинным и стабильным сессиям","ar":"Nav-Stats هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحسن هندسة السياق ل Claude Code، مما يسمح بالجلسات الأطول والأكثر استقرارا","en":"Finish What You Start — Context engineering for Claude Code.         Sessions last 20+ exchanges instead of crashing at 7."},"definition":{"en":"Finish What You Start — Context engineering for Claude Code.         Sessions last 20+ exchanges instead of crashing at 7."},"features":{"zh":["会话次数从7次增加到20+","优化会话稳定性","提高用户体验","适用于Claude Code","支持多轮会话"],"ja":["会話の安定性を高める","会話数を7回から20回以上に増やす","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","Claude Codeに対応","マルチラウンド会話をサポート"],"ko":["세션 안정성을 최적화","세션次数를 7회에서 20회 이상으로 증가","사용자 경험을 개선","Claude Code 지원","다중 라운드 세션 지원"],"es":["Sesiones más largas y estables","Ingeniería de contexto para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Compatibilidad con Claude Code","Mejora de la estabilidad de las sesiones","Soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Sessions plus longues et plus stables","Ingénierie de contexte pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Compatibilité avec Claude Code","Amélioration de la stabilité des sessions","Support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Längere und stabilere Sitzungen","Kontext-Engineering zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Verbesserung der Stabilität von Sitzungen","Unterstützung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Melhora a engenharia de contexto para Claude Code","Permite sessões mais longas e estáveis","Compatível com Claude Code","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","Aumenta a produtividade e a eficiência"],"ru":["Улучшает контекстную инженерию для Claude Code","Позволяет более длинным и стабильным сессиям","Совместим с Claude Code","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Увеличивает производительность и эффективность"],"ar":["تحسن هندسة السياق ل Claude Code","السماح بالجلسات الأطول والأكثر استقرارا","متوافق مع Claude Code","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للdeveloppers","زيادة الإنتاجية والكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","nav-stats","会话稳定性","Claude Code","会话次数优化","用户体验优化","AI工具安装","nav-stats设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","nav-stats","会話の安定性","Claude Code","会話数の最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化","AIエージェントのインストール","nav-statsの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","nav-stats","세션 안정성","Claude Code","세션次数 최적화","사용자 경험 최적화","AI 에이전트 설치","nav-stats 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","Nav-Stats","Claude Code","ingeniería de contexto","sesiones más largas","estabilidad de sesiones","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''IA","Nav-Stats","Claude Code","ingénierie de contexte","sessions plus longues","stabilité des sessions","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Tools","Nav-Stats","Claude Code","Kontext-Engineering","längere Sitzungen","Stabilität von Sitzungen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwickler-Tools","KI für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar Nav-Stats","o que é Nav-Stats","Nav-Stats alternative","Nav-Stats vs Claude Code","instalar Nav-Stats","guia de configuração do Nav-Stats","desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать Nav-Stats","что такое Nav-Stats","Nav-Stats альтернатива","Nav-Stats vs Claude Code","установить Nav-Stats","руководство по настройке Nav-Stats","разработка ИИ","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Nav-Stats","ما هي Nav-Stats","بديل Nav-Stats","Nav-Stats مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت Nav-Stats","دليل إعداد Nav-Stats","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للdeveloppers"]}},"owner":"alekspetrov","repo":"navigator","repoPath":"alekspetrov/navigator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.957Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nav-stats","description":"Display session efficiency report showing token savings, cache performance, and optimization recommendations. Use when user asks show my stats, how efficient am I?, show session metrics, or wants to see Navigators impact.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Navigator Session Statistics Skill\n\nShow real-time efficiency reporting with baseline comparisons, making Navigator''s value quantifiable and shareable.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Says \"show my stats\", \"show session stats\", \"show metrics\"\n- Asks \"how efficient am I?\", \"how much did I save?\"\n- Says \"show my Navigator report\", \"efficiency report\"\n- Wants to see token savings or session performance\n- Says \"show impact\", \"prove Navigator works\"\n\n**DO NOT invoke** if:\n- U","body":"# Navigator Session Statistics Skill\n\nShow real-time efficiency reporting with baseline comparisons, making Navigator''s value quantifiable and shareable.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Says \"show my stats\", \"show session stats\", \"show metrics\"\n- Asks \"how efficient am I?\", \"how much did I save?\"\n- Says \"show my Navigator report\", \"efficiency report\"\n- Wants to see token savings or session performance\n- Says \"show impact\", \"prove Navigator works\"\n\n**DO NOT invoke** if:\n- User just started session (< 5 messages)\n- Navigator not initialized in project\n- User asking about specific metrics only (answer directly)\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n### Step 1: Check Navigator Initialized\n\nVerify Navigator is set up:\n\n```bash\nif [ ! -f \".agent/DEVELOPMENT-README.md\" ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Navigator not initialized in this project\"\n  echo \"Run ''Initialize Navigator'' first\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 2: Run Enhanced Session Stats\n\nExecute the enhanced session statistics script:\n\n```bash\n# Check if enhanced script exists\nif [ ! -f \"scripts/session-stats.sh\" ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Session stats script not found\"\n  echo \"This feature requires Navigator v3.5.0+\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\n# Run stats script\nbash scripts/session-stats.sh\n```\n\nThis script outputs shell-parseable variables:\n- `BASELINE_TOKENS` - Total size of all .agent/ docs\n- `LOADED_TOKENS` - Actually loaded in session (estimated)\n- `TOKENS_SAVED` - Difference\n- `SAVINGS_PERCENT` - Percentage saved\n- `EFFICIENCY_SCORE` - 0-100 score\n- `CACHE_EFFICIENCY` - From OpenTelemetry\n- `CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT` - Estimated context fill\n- `TIME_SAVED_MINUTES` - Estimated time saved\n\n### Step 3: Calculate Efficiency Score\n\nUse predefined function to calculate score:\n\n```bash\n# Extract metrics from session-stats.sh\nsource <(bash scripts/session-stats.sh)\n\n# Calculate efficiency score using predefined function\nEFFICIENCY_SCORE=$(python3 skills/nav-stats/functions/efficiency_scorer.py \\\n  --tokens-saved-percent ${SAVINGS_PERCENT} \\\n  --cache-efficiency ${CACHE_EFFICIENCY} \\\n  --context-usage ${CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT})\n```\n\n### Step 4: Format and Display Report\n\nUse predefined function to format visual report:\n\n```bash\n# Generate formatted report\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/report_formatter.py \\\n  --baseline ${BASELINE_TOKENS} \\\n  --loaded ${LOADED_TOKENS} \\\n  --saved ${TOKENS_SAVED} \\\n  --savings-percent ${SAVINGS_PERCENT} \\\n  --cache-efficiency ${CACHE_EFFICIENCY} \\\n  --context-usage ${CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT} \\\n  --efficiency-score ${EFFICIENCY_SCORE} \\\n  --time-saved ${TIME_SAVED_MINUTES}\n```\n\n**Output Format**:\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║          NAVIGATOR EFFICIENCY REPORT                 ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n📊 TOKEN USAGE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nDocumentation loaded:        12,000 tokens\nBaseline (all docs):        150,000 tokens\nTokens saved:               138,000 tokens (92% ↓)\n\n💾 CACHE PERFORMANCE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nCache efficiency:              100.0% (perfect)\n\n📈 SESSION METRICS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nContext usage:                      35% (excellent)\nEfficiency score:                94/100 (excellent)\n\n⏱️  TIME SAVED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nEstimated time saved:          ~42 minutes\n\n💡 WHAT THIS MEANS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nNavigator loaded 92% fewer tokens than loading all docs.\nYour context window is 65% available for actual work.\n\n🎯 RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ Excellent efficiency - keep using lazy-loading strategy\n✅ Context usage healthy - plenty of room for work\n\nShare your efficiency: Take a screenshot! #ContextEfficiency\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Context-Specific Recommendations\n\nBased on efficiency score, provide actionable advice:\n\n**If efficiency_score < 70**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Token savings below target (70%+)\n→ Check: Are you loading more docs than needed?\n→ Tip: Use navigator to find docs, don''t load all upfront\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/CONTEXT-EFFICIENCY.md\n```\n\n**If context_usage > 80%**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Context usage high (80%+)\n→ Consider: Create context marker and compact\n→ Tip: Compact after completing sub-tasks\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/ANTI-PATTERNS.md\n```\n\n**If cache_efficiency < 80%**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Cache efficiency low (<80%)\n→ Check: CLAUDE.md properly configured?\n→ Tip: Ensure prompt caching enabled\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/PATTERNS.md (Caching pattern)\n```\n\n## Predefined Functions\n\n### `efficiency_scorer.py`\n\nCalculate Navigator efficiency score (0-100) based on:\n- Token savings (40 points)\n- Cache efficiency (30 points)\n- Context usage (30 points)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/efficiency_scorer.py \\\n  --tokens-saved-percent 92 \\\n  --cache-efficiency 100 \\\n  --context-usage 35\n```\n\n**Output**: `94` (integer score)\n\n### `report_formatter.py`\n\nFormat efficiency metrics into visual, shareable report.\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/report_formatter.py \\\n  --baseline 150000 \\\n  --loaded 12000 \\\n  --saved 138000 \\\n  --savings-percent 92 \\\n  --cache-efficiency 100 \\\n  --context-usage 35 \\\n  --efficiency-score 94 \\\n  --time-saved 42\n```\n\n**Output**: Formatted ASCII report (see Step 4)\n\n## Philosophy Integration\n\n**Context Engineering Principle**: Measurement validates optimization\n\nFrom `.agent/philosophy/PATTERNS.md`:\n> \"Measure to validate. Navigator tracks real metrics, not estimates.\"\n\nThis skill proves:\n- **Token savings** are real (baseline comparison)\n- **Cache efficiency** works (OpenTelemetry data)\n- **Context usage** is healthy (window not overloaded)\n- **Time saved** is quantifiable (6s per 1k tokens)\n\n## User Experience\n\n**User says**: \"Show my stats\"\n\n**Skill displays**:\n1. Visual efficiency report\n2. Clear metrics (tokens, cache, context)\n3. Interpretation (\"What this means\")\n4. Actionable recommendations\n\n**User can**:\n- Screenshot and share (#ContextEfficiency)\n- Understand Navigator''s impact\n- Optimize workflow based on recommendations\n- Validate context engineering principles\n\n## Example Output Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Excellent Efficiency (Score 94)\n\nUser following lazy-loading pattern, cache working perfectly:\n- 92% token savings ✅\n- 100% cache efficiency ✅\n- 35% context usage ✅\n- Score: 94/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Keep it up! Share your efficiency.\n\n### Scenario 2: Fair Efficiency (Score 72)\n\nUser loading too many docs upfront:\n- 65% token savings ⚠️\n- 95% cache efficiency ✅\n- 55% context usage ✅\n- Score: 72/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Review lazy-loading strategy. Load docs on-demand.\n\n### Scenario 3: Poor Efficiency (Score 48)\n\nUser not using Navigator patterns:\n- 45% token savings ❌\n- 70% cache efficiency ⚠️\n- 85% context usage ❌\n- Score: 48/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Read philosophy docs. Consider /nav:compact. Review CLAUDE.md.\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n**After using this skill, users should**:\n- Understand their efficiency score\n- See quantified token savings\n- Know what to improve (if anything)\n- Feel motivated to share results\n\n**Long-term impact**:\n- Users screenshot reports and share\n- \"Navigator saved me 138k tokens\" becomes common\n- Efficiency becomes visible, not abstract\n- Continuous improvement through measurement\n\n---\n\n**This skill makes Navigator''s value tangible and shareable.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:20.217Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents like Claude Code needing real-time efficiency reporting and session statistics analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要实时效率报告和会话统计分析的对话式代理，如Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなリアルタイムの効率性レポートとセッション統計分析が必要な会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 실시간 효율성 보고 및 세션 통계 분석이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Conversacionales como Claude Code que necesitan informes de eficiencia en tiempo real y análisis de estadísticas de sesión.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Conversationnels comme Claude Code nécessitant des rapports d''efficacité en temps réel et une analyse de statistiques de session.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents wie Claude Code, die Echtzeit-Effizienzberichte und Sitzungsstatistikenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de conversação como Claude Code que necessitam de relatórios de eficiência em tempo real e análise de estatísticas de sessão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разговорных агентов, таких как Claude Code, требующих отчетов о эффективности в реальном времени и анализа статистики сессий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الحواريين مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى تقارير عن الكفاءة في الوقت الفعلي وتحليل إحصائيات الجلسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide quantifiable value through baseline comparisons and token savings metrics, utilizing natural language processing to generate shareable Navigator reports and efficiency metrics via protocols like HTTP or WebSocket.","zh":"使代理能够通过基线比较和令牌节省指标提供可量化的价值，利用自然语言处理生成可共享的Navigator报告和通过HTTP或WebSocket等协议的效率指标。","ja":"エージェントがベースライン比較やトークン節約メトリクスを通じて定量化可能な価値を提供できるようにし、自然言語処理を利用して共有可能なNavigatorレポートやHTTPまたはWebSocketなどのプロトコルを介した効率メトリクスを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 기준선 비교 및 토큰 절약 지표를 통해 정량화 가능한 가치를 제공할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 처리를 사용하여 공유 가능한 Navigator 보고서 및 HTTP 또는 WebSocket와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 효율성 지표를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar un valor cuantificable a través de comparaciones de referencia y métricas de ahorro de tokens, utilizando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural para generar informes de Navigator compartibles y métricas de eficiencia a través de protocolos como HTTP o WebSocket.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir une valeur quantifiable grâce à des comparaisons de référence et des métriques d''économie de jetons, en utilisant le traitement du langage naturel pour générer des rapports de Navigator partageables et des métriques d''efficacité via des protocoles tels que HTTP ou WebSocket.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einen quantifizierbaren Wert durch Referenzvergleiche und Token-Sparmetriken zu bieten, indem sie die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache nutzen, um teilbare Navigator-Berichte und Effizienzmetriken über Protokolle wie HTTP oder WebSocket zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer valor quantificável por meio de comparações de linha de base e métricas de economia de tokens, utilizando processamento de linguagem natural para gerar relatórios do Navigator compartilháveis e métricas de eficiência por meio de protocolos como HTTP ou WebSocket.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять количественную ценность посредством сравнений базовой линии и метрик экономии токенов, используя обработку естественного языка для генерации отчетов Navigator, которые можно共делить, и метрик эффективности через протоколы, такие как HTTP или WebSocket.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقديم قيمة قابلة للقياس من خلال مقارنات الخط الأساسي وأرقام توفير الرموز، باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية لتوليد تقارير Navigator قابلة للمشاركة وأرقام الكفاءة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP أو WebSocket."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating real-time session performance reports","Calculating token savings for Navigator sessions","Comparing baseline efficiency metrics"],"zh":["生成实时会话性能报告","计算Navigator会话的令牌节省","比较基线效率指标"],"ja":["リアルタイムのセッションパフォーマンスレポートを生成する","Navigatorセッションのトークン節約を計算する","ベースライン効率メトリクスを比較する"],"ko":["실시간 세션 성능 보고서를 생성하는 것","Navigator 세션의 토큰 절약을 계산하는 것","기준선 효율성 지표를 비교하는 것"],"es":["Generación de informes de rendimiento de sesión en tiempo real","Cálculo de ahorro de tokens para sesiones de Navigator","Comparación de métricas de eficiencia de referencia"],"fr":["Génération de rapports de performance de session en temps réel","Calcul de l''économie de jetons pour les sessions de Navigator","Comparaison des métriques d''efficacité de référence"],"de":["Generierung von Echtzeit-Sitzungsleistungsberichten","Berechnung von Token-Einsparungen für Navigator-Sitzungen","Vergleich von Referenz-Effizienzmetriken"],"pt":["Gerar relatórios de desempenho de sessão em tempo real","Calcular economia de tokens para sessões do Navigator","Comparar métricas de eficiência de linha de base"],"ru":["Генерировать отчеты о производительности сессий в реальном времени","Рассчитывать экономию токенов для сессий Navigator","Сравнивать метрики эффективности базовой линии"],"ar":["توليد تقارير أداء الجلسة في الوقت الفعلي","حساب توفير الرموز للجلسات Navigator","مقارنة معايير الكفاءة الأساسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with Navigator''s context engineering","Limited to text-based input and output"],"zh":["需要与Navigator的上下文工程集成","仅限于基于文本的输入和输出"],"ja":["Navigatorのコンテキストエンジニアリングとの統合が必要","テキストベースの入力と出力のみに限定される"],"ko":["Navigator의 컨텍스트 엔지니어링과 통합해야 함","텍스트 기반 입력 및 출력만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con la ingeniería de contexto de Navigator","Limitado a entrada y salida de texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''ingénierie de contexte de Navigator","Limité à l''entrée et à la sortie de texte"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit der Kontext-Engineering von Navigator","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Eingabe und Ausgabe"],"pt":["Requer integração com a engenharia de contexto do Navigator","Limitado a entrada e saída baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с контекстной инженерией Navigator","Ограничен вводом и выводом на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع هندسة السياق Navigator","محدود بالمدخلات والمخرجات القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"534fdddf7028538dba06aebd55a07bf26a7587bc151eb4c4ff8737c19678f3c8","qualityScore":41}');
