n и Node.js","Автоматический запуск тестов","Дetailed отчеты о тестах","Поддержка CLI для автоматизации тестов"],"ar":["دمج مع إطارات الاختبار الشهيرة","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js","تشغيل تلقائي للاختبارات","تقارير مفصلة عن الاختبارات","دعم CLI لتحسين الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["e2e测试工具","AI智能代理","代码质量检查","自动化测试","如何使用e2e测试","e2e测试与单元测试","e2e测试安装","e2e测试设置"],"ja":["e2eテストツール","AIエージェント","コード品質チェック","自動テスト","e2eテストの使い方","e2eテストとユニットテスト","e2eテストインストール","e2eテスト設定"],"ko":["e2e 테스트 도구","AI 에이전트","코드 품질 검사","자동화 테스트","e2e 테스트 사용법","e2e 테스트와 유닛 테스트","e2e 테스트 설치","e2e 테스트 설정"],"es":["pruebas de extremo a extremo","Agentes de IA para testing","cómo usar Agentes de IA para pruebas","pruebas automáticas de software","herramientas de testing de extremo a extremo","alternativas a Selenium","Guía de instalación de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["tests de bout en bout","Agents IA pour les tests","comment utiliser les Agents IA pour les tests","tests automatisés de logiciel","outils de test de bout en bout","alternatives à Selenium","Guide d''installation des Agents IA"],"de":["End-to-End-Tests","KI-Agents für Testing","wie man KI-Agents für Tests verwendet","automatisierte Softwaretests","Tools für End-to-End-Testing","Alternativen zu Selenium","Installationsanleitung für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar e2e-testing","o que é e2e-testing","e2e-testing vs unittest","instalar e2e-testing","guia de configuração do e2e-testing","alternativas para e2e-testing","e2e-testing para desenvolvedores","e2e-testing em Python","e2e-testing em Node.js"],"ru":["как использовать e2e-testing","что такое e2e-testing","e2e-testing vs unittest","установить e2e-testing","руководство по настройке e2e-testing","альтернативы для e2e-testing","e2e-testing для разработчиков","e2e-testing на Python","e2e-testing на Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","ما هو اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية مقابل unittest","تثبيت اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","دليل إعداد اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","بديل لاختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية للمطورين","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية في Python","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية في Node.js"]}},"owner":"mgreenly","repo":"ikigai","repoPath":"mgreenly/ikigai","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T03:51:05Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"e2e-testing","description":"JSON-based end-to-end test format, runner, and mock provider","bodyPreview":"# End-to-End Testing\n\nEnd-to-end tests verify ikigai behavior through its control socket. For `ikigai-ctl` usage, see `/load ikigai-ctl`. For general headless interaction, see `/load headless`.\n\n## Test Files\n\nTests live in `tests/e2e/` as self-contained JSON files. Run order is defined by `tests/e2e/index.json` — a JSON array of test filenames in execution order.\n\n## Execution Modes\n\n| Mode | Backend | Steps | Assertions |\n|------|---------|-------|------------|\n| **mock** | `bin/mock-provider`","body":"# End-to-End Testing\n\nEnd-to-end tests verify ikigai behavior through its control socket. For `ikigai-ctl` usage, see `/load ikigai-ctl`. For general headless interaction, see `/load headless`.\n\n## Test Files\n\nTests live in `tests/e2e/` as self-contained JSON files. Run order is defined by `tests/e2e/index.json` — a JSON array of test filenames in execution order.\n\n## Execution Modes\n\n| Mode | Backend | Steps | Assertions |\n|------|---------|-------|------------|\n| **mock** | `bin/mock-provider` | all steps including `mock_expect` | `assert` + `assert_mock` |\n| **live** | real provider (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google) | `mock_expect` steps skipped | `assert` only |\n\nTests are written once and run in either mode. In live mode, `mock_expect` steps are skipped and `assert_mock` is not evaluated.\n\n## JSON Schema\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"human-readable test name\",\n  \"steps\": [ ... ],\n  \"assert\": [ ... ],\n  \"assert_mock\": [ ... ]\n}\n```\n\n- **`name`** — describes what the test verifies\n- **`steps`** — ordered list of actions to execute\n- **`assert`** — assertions checked in ALL modes\n- **`assert_mock`** — assertions checked only in mock mode\n\n## Step Types\n\n### `send_keys`\n\n```json\n{\"send_keys\": \"/model gpt-5-mini\\\\r\"}\n```\n\nInclude `\\\\r` to submit. See `/load ikigai-ctl` for escaping conventions.\n\n### `read_framebuffer`\n\n```json\n{\"read_framebuffer\": true}\n```\n\nAlways `read_framebuffer` before asserting. Each capture replaces the previous one.\n\n### `wait`\n\n```json\n{\"wait\": 0.5}\n```\n\n- After UI commands (`/model`, `/clear`): 0.5 seconds\n- After sending a prompt to the LLM: 3-5 seconds (prefer `wait_idle`)\n\n### `wait_idle`\n\nWait until the agent becomes idle or timeout elapses.\n\n```json\n{\"wait_idle\": 10000}\n```\n\n- Value is `timeout_ms` (integer milliseconds)\n- Exit code 0 = idle; exit code 1 = timed out (report FAIL)\n- Use instead of `wait` after sending prompts to the LLM\n\n### `mock_expect`\n\nConfigure the mock provider''s response queue. **Skipped in live mode.**\n\n```json\n{\"mock_expect\": {\"responses\": [{\"content\": \"The capital of France is Paris.\"}]}}\n```\n\nThe `responses` array is a FIFO queue — each LLM request pops the next entry. Entries contain either `content` (text) or `tool_calls` (array), never both. Must appear before the `send_keys` that triggers the LLM call.\n\n## Assertion Types\n\nAssertions run against the most recent `read_framebuffer` capture.\n\n### `contains`\n\nAt least one row contains the given substring.\n\n```json\n{\"contains\": \"gpt-5-mini\"}\n```\n\n### `not_contains`\n\nNo row contains the given substring.\n\n```json\n{\"not_contains\": \"error\"}\n```\n\n### `line_prefix`\n\nAt least one row starts with the given prefix (after trimming leading whitespace).\n\n```json\n{\"line_prefix\": \"●\"}\n```\n\n## Running Tests\n\n**Direct execution, one tool call per step.** Never use scripts or programmatic wrappers when the user asks you to run e2e tests. The scripted runner (`tests/e2e/runner`) exists for CI — when the user asks you to run tests, they want direct execution so they can observe every response.\n\n### Procedure per test file:\n\n1. Read the JSON file\n2. Determine mode — mock if ikigai is connected to `mock-provider`, live otherwise\n3. Execute each step in order, one tool call per step:\n   - `send_keys`: run `ikigai-ctl send_keys \"<value>\"`\n   - `wait`: `sleep N`\n   - `wait_idle`: run `ikigai-ctl wait_idle <value>`, fail if exit code is 1\n   - `read_framebuffer`: run `ikigai-ctl read_framebuffer`, store result\n   - `mock_expect`: in mock mode, `curl -s 127.0.0.1:<port>/_mock/expect -d ''<json>''`; in live mode, skip\n4. Evaluate assertions (`assert` always, `assert_mock` in mock mode only)\n5. Report **PASS** or **FAIL** with evidence (cite relevant framebuffer rows)\n\n### Large batches (20+ tests)\n\nDivide into chunks of 20, run sub-agents **serially** (shared instance — never parallel). Each sub-agent receives filenames and the full contents of this skill. Don''t pre-read test files yourself.\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- **Never start ikigai** — the user manages the instance\n- **Never use the runner script** — direct execution only\n- **One test file = one test** — self-contained, no dependencies\n- **Steps execute in order** — sequential, never parallel\n- **Always read_framebuffer before asserting**\n- **Never chain after wait_idle** — run `read_framebuffer` in a separate tool call\n\n## Example: UI-only test\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"no model indicator on fresh start\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"read_framebuffer\": true}\n  ],\n  \"assert\": [\n    {\"contains\": \"(no model)\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Example: mock provider test\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"basic chat completion via mock provider\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"mock_expect\": {\"responses\": [{\"content\": \"The capital of France is Paris.\"}]}},\n    {\"send_keys\": \"What is the capital of France?\\\\r\"},\n    {\"wait\": 3},\n    {\"read_framebuffer\": true}\n  ],\n  \"assert\": [\n    {\"line_prefix\": \"●\"}\n  ],\n  \"assert_mock\": [\n    {\"contains\": \"The capital of France is Paris.\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:25:59.108Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents requiring comprehensive end-to-end testing capabilities through control sockets and headless interactions.","zh":"适用于需要通过控制套接字和无头交互进行全面端到端测试能力的AI编码代理。","ja":"制御ソケットとヘッドレスインタラクションを介した包括的なエンドツーエンドテスト機能を必要とするAIコーディングエージェントに適しています。","ko":"제어 소켓 및 헤드리스 상호 작용을 통해 종합적인 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 기능이 필요한 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA que requieren capacidades de prueba integral de extremo a extremo a través de sockets de control y interacciones sin cabeza.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA nécessitant des capacités de test complètes de bout en bout via des sockets de contrôle et des interactions sans tête.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agents, die umfassende End-to-End-Testfunktionen über Kontrollsockets und headless Interaktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação de IA que exigem capacidades de teste abrangentes de ponta a ponta por meio de soquetes de controle e interações headless.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, требующих всесторонних возможностей тестирования от начала до конца через контрольные сокеты и безголовые взаимодействия.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز الاصطناعي الذي يتطلب إمكانيات اختبار شاملة من النهاية إلى النهاية من خلال مقابس التحكم والتفاعلات دون رأس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify ikigai behavior using JSON test files and execute tests in mock mode with bin/mock-provider, enabling robust test automation and validation through control sockets and assertions.","zh":"赋予代理使用JSON测试文件验证ikigai行为的能力，并使用bin/mock-provider在模拟模式下执行测试，从而通过控制套接字和断言实现强大的测试自动化和验证。","ja":"エージェントに、JSONテストファイルを使用してikigaiの動作を検証し、bin/mock-providerを使用してモックモードでテストを実行する機能を提供し、制御ソケットとアサーションを介した強力なテスト自動化と検証を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 테스트 파일을 사용하여 ikigai 동작을 검증하고 bin/mock-provider를 사용하여 모의 모드에서 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 제어 소켓과 어설션을 통해 강력한 테스트 자동화 및 검증을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar el comportamiento ikigai utilizando archivos de prueba JSON y ejecutar pruebas en modo de simulación con bin/mock-provider, lo que permite una automatización y validación de pruebas robustas a través de sockets de control y afirmaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier le comportement ikigai en utilisant des fichiers de test JSON et d''exécuter des tests en mode de simulation avec bin/mock-provider, ce qui permet une automatisation et une validation de tests robustes via des sockets de contrôle et des assertions.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das ikigai-Verhalten mithilfe von JSON-Testdateien zu überprüfen und Tests im Mock-Modus mit bin/mock-provider auszuführen, wodurch eine robuste Testautomatisierung und -validierung über Kontrollsockets und Assertions ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar o comportamento ikigai usando arquivos de teste JSON e executar testes no modo mock com bin/mock-provider, permitindo uma automação de teste robusta e validação por meio de soquetes de controle e afirmações.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить поведение ikigai с помощью файлов тестирования JSON и выполнить тесты в режиме mock с bin/mock-provider, обеспечивая прочную автоматизацию тестирования и проверку через контрольные сокеты и утверждения.","ar":"يمكّن العملاء من التحقق من سلوك ikigai باستخدام ملفات اختبار JSON وتنفيذ الاختبارات في وضع المحاكاة مع bin/mock-provider، وتمكين التأكيد الآلي للاختبار والتحقق من خلال مقابس التحكم والتحقق"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing end-to-end tests through ikigai-ctl","Validating test files in tests/e2e/","Debugging test failures in mock execution mode"],"zh":["通过ikigai-ctl执行端到端测试","在tests/e2e/中验证测试文件","在模拟执行模式下调试测试失败"],"ja":["ikigai-ctlを使用したエンドツーエンドテストの実行","tests/e2e/内のテストファイルの検証","モック実行モードでのテスト失敗のデバッグ"],"ko":["ikigai-ctl을 사용한 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 실행","tests/e2e/ 내의 테스트 파일 검증","모의 실행 모드에서의 테스트 실패 디버깅"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas de extremo a extremo a través de ikigai-ctl","Validar archivos de prueba en tests/e2e/","Depurar fallos de prueba en modo de ejecución de simulación"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests de bout en bout via ikigai-ctl","Valider des fichiers de test dans tests/e2e/","Déboguer les échecs de test en mode d''exécution de simulation"],"de":["Ausführen von End-to-End-Tests über ikigai-ctl","Validieren von Testdateien in tests/e2e/","Fehler bei Testausführungen im Mock-Modus debuggen"],"pt":["Executando testes de ponta a ponta por meio de ikigai-ctl","Validando arquivos de teste em tests/e2e/","Depurando falhas de teste no modo de execução mock"],"ru":["Выполнение тестов от начала до конца через ikigai-ctl","Проверка файлов тестирования в tests/e2e/","Отладка сбоев тестирования в режиме mock-выполнения"],"ar":["تنفيذ اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية من خلال ikigai-ctl","التحقق من صحة ملفات الاختبار في tests/e2e/","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار في وضع التنفيذ المحاكى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ikigai-ctl usage","Limited to JSON test files in tests/e2e/","Backend restricted to mock mode with bin/mock-provider"],"zh":["需要ikigai-ctl的使用","仅限tests/e2e/中的JSON测试文件","后端仅限于bin/mock-provider的模拟模式"],"ja":["ikigai-ctlの使用が必要","tests/e2e/内のJSONテストファイルのみ","バックエンドはbin/mock-providerのモックモードのみ"],"ko":["ikigai-ctl의 사용이 필요","tests/e2e/ 내의 JSON 테스트 파일만","백엔드는 bin/mock-provider의 모의 모드만"],"es":["Requiere el uso de ikigai-ctl","Limitado a archivos de prueba JSON en tests/e2e/","Backend restringido al modo de simulación con bin/mock-provider"],"fr":["Nécessite l''utilisation de ikigai-ctl","Limité aux fichiers de test JSON dans tests/e2e/","Backend restreint au mode de simulation avec bin/mock-provider"],"de":["Erfordert die Verwendung von ikigai-ctl","Begrenzt auf JSON-Testdateien in tests/e2e/","Backend beschränkt auf Mock-Modus mit bin/mock-provider"],"pt":["Exige o uso de ikigai-ctl","Limitado a arquivos de teste JSON em tests/e2e/","Backend restrito ao modo mock com bin/mock-provider"],"ru":["Требует использования ikigai-ctl","Ограничен файлами тестирования JSON в tests/e2e/","Бэкэнд ограничен режимом mock с bin/mock-provider"],"ar":["يتطلب استخدام ikigai-ctl","محدود بملفات اختبار JSON في tests/e2e/","الخلفية مقيدة بنمط المحاكاة مع bin/mock-provider"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d8f9da4f6a8ca6710317fb6f64dfbcd14ed9093a6e6ef70d8454f1fb3d4546ec","qualityScore":40}');
