ローカルのGitHubナレッジベースを管理し、GitHub検索機能を提供するために使用されます。環境変数を設定することで、プライベートリポジトリへのアクセスが可能","ko":"GitHub-KB 스킬은 로컬 GitHub 지식庫를 관리하고 GitHub 검색 기능을 제공하기 위해 사용됩니다. 환경 변수를 설정하면 프라이ベ이트 저장소에 접근할 수 있습니다","es":"La base de conocimiento de GitHub es una herramienta para gestionar y buscar proyectos de GitHub de forma local","fr":"La base de connaissances GitHub est un outil pour gérer et rechercher des projets GitHub de manière locale","de":"Die GitHub-Wissensbasis ist ein Tool zum Verwalten und Suchen von GitHub-Projekten auf lokaler Ebene","pt":"O skill github-kb permite gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub e fornecer funcionalidades de busca via gh CLI","ru":"Навык github-kb позволяет управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub и предоставлять возможности поиска через gh CLI","ar":"تمكن مهارة github-kb من إدارة قاعدة معرفة جيثب محلية وتوفير إمكانيات البحث عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","en":"All versions of all skills that are on clawdhub.com archived"},"definition":{"en":"All versions of all skills that are on clawdhub.com archived"},"features":{"zh":["管理本地GitHub知识库","通过gh CLI提供GitHub搜索功能","支持私有仓库访问","设置环境变量","支持GITHUB_TOKEN和GITHUB_KB_PATH变量"],"ja":["ローカルのGitHubナレッジベースを管理","gh CLI経由でGitHub検索機能を提供","プライベートリポジトリへのアクセスをサポート","環境変数を設定","GITHUB_TOKENとGITHUB_KB_PATH変数をサポート"],"ko":["로컬 GitHub 지식庫를 관리","gh CLI를 통해 GitHub 검색 기능을 제공","프라이베이트 저장소에 접근","환경 변수를 설정","GITHUB_TOKEN과 GITHUB_KB_PATH 변수를 지원"],"es":["Administración de base de conocimiento local de GitHub","Búsqueda en GitHub mediante gh CLI","Configuración de variables de entorno para acceso a repositorios privados","Soporte para tokens de acceso personales de GitHub","Catálogo de proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md"],"fr":["Gestion d''une base de connaissances locale GitHub","Recherche sur GitHub via gh CLI","Configuration des variables d''environnement pour l''accès aux dépôts privés","Prise en charge des jetons d''accès personnels GitHub","Catalogue de projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md"],"de":["Verwaltung einer lokalen GitHub-Wissensbasis","Suche in GitHub über gh CLI","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys","Unterstützung für persönliche GitHub-Zugriffstoken","Katalog von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de base de conhecimento local do GitHub","Busca via gh CLI","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente","Suporte a repositórios privados com token de acesso pessoal","Catalogação de projetos com descrições breves"],"ru":["Управление локальной базой знаний GitHub","Поиск через gh CLI","Настройка переменных окружения","Поддержка приватных репозиториев с личным токеном доступа","Каталогизация проектов с краткими описаниями"],"ar":["إدارة قاعدة معرفة جيثب محلية","البحث عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","تكوين متغيرات البيئة","دعم المستودعات الخاصة بالرمز الشخصي","فهرسة المشاريع مع_descriptions قصيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub知识库","GitHub-KB","gh CLI","私有仓库","环境变量","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ja":["GitHubナレッジベース","GitHub-KB","gh CLI","プライベートリポジトリ","環境変数","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ko":["GitHub 지식庫","GitHub-KB","gh CLI","프라이베이트 저장소","환경 변수","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"es":["GitHub","base de conocimiento","gh CLI","repositorios privados","tokens de acceso","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["GitHub","base de connaissances","gh CLI","dépôts privés","jetons d''accès","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["GitHub","Wissensbasis","gh CLI","private Repositorys","Zugriffstoken","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["github kb","base de conhecimento local","gerenciamento de conhecimento","busca github","gh cli","token de acesso pessoal","repositórios privados"],"ru":["github kb","локальная база знаний","управление знаниями","поиск github","gh cli","личный токен доступа","приватные репозитории"],"ar":["قاعدة معرفة جيثب","المعرفة المحلية","إدارة المعرفة","البحث جيثب","واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","الرمز الشخصي","المستودعات الخاصة"]}},"owner":"openclaw","repo":"skills","repoPath":"openclaw/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.656Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-kb","description":"Manage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Use when users ask about repos, PRs, issues, request to clone GitHub repositories, explore codebases, or need information about GitHub projects. Supports searching GitHub via gh CLI and managing local KB with GITHUB_KB.md catalog. Configure via GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH environment variables.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GIT","body":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GITHUB_KB_PATH=\"/your/path/github-kb\"\n```\n\n**Token Privacy:** Never hardcode tokens. Inject via environment variables or container secrets.\n\n## GitHub CLI (gh)\n\n**Requirement:** GitHub CLI must be installed and authenticated.\n\n**Installation:**\n- **macOS:** `brew install gh`\n- **Linux:** `apt install gh` or see [official install guide](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md)\n- **Windows:** `winget install GitHub.cli`\n\n**Authentication:**\n```bash\n# Interactive login\ngh auth login\n\n# Or use token from GITHUB_TOKEN env var\ngh auth login --with-token <(echo \"$GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** `gh auth status`\n\nIf `gh` is not installed or not authenticated, skip search operations and use only local KB features.\n\n### Searching Repos\n\n```bash\n# Search repos by keyword\ngh search repos <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search repos \"typescript cli\" --limit 10\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\" --limit 20\ngh search repos \"topic:mcp\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by programming language\n- `stars:<n>` or `stars:><n>` - Filter by star count\n- `topic:<name>` - Filter by topic\n- `user:<owner>` - Search within a user''s repos\n- `org:<org>` - Search within an organization\n\n### Searching Issues\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"react hooks bug\" --limit 20\ngh search issues \"repo:facebook/react state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search issues \"language:typescript label:bug\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed` - Filter by issue state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `comments:<n>` or `comments:><n>` - Filter by comment count\n\n### Searching Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search prs \"repo:vercel/next.js state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search prs \"language:go is:merged\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed|merged` - Filter by PR state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `is:merged|unmerged` - Filter by merge status\n\n### Viewing PR/Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# View issue/PR details\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\n\n# View with comments\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\n```\n\n## Local Knowledge Base Workflow\n\n### Querying About a Repo in KB\n\n1. Read GITHUB_KB.md to understand what projects exist\n2. Locate the project directory under ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/\n\n### Cloning a New Repo to KB\n\n1. Search GitHub if the full repo name is not known\n2. Clone to KB directory:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<name>.git ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/<name>\n   ```\n3. Generate project description: Read README or key files to understand the project\n4. Update GITHUB_KB.md: Add entry for the new repo following the existing format:\n   ```markdown\n   ### [<name>](/<name>)\n   Brief one-line description of what the project does. Additional context if useful (key features, tech stack, etc.).\n   ```\n5. Confirm completion: Tell user the repo was cloned and where to find it\n\n### Default Clone Location\n\nIf user says \"clone X\" without specifying a directory, default to ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/.\n\n## GITHUB_KB.md Format\n\nThe catalog file follows this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nThis directory contains X GitHub projects covering various domains.\n\n---\n\n## Category Name\n\n### [project-name](/project-name)\nBrief description of the project.\n```\n\nMaintain categorization and consistent formatting when updating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:19:42.505Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined GitHub repository management and search functionality via gh CLI.","zh":"适合需要简化 GitHub 仓库管理和搜索功能的开发代理，通过 gh CLI 实现。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理と検索機能をストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに適しています。gh CLI を使用します。","ko":"GitHub 리포지토리 관리 및 검색 기능을 스트림라인화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. gh CLI를 통해 제공됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de repositorios de GitHub simplificada y funcionalidad de búsqueda a través de la CLI de gh.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de référentiels GitHub simplifiée et une fonctionnalité de recherche via la CLI gh.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine strukturierte GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung und Suchfunktion über die gh-CLI erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento que exigem gestão de repositório do GitHub simplificada e funcionalidade de pesquisa via CLI do gh.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенного управления репозиториями GitHub и функциональности поиска через CLI gh.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة مخزن GitHub مبسطًا وتوفر وظائف البحث من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a local GitHub knowledge base, providing advanced search capabilities and cataloging projects with brief descriptions using the GITHUB_KB.md file, all while leveraging environment variables like GITHUB_TOKEN for private repository access.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地 GitHub 知识库的能力，提供高级搜索功能，并使用 GITHUB_KB.md 文件对项目进行目录编制，所有这些都利用环境变量，如 GITHUB_TOKEN 进行私有仓库访问。","ja":"エージェントがローカルの GitHub ナレッジベースを管理できるようにし、高度な検索機能を提供し、GITHUB_KB.md ファイルを使用してプロジェクトを簡単な説明とともにカタログ化します。環境変数の GITHUB_TOKEN を使用してプライベート リポジトリにアクセスします。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub 지식 베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 해주며, 고급 검색 기능을 제공하고 GITHUB_KB.md 파일을 사용하여 프로젝트를 간단한 설명과 함께 카탈로그화합니다. 환경 변수인 GITHUB_TOKEN을 사용하여 비공개 리포지토리에 접근합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar una base de conocimientos local de GitHub, proporcionando capacidades de búsqueda avanzadas y catalogando proyectos con descripciones breves utilizando el archivo GITHUB_KB.md, todo mientras aprovecha variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN para acceder a repositorios privados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une base de connaissances GitHub locale, offrant des capacités de recherche avancées et cataloguant des projets avec des descriptions brèves en utilisant le fichier GITHUB_KB.md, le tout en exploitant des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN pour accéder aux référentiels privés.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine lokale GitHub-Wissensbasis zu verwalten, indem sie erweiterte Suchfunktionen bereitstellen und Projekte mit kurzen Beschreibungen über die Datei GITHUB_KB.md katalogisieren, während sie gleichzeitig Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub, fornecendo capacidades de pesquisa avançadas e catalogação de projetos com descrições breves usando o arquivo GITHUB_KB.md, aproveitando variáveis de ambiente como GITHUB_TOKEN para acesso a repositórios privados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub, обеспечивая расширенные возможности поиска и каталогизацию проектов с краткими описаниями с помощью файла GITHUB_KB.md, используя переменные среды, такие как GITHUB_TOKEN, для доступа к приватным репозиториям.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية لجيت هاب، وتوفير إمكانيات بحث متقدمة وفسرد مشاريع مع وصف موجز باستخدام ملف GITHUB_KB.md، مع الاستفادة من متغيّرات البيئة مثل GITHUB_TOKEN للوصول إلى مستودعات خاصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub repository searches","Cataloging projects with brief descriptions in GITHUB_KB.md","Managing local knowledge base directories via GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"zh":["自动化 GitHub 仓库搜索","使用 GITHUB_KB.md 文件对项目进行目录编制","通过 GITHUB_KB_PATH 管理本地知识库目录"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリの検索を自動化する","GITHUB_KB.md ファイルを使用してプロジェクトをカタログ化する","GITHUB_KB_PATH を使用してローカルのナレッジベース ディレクトリを管理する"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 검색 자동화","GITHUB_KB.md 파일을 사용하여 프로젝트를 카탈로그화","GITHUB_KB_PATH를 사용하여 로컬 지식 베이스 디렉토리를 관리"],"es":["Automatizar las búsquedas de repositorios de GitHub","Catalogar proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md","Gestionar directorios de la base de conocimientos local a través de GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"fr":["Automatiser les recherches de référentiels GitHub","Cataloguer des projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md","Gérer les répertoires de la base de connaissances locale via GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"de":["Automatisierung der GitHub-Repository-Suchen","Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md","Verwaltung von lokalen Wissensbasis-Verzeichnissen über GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"pt":["Automatizar pesquisas de repositório do GitHub","Catalogar projetos com descrições breves no arquivo GITHUB_KB.md","Gerenciar diretórios de base de conhecimento local via GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ru":["Автоматизировать поиск репозиториев GitHub","Каталогизировать проекты с краткими описаниями в файле GITHUB_KB.md","Управлять локальными директориями базы знаний через GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ar":["تحقيق آلي للبحث في مستودعات جيت هاب","تسجيل مشاريع مع وصف موجز في ملف GITHUB_KB.md","إدارة دليل قاعدة المعرفة المحلي عبر GITHUB_KB_PATH"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Personal Access Token for private repos","Dependent on gh CLI for GitHub interactions","Needs environment variables set (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌来访问私有仓库","依赖于 gh CLI 进行 GitHub 交互","需要设置环境变量（GITHUB_TOKEN、GITHUB_KB_PATH）"],"ja":["プライベート リポジトリにアクセスするには GitHub のパーソナル アクセス トークンが必要","GitHub の操作には gh CLI に依存","環境変数（GITHUB_TOKEN、GITHUB_KB_PATH）を設定する必要がある"],"ko":["비공개 리포지토리에 접근하기 위해 GitHub 개인 접근 토큰이 필요","GitHub 상호 작용을 위해 gh CLI에 의존","환경 변수(GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)를 설정해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un token de acceso personal de GitHub para repositorios privados","Dependiente de la CLI de gh para interacciones con GitHub","Necesita variables de entorno configuradas (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour les référentiels privés","Dépendant de la CLI gh pour les interactions avec GitHub","Nécessite des variables d''environnement configurées (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitHub-Personal-Zugriffstoken für private Repositorys","Abhängig von der gh-CLI für GitHub-Interaktionen","Benötigt konfigurierte Umgebungsvariablen (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)"],"pt":["Exige Token de Acesso Pessoal do GitHub para repositórios privados","Depende da CLI do gh para interações com o GitHub","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente definidas (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)"],"ru":["Требует личного токена доступа к GitHub для приватных репозиториев","Зависит от CLI gh для взаимодействия с GitHub","Требует настроенных переменных среды (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول شخصي لمستودعات جيت هاب الخاصة","يعتمد على واجهة سطر الأوامر gh للتفاعل مع جيت هاب","يحتاج إلى تعريف متغيرات بيئية (GITHUB_TOKEN، GITHUB_KB_PATH)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d62830e2d00b0b63fe36620febd451b583dbcfad38acf354a1d77942401e303","qualityScore":40}');
