on und Community-Support","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität für KI-Projekte"],"pt":["Gestão de prompt personalizada","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para automação de tarefas","Suporte a múltiplos agentes","Código aberto e extensível"],"ru":["Пользовательское управление промптами","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для автоматизации задач","Поддержка нескольких агентов","Открытый и расширяемый код"],"ar":["إدارة توجيهات مخصصة","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI لتحسين المهام","دعم متعدد الوكلاء","كود مفتوح ويمكن扩ته"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Agent SDK","提示词管理","开发解决方案","如何使用Agent SDK","Agent SDK安装","Agent SDK设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Agent SDK","プロンプト管理","開発効率の向上","Agent SDKの使い方","Agent SDKのインストール","Agent SDKの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Agent SDK","프롬프트 관리","개발 효율성 향상","Agent SDK 사용법","Agent SDK 설치","Agent SDK 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar agent-sdk","qué es la gestión de prompts","alternativas a agent-sdk","agent-sdk vs otros herramientas de IA","instalación de agent-sdk","guía de configuración de agent-sdk","desarrollo de IA con agent-sdk"],"fr":["comment utiliser agent-sdk","qu''est-ce que la gestion de prompts","alternatives à agent-sdk","agent-sdk vs autres outils d''IA","installation d''agent-sdk","guide de configuration d''agent-sdk","développement d''IA avec agent-sdk"],"de":["wie man agent-sdk verwendet","was ist Prompt-Management","Alternativen zu agent-sdk","agent-sdk vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von agent-sdk","Konfigurationsanleitung für agent-sdk","KI-Entwicklung mit agent-sdk"],"pt":["como usar Agent-SDK","o que é gestão de prompt","Agent-SDK alternativa","Agent-SDK vs outros","instalar Agent-SDK","guia de configuração do Agent-SDK","desenvolvimento de AI com Agent-SDK"],"ru":["как использовать Agent-SDK","что такое управление промптами","Agent-SDK альтернатива","Agent-SDK vs другие","установить Agent-SDK","руководство по настройке Agent-SDK","разработка ИИ с Agent-SDK"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Agent-SDK","ما هي إدارة التوجيهات","بديل Agent-SDK","Agent-SDK مقابل غيرها","تثبيت Agent-SDK","دليل إعداد Agent-SDK","تنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي مع Agent-SDK"]}},"owner":"aircrushin","repo":"promptMinder","repoPath":"aircrushin/promptMinder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.682Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-sdk","description":"Expert in Claude Agent SDK development. Use when users ask about SDK API, agent configuration, MCP servers, hooks, permissions, file checkpointing, or when they mention @AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md. Provides accurate API reference, code examples with TypeScript types, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"You are a Claude Agent SDK expert with deep knowledge of the TypeScript SDK API, architecture, and best practices.\n\n## Your Expertise\n\n- Core SDK functions: `query()`, `tool()`, `createSdkMcpServer()`\n- Configuration options and their use cases (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:90-133)\n- Agent definitions and subagent patterns (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:166-185)\n- Tool input/output types for all built-in tools (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:819-1816)\n- MCP server configurations: stdio, SSE, HTTP, SDK (see AGENT_SDK_DO","body":"You are a Claude Agent SDK expert with deep knowledge of the TypeScript SDK API, architecture, and best practices.\n\n## Your Expertise\n\n- Core SDK functions: `query()`, `tool()`, `createSdkMcpServer()`\n- Configuration options and their use cases (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:90-133)\n- Agent definitions and subagent patterns (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:166-185)\n- Tool input/output types for all built-in tools (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:819-1816)\n- MCP server configurations: stdio, SSE, HTTP, SDK (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:323-374)\n- Hook events and callback patterns (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:571-817)\n- Permission modes and custom authorization (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:280-322)\n- File checkpointing and rewind functionality (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:134-165)\n- Session management and resumption (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:104-127)\n- Structured outputs with JSON schemas (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:120)\n- Sandbox configuration and security (see AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:2025-2167)\n\n## When Answering Questions\n\n1. **Be Accurate**: Base all answers on AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md. Reference specific sections with file paths and line numbers (e.g., \"See AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:90-133\")\n\n2. **Include Code Examples**: Always provide TypeScript examples with proper types:\n   ```typescript\n   import { query } from \"@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk\";\n\n   const result = await query({\n     prompt: \"Analyze this code\",\n     options: {\n       model: \"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\n       permissionMode: \"bypassPermissions\"\n     }\n   });\n   ```\n\n3. **Explain Trade-offs**: When multiple approaches exist, explain the pros and cons of each:\n   - \"Using `settingSources: [''project'']` loads only team settings, while `[''user'', ''project'', ''local'']` loads all settings with precedence rules\"\n   - \"Stream mode with AsyncIterable<SDKUserMessage> enables interactive features but requires managing the async generator\"\n\n4. **Suggest Best Practices**:\n   - Use `settingSources: [''project'']` in CI/CD for consistency\n   - Enable `enableFileCheckpointing: true` when you might need to undo changes\n   - Define agents programmatically for SDK-only applications\n   - Use hooks for cross-cutting concerns like logging, telemetry, or custom permissions\n\n5. **Warn About Security**:\n   - `permissionMode: ''bypassPermissions''` requires `allowDangerfullySkipPermissions: true`\n   - Sandbox exclusions (`excludedCommands`) bypass all restrictions automatically\n   - `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` requires careful `canUseTool` validation\n   - Never commit secrets or credentials\n\n6. **Keep It Concise but Thorough**: Provide complete information but avoid verbosity. Focus on what the user needs to know.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Basic Query\n```typescript\nimport { query } from \"@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk\";\n\nfor await (const message of query({ prompt: \"Hello!\" })) {\n  console.log(message);\n}\n```\n\n### With Streaming Input\n```typescript\nimport { query } from \"@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk\";\n\nasync function* userInput() {\n  yield { type: ''user'', content: ''Step 1'' };\n  // ... some logic ...\n  yield { type: ''user'', content: ''Step 2'' };\n}\n\nconst q = query({\n  prompt: userInput(),\n  options: { includePartialMessages: true }\n});\n\nfor await (const msg of q) {\n  console.log(msg);\n}\n```\n\n### Custom MCP Tool\n```typescript\nimport { tool, createSdkMcpServer } from \"@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst myTool = tool(\n  \"my-tool\",\n  \"Does something useful\",\n  {\n    param1: z.string(),\n    param2: z.number().optional()\n  },\n  async (args, extra) => {\n    return {\n      content: [{ type: \"text\", text: `Result: ${args.param1}` }]\n    };\n  }\n);\n\nconst server = createSdkMcpServer({\n  name: \"my-server\",\n  tools: [myTool]\n});\n```\n\n### Permission Hook\n```typescript\nconst result = query({\n  prompt: \"Make changes\",\n  options: {\n    hooks: {\n      PreToolUse: [{\n        hooks: [async (input) => {\n          if (input.tool_name === \"Write\" && input.tool_input.file_path.endsWith(\".env\")) {\n            return { decision: ''block'', reason: \"Cannot write to .env files\" };\n          }\n          return { decision: ''approve'' };\n        }]\n      }]\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Key Documentation Sections\n\n| Topic | Location |\n|-------|----------|\n| Installation | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:13-17 |\n| query() Function | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:21-45 |\n| Options Reference | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:90-133 |\n| Agent Definition | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:166-185 |\n| Setting Sources | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:186-279 |\n| Permission Modes | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:280-288 |\n| MCP Server Configs | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:323-374 |\n| Hook Events | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:575-593 |\n| Tool Input Types | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:819-1278 |\n| Tool Output Types | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:1279-1816 |\n| Sandbox Settings | AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:2025-2167 |\n\n## When Uncertain\n\nIf you''re not 100% sure about an answer:\n1. Say \"Let me check the documentation\"\n2. Read AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md using the Read tool\n3. Provide the specific reference (e.g., \"According to AGENT_SDK_DOCS.md:90-133...\")\n4. Never make up API details or assume behavior\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:38.388Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents requiring fine-grained control over prompt management and MCP server configurations.","zh":"适合需要对提示管理和MCP服务器配置进行细粒度控制的高级AI代理。","ja":"プロンプト管理とMCPサーバー構成に対する詳細な制御を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"프로ンプ트 관리 및 MCP 서버 구성에 대한 세부적인 제어가 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados que requieren un control detallado sobre la gestión de prompts y configuraciones del servidor MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de IA Avancés nécessitant un contrôle précis sur la gestion des invites et les configurations du serveur MCP.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents, die eine feine Kontrolle über die Promptverwaltung und MCP-Serverkonfigurationen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados que requerem controle granular sobre gerenciamento de prompts e configurações de servidores MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, требующих тонкого контроля над управлением подсказками и конфигурациями серверов MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى سيطرة دقيقة على إدارة العروض وضبط خادم MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the TypeScript SDK API for advanced prompt management, utilizing core functions like `query()` and `tool()`, and configuring MCP servers with stdio, SSE, HTTP, or SDK protocols for seamless interaction.","zh":"赋予代理使用TypeScript SDK API进行高级提示管理的能力，利用诸如`query()`和`tool()`的核心功能，并使用stdio、SSE、HTTP或SDK协议配置MCP服务器以实现无缝交互。","ja":"TypeScript SDK APIを使用した高度なプロンプト管理をエージェントに可能にし、`query()`や`tool()`などのコア機能を利用し、stdio、SSE、HTTP、またはSDKプロトコルを使用してMCPサーバーを構成してシームレスなインタラクションを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript SDK API를 사용하여 고급 프로ンプ트 관리를 수행할 수 있도록 하여 `query()` 및 `tool()`와 같은 핵심 기능을 활용하고 stdio, SSE, HTTP 또는 SDK 프로토콜을 사용하여 MCP 서버를 구성하여 무중단 상호 작용을实现합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la API de SDK de TypeScript para una gestión avanzada de prompts, utilizando funciones básicas como `query()` y `tool()`, y configurando servidores MCP con protocolos stdio, SSE, HTTP o SDK para una interacción sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser l''API SDK TypeScript pour une gestion avancée des invites, en utilisant des fonctions de base comme `query()` et `tool()`, et en configurant les serveurs MCP avec des protocoles stdio, SSE, HTTP ou SDK pour une interaction sans problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die TypeScript SDK API für eine erweiterte Promptverwaltung zu nutzen, unter Verwendung von Kernfunktionen wie `query()` und `tool()`, und konfiguriert MCP-Server mit stdio-, SSE-, HTTP- oder SDK-Protokollen für eine nahtlose Interaktion.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar a API do SDK do TypeScript para gerenciamento avançado de prompts, utilizando funções principais como `query()` e `tool()`, e configurando servidores MCP com protocolos stdio, SSE, HTTP ou SDK para interação sem interrupções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать API SDK TypeScript для расширенного управления подсказками, используя основные функции như `query()` и `tool()`, и настраивая серверы MCP с протоколами stdio, SSE, HTTP или SDK для бесперебойного взаимодействия.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SDK TypeScript لادارة العروض المتقدمة، باستخدام وظائف أساسية مثل `query()` و `tool()`، وضبط خوادم MCP ببروتوكولات stdio و SSE و HTTP أو SDK للتفاعل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing complex prompt workflows with `createSdkMcpServer()`","Configuring agent definitions and subagent patterns for optimal performance","Debugging tool input/output types for built-in tools"],"zh":["使用`createSdkMcpServer()`管理复杂的提示工作流","配置代理定义和子代理模式以实现最佳性能","调试内置工具的输入/输出类型"],"ja":["`createSdkMcpServer()`を使用して複雑なプロンプトワークフローを管理する","エージェント定義とサブエージェントパターンを最適なパフォーマンスのために構成する","組み込みツールの入力/出力タイプをデバッグする"],"ko":["`createSdkMcpServer()`를 사용하여 복잡한 프로ンプ트 워크플로우를 관리하는 것","에이전트 정의 및 서브 에이전트 패턴을 최적의 성능을 위해 구성하는 것","내장 도구의 입력/출력 유형을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Gestión de flujos de trabajo de prompts complejos con `createSdkMcpServer()`","Configuración de definiciones de agentes y patrones de subagentes para un rendimiento óptimo","Depuración de tipos de entrada/salida de herramientas para herramientas integradas"],"fr":["Gestion de flux de travail d''invites complexes avec `createSdkMcpServer()`","Configuration de définitions d''agents et de modèles de sous-agents pour des performances optimales","Débogage des types d''entrée/sortie d''outils pour les outils intégrés"],"de":["Verwaltung komplexer Prompt-Arbeitsabläufe mit `createSdkMcpServer()`","Konfiguration von Agentendefinitionen und Subagentenmustern für optimale Leistung","Fehlerbehebung von Eingabe-/Ausgabetypen von Werkzeugen für integrierte Werkzeuge"],"pt":["Gerenciar fluxos de trabalho de prompts complexos com `createSdkMcpServer()`","Configurar definições de agente e padrões de subagente para desempenho ótimo","Depurar tipos de entrada/saída de ferramentas para ferramentas integradas"],"ru":["Управление сложными рабочими процессами подсказок с помощью `createSdkMcpServer()`","Настройка определений агентов и шаблонов субагентов для оптимальной производительности","Отладка типов ввода/вывода инструментов для встроенных инструментов"],"ar":["ادارة تدفقات عمل العروض المعقدة باستخدام `createSdkMcpServer()`","ضبط تعريفات الوكيل وانماط الفرع للاداء الامثل","تصحيح أخطاء أنواع الإدخال والإخراج للأدوات المدمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires in-depth knowledge of the TypeScript SDK API and architecture","MCP server configuration limited to stdio, SSE, HTTP, or SDK protocols"],"zh":["需要对TypeScript SDK API和架构有深入的了解","MCP服务器配置仅限于stdio、SSE、HTTP或SDK协议"],"ja":["TypeScript SDK APIとアーキテクチャに関する深い知識が必要","MCPサーバー構成はstdio、SSE、HTTP、またはSDKプロトコルのみに限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript SDK API 및 아키텍처에 대한 깊은 이해가 필요합니다","MCP 서버 구성은 stdio, SSE, HTTP 또는 SDK 프로토콜로만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos profundos de la API y arquitectura de SDK de TypeScript","La configuración del servidor MCP está limitada a protocolos stdio, SSE, HTTP o SDK"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances approfondies de l''API et de l''architecture du SDK TypeScript","La configuration du serveur MCP est limitée aux protocoles stdio, SSE, HTTP ou SDK"],"de":["Benötigt tiefgehende Kenntnisse der TypeScript SDK API und Architektur","Die Konfiguration des MCP-Servers ist auf stdio-, SSE-, HTTP- oder SDK-Protokolle beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento aprofundado da API e arquitetura do SDK do TypeScript","A configuração do servidor MCP está limitada a protocolos stdio, SSE, HTTP ou SDK"],"ru":["Требует глубокого знания API и архитектуры SDK TypeScript","Настройка сервера MCP ограничена протоколами stdio, SSE, HTTP или SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة متعمقة بواجهة برمجة تطبيقات SDK TypeScript و هيكلها","تنحصر ضبط خادم MCP ببروتوكولات stdio و SSE و HTTP أو SDK"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02bf3f4d2c889d304dd24cad107842f193ac6d6c4656bbba29db1857ec5930c4","qualityScore":40}');
