 기반의 병원 정보 관리 시스템입니다","es":"jsf-ajax es un sistema de gestión de información de hospitales de código abierto basado en Java EE","fr":"jsf-ajax est un système de gestion de l''information des hôpitaux open source basé sur Java EE","de":"jsf-ajax ist ein Open-Source-Krankenhausinformationssystem auf Basis von Java EE","pt":"O jsf-ajax é um sistema de gestão de informações de hospitais de código aberto baseado em Java EE.","ru":"ИИ Агенты jsf-ajax - это открытая система управления больницей на основе Java EE.","ar":"jsf-ajax هو نظام إدارة معلومات مستشفيات مفتوح المصدر مبني على Java EE.","en":"This is an Open Source Java EE based Hospital Information Management System"},"definition":{"en":"This is an Open Source Java EE based Hospital Information Management System"},"features":{"zh":["基于Java EE的架构","支持AJAX技术","提高医疗服务的效率","增强数据安全性","易于扩展和定制"],"ja":["Java EEベースのアーキテクチャ","AJAX技術のサポート","医療サービスの効率の向上","データセキュリティの強化","拡張性とカスタマイズの容易さ"],"ko":["자바 EE 기반의 아키텍처","AJAX 기술 지원","의료 서비스의 효율성 향상","데이터 보안 강화","확장성과 맞춤형의 용이성"],"es":["Sistema de gestión de información de hospitales","Tecnologías de Java EE","Código abierto","Personalizable","Escalable"],"fr":["Système de gestion de l''information des hôpitaux","Technologies Java EE","Code open source","Personnalisable","Évolutif"],"de":["Krankenhausinformationssystem","Java-EE-Technologien","Open-Source-Code","Anpassbar","Skalierbar"],"pt":["Desenvolvido em Java EE","Sistema de gestão de informações de hospitais","Código aberto","Integração com jsf-ajax","Ferramentas de AI para melhorias de desempenho"],"ru":["Разработан на основе Java EE","Система управления больницей","Открытый исходный код","Интеграция с jsf-ajax","ИИ инструменты для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["تم تطويره باستخدام Java EE","نظام إدارة معلومات مستشفيات","مفتوح المصدر","التكامل مع jsf-ajax","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["jsf-ajax教程","Java EE开发","医院信息管理系统","AJAX技术","jsf-ajax安装","jsf-ajax替代品","如何使用jsf-ajax","jsf-ajax vs 其他工具","jsf-ajax设置指南"],"ja":["jsf-ajaxチュートリアル","Java EE開発","病院情報管理システム","AJAX技術","jsf-ajaxインストール","jsf-ajaxの代替","jsf-ajaxの使い方","jsf-ajaxと他のツールの比較","jsf-ajax設定ガイド"],"ko":["jsf-ajax 튜토리얼","자바 EE 개발","병원 정보 관리 시스템","AJAX 기술","jsf-ajax 설치","jsf-ajax 대체품","jsf-ajax 사용법","jsf-ajax와 다른 도구의 비교","jsf-ajax 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para hospitales","jsf-ajax","sistema de gestión de información de hospitales","Java EE","código abierto","alternativas a jsf-ajax","instalación de jsf-ajax","guía de configuración de jsf-ajax"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour hôpitaux","jsf-ajax","système de gestion de l''information des hôpitaux","Java EE","code open source","alternatives à jsf-ajax","installation de jsf-ajax","guide de configuration de jsf-ajax"],"de":["KI-Tools für Krankenhäuser","jsf-ajax","Krankenhausinformationssystem","Java EE","Open-Source-Code","Alternativen zu jsf-ajax","Installation von jsf-ajax","Konfigurationsanleitung für jsf-ajax"],"pt":["como usar jsf-ajax","o que é jsf-ajax","jsf-ajax alternativa","jsf-ajax vs outros","instalar jsf-ajax","guia de configuração do jsf-ajax"],"ru":["как использовать jsf-ajax","что такое jsf-ajax","jsf-ajax альтернатива","jsf-ajax vs другие","установить jsf-ajax","руководство по настройке jsf-ajax"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام jsf-ajax","ما هو jsf-ajax","بديل jsf-ajax","jsf-ajax مقابل غيره","تثبيت jsf-ajax","دليل إعداد jsf-ajax"]}},"owner":"hmislk","repo":"hmis","repoPath":"hmislk/hmis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.720Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jsf-ajax","description":">","bodyPreview":"# JSF AJAX Update Guidelines\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **AJAX UPDATE RULE**: NEVER use plain HTML elements (div, span) with id attributes for AJAX updates - use JSF components (`h:panelGroup`, `p:outputPanel`) instead\n2. **RENDERED ATTRIBUTE RULE**: NEVER use `rendered` on plain HTML elements - JSF ignores it; use `h:panelGroup layout=\"block\"` instead\n3. **COMPONENT REFERENCES**: Use `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` for updates: `update=\":#{p:resolveFirstComponentWithId(''componentId'',view).clientId}","body":"# JSF AJAX Update Guidelines\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **AJAX UPDATE RULE**: NEVER use plain HTML elements (div, span) with id attributes for AJAX updates - use JSF components (`h:panelGroup`, `p:outputPanel`) instead\n2. **RENDERED ATTRIBUTE RULE**: NEVER use `rendered` on plain HTML elements - JSF ignores it; use `h:panelGroup layout=\"block\"` instead\n3. **COMPONENT REFERENCES**: Use `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` for updates: `update=\":#{p:resolveFirstComponentWithId(''componentId'',view).clientId}\"`\n4. **NO CSS/jQuery SELECTORS**: NEVER use `@(.class)`, `@(#id)`, `@parent` in `update` or `process` attributes. Use `@this`, `@form`, explicit IDs, or `:#{p:resolveFirstComponentWithId(...)}`\n\n## Wrong vs Correct\n\n```xhtml\n<!-- WRONG - Plain HTML, AJAX silently fails -->\n<div id=\"stockSelection\">\n    <!-- content -->\n</div>\n<p:commandButton update=\"stockSelection\" />\n\n<!-- CORRECT - JSF component, AJAX works -->\n<h:panelGroup id=\"stockSelection\">\n    <div><!-- content --></div>\n</h:panelGroup>\n<p:commandButton update=\"stockSelection\" />\n```\n\n## Updating Growl/Messages\n\nThe growl component is in `template.xhtml` outside forms. Use absolute ID with colon prefix:\n\n```xhtml\n<!-- CORRECT -->\n<p:commandButton action=\"#{bean.save}\" update=\"myTable :growl\" />\n\n<!-- WRONG - Do NOT use CSS selectors -->\n<p:commandButton update=\"@(.ui-growl)\" />\n```\n\n## JSF Components for AJAX Updates\n\n- `h:panelGroup` - Lightweight wrapper, no HTML output\n- `p:outputPanel` - PrimeFaces panel, renders as `<span>` or `<div>`\n- `h:div` - Renders as HTML `<div>`\n- `h:form` - For updating entire form sections\n- `p:panel` - Full-featured panel with header/footer\n\n## Debugging\n\n1. Check browser console for JavaScript errors\n2. Verify target element is a JSF component (not plain HTML)\n3. Use browser dev tools to confirm JSF-generated id\n4. Test with `h:panelGroup` wrapper if updates fail\n5. Check component hierarchy - nested components affect id resolution\n\nFor complete reference, read [developer_docs/jsf/ajax-update-guidelines.md](../../developer_docs/jsf/ajax-update-guidelines.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:51:36.680Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java EE Agents needing seamless AJAX integration with JSF components","zh":"非常适合需要与JSF组件无缝集成AJAX的Java EE代理","ja":"Java EEエージェントがJSFコンポーネントとのシームレスなAJAX統合を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"JSF 컴포넌트와의 무결점 AJAX 통합을 필요로 하는 Java EE 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Java EE que necesitan una integración AJAX sin problemas con componentes JSF","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Java EE nécessitant une intégration AJAX transparente avec des composants JSF","de":"Perfekt für Java-EE-Agents, die eine nahtlose AJAX-Integration mit JSF-Komponenten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Java EE que necessitam de integração AJAX sem interrupções com componentes JSF","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Java EE, требующих бесшовной интеграции AJAX с компонентами JSF","ar":"مثالي لعميل Java EE الذي يحتاج إلى دمج AJAX دون انقطاع مع مكونات JSF"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform dynamic updates using JSF components like `h:panelGroup` and `p:outputPanel`, while avoiding plain HTML elements, and leveraging `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` for precise component references, all within the realm of Java EE and JSF AJAX updates","zh":"赋予代理使用JSF组件（如`h:panelGroup`和`p:outputPanel`）进行动态更新的能力，同时避免使用纯HTML元素，并利用`p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`进行精确的组件引用，所有这些都在Java EE和JSF AJAX更新的范围内","ja":"エージェントがJSFコンポーネント（`h:panelGroup`や`p:outputPanel`など）を使用してダイナミック更新を実行できるようにし、プレーンHTML要素を回避し、`p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`を使用してコンポーネントの参照を正確に行うことを可能にし、すべてJava EEとJSF AJAX更新の範囲内で","ko":"에이전트가 `h:panelGroup` 및 `p:outputPanel`과 같은 JSF 컴포넌트를 사용하여 동적 업데이트 수행을 가능하게 하며, 순수 HTML 요소를 피하고 `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`를 사용하여 컴포넌트 참조를 정확히 하며, 모든 것이 Java EE 및 JSF AJAX 업데이트의 범위 내에서","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar actualizaciones dinámicas utilizando componentes JSF como `h:panelGroup` y `p:outputPanel`, evitando elementos HTML plano, y aprovechando `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` para referencias de componentes precisas, todo dentro del ámbito de Java EE y actualizaciones AJAX de JSF","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des mises à jour dynamiques en utilisant des composants JSF tels que `h:panelGroup` et `p:outputPanel`, en évitant les éléments HTML simples, et en exploitant `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` pour des références de composants précises, le tout dans le cadre de Java EE et de mises à jour AJAX de JSF","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, dynamische Updates mit JSF-Komponenten wie `h:panelGroup` und `p:outputPanel` durchzuführen, wobei einfache HTML-Elemente vermieden werden und `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` für präzise Komponentenreferenzen genutzt wird, all dies im Rahmen von Java EE und JSF-AJAX-Updates","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar atualizações dinâmicas usando componentes JSF como `h:panelGroup` e `p:outputPanel`, evitando elementos HTML simples e utilizando `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` para referências de componentes precisas, tudo dentro do âmbito de atualizações AJAX Java EE e JSF","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять динамические обновления с использованием компонентов JSF, таких как `h:panelGroup` и `p:outputPanel`, избегая простых элементов HTML и используя `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` для точных ссылок на компоненты, все в рамках обновлений AJAX Java EE и JSF","ar":"يمكن للعميل تنفيذ التحديثات الديناميكية باستخدام مكونات JSF مثل `h:panelGroup` و `p:outputPanel`، وتجنب عناصر HTML البسيطة، واستخدام `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId` للإشارات الدقيقة للمكونات، كل ذلك في نطاق تحديثات AJAX لجافا إي إي وجافا إس إف"},"useCases":{"en":["Updating JSF components dynamically with AJAX","Resolving component IDs using `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","Avoiding rendering issues with plain HTML elements"],"zh":["使用AJAX动态更新JSF组件","使用`p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`解析组件ID","避免使用纯HTML元素导致的渲染问题"],"ja":["AJAXを使用してJSFコンポーネントをダイナミック更新する","`p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`を使用してコンポーネントIDを解決する","プレーンHTML要素によるレンダリング問題を回避する"],"ko":["AJAX를 사용하여 JSF 컴포넌트 동적 업데이트","`p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`를 사용하여 컴포넌트 ID를 해결","순수 HTML 요소로 인한 렌더링 문제 피하기"],"es":["Actualización dinámica de componentes JSF con AJAX","Resolución de IDs de componentes con `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","Evitación de problemas de renderizado con elementos HTML plano"],"fr":["Mise à jour dynamique de composants JSF avec AJAX","Résolution des IDs de composants avec `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","Évitement des problèmes de rendu avec des éléments HTML simples"],"de":["Dynamische Aktualisierung von JSF-Komponenten mit AJAX","Auflösung von Komponenten-IDs mit `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","Vermeidung von Renderproblemen mit einfachen HTML-Elementen"],"pt":["Atualizar componentes JSF dinamicamente com AJAX","Resolver IDs de componentes usando `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","Evitar problemas de renderização com elementos HTML simples"],"ru":["Динамически обновлять компоненты JSF с помощью AJAX","Разрешать IDs компонентов с помощью `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","Избегать проблем с отображением с помощью простых элементов HTML"],"ar":["تحديث مكونات JSF بشكل ديناميكي مع AJAX","حل IDs للمكونات باستخدام `p:resolveFirstComponentWithId`","تجنب مشاكل العرض باستخدام عناصر HTML البسيطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java EE environment","JSF components must be used instead of plain HTML elements","Specific to JSF AJAX updates"],"zh":["需要Java EE环境","必须使用JSF组件而不是纯HTML元素","仅限JSF AJAX更新"],"ja":["Java EE環境が必要","JSFコンポーネントを使用し、プレーンHTML要素を使用しない","JSF AJAX更新に限定"],"ko":["Java EE 환경 필요","순수 HTML 요소 대신 JSF 컴포넌트 사용","JSF AJAX 업데이트에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere entorno Java EE","Los componentes JSF deben usarse en lugar de elementos HTML plano","Específico para actualizaciones AJAX de JSF"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Java EE","Les composants JSF doivent être utilisés au lieu d''éléments HTML simples","Spécifique aux mises à jour AJAX de JSF"],"de":["Benötigt Java-EE-Umgebung","JSF-Komponenten müssen anstelle einfacher HTML-Elemente verwendet werden","Spezifisch für JSF-AJAX-Updates"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Java EE","Componentes JSF devem ser usados em vez de elementos HTML simples","Específico para atualizações AJAX JSF"],"ru":["Требуется среда Java EE","Компоненты JSF должны использоваться вместо простых элементов HTML","Конкретно для обновлений AJAX JSF"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافا إي إي","يجب استخدام مكونات JSF بدلاً من عناصر HTML البسيطة","محدد لتحديثات AJAX لجافا إس إف"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"620fecf52aa7b16e46a71a694f7633bdaf7c0ce97b5977f0e5d13337c9687863","qualityScore":40}');
