,"KI-Tools für Bildung","Alternativen zu Abaci.One","Abaci.One im Vergleich zu Wettbewerbern","Installation von Abaci.One","Einrichtungsanleitung für Abaci.One"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","plataforma de aprendizado de soroban","tecnologia de ia para educacao","como usar abaci.one","abaci.one vs concorrentes","guia de instalação do abaci.one"],"ru":["ии агенты","интерактивная платформа для обучения соробану","технология ии для образования","как использовать abaci.one","abaci.one vs конкуренты","руководство по установке abaci.one"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","منصة تعلم السوروبان التفاعلية","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي للتعليم","كيفية استخدام abaci.one","abaci.one مقابل المنافسين","دليل تثبيت abaci.one"]}},"owner":"antialias","repo":"abaci-one","repoPath":"antialias/abaci-one","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.731Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-tts","description":"Adds text-to-speech audio help to a feature using the TTS system. Use when adding voice narration, audio feedback, or spoken instructions to any part of the app.","bodyPreview":"# Adding TTS Audio to a Feature\n\nThis skill walks you through adding text-to-speech audio to a feature in the app. The TTS system plays audio via a **voice chain** (pregenerated mp3 → on-demand generation via OpenAI → browser SpeechSynthesis → subtitles). Clips are collected at runtime, persisted to the database, and generated as high-quality OpenAI TTS mp3s — either on-the-fly during playback (if the `generate` chain entry is configured) or in batch from the admin panel.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n*","body":"# Adding TTS Audio to a Feature\n\nThis skill walks you through adding text-to-speech audio to a feature in the app. The TTS system plays audio via a **voice chain** (pregenerated mp3 → on-demand generation via OpenAI → browser SpeechSynthesis → subtitles). Clips are collected at runtime, persisted to the database, and generated as high-quality OpenAI TTS mp3s — either on-the-fly during playback (if the `generate` chain entry is configured) or in batch from the admin panel.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**Read the integration guide:** `apps/web/.claude/reference/tts-audio-system.md`\n\nIt contains the full API reference, patterns, anti-patterns, and existing implementations.\n\n## Your Job\n\n1. Understand what text the feature needs spoken and when\n2. Create a feature-specific audio hook\n3. Wire it into the component\n4. Verify with TypeScript\n\n## Step 1: Design the Utterances\n\nFor each piece of audio the feature needs, determine:\n\n- **What** text to speak (static string or dynamic from state/props)\n- **When** to speak it (on mount, on state change, on user action, on completion)\n- **How** it should sound (tone — write as voice-actor stage directions)\n\n## Step 2: Create a Feature Audio Hook\n\nCreate a hook in the feature''s `hooks/` directory. This hook owns text construction, tone strings, auto-play logic, and cleanup.\n\n**Read the reference implementation first:**\n```\napps/web/src/components/practice/hooks/usePracticeAudioHelp.ts\n```\n\n**Key rules:**\n\n1. **Tone strings must be module-level constants** — never compute them dynamically per render\n2. **Always clean up on unmount** — call `stop()` in a cleanup effect\n3. **Use refs to track previous values** — prevents re-playing on every render\n4. **Guard with `isEnabled`** — respect the user''s audio toggle\n\n**Template:**\n\n```typescript\n''use client''\n\nimport { useEffect, useRef } from ''react''\nimport { useTTS } from ''@/hooks/useTTS''\nimport { useAudioManager } from ''@/hooks/useAudioManager''\n\n// Stable tone constants — changing these creates new clips\nconst INSTRUCTION_TONE =\n  ''Patiently guiding a young child. Clear, slow, friendly.''\nconst CELEBRATION_TONE =\n  ''Warmly congratulating a child. Genuinely encouraging and happy.''\n\ninterface UseMyFeatureAudioHelpOptions {\n  currentStep: string\n  isComplete: boolean\n}\n\nexport function useMyFeatureAudioHelp({\n  currentStep,\n  isComplete,\n}: UseMyFeatureAudioHelpOptions) {\n  const { isEnabled, stop } = useAudioManager()\n\n  // Declare utterances\n  const sayInstruction = useTTS(currentStep, { tone: INSTRUCTION_TONE })\n  const sayCelebration = useTTS(\n    isComplete ? ''Well done!'' : '''',\n    { tone: CELEBRATION_TONE },\n  )\n\n  // Auto-play when step changes\n  const prevStepRef = useRef<string>('''')\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!isEnabled || !currentStep || currentStep === prevStepRef.current) return\n    prevStepRef.current = currentStep\n    sayInstruction()\n  }, [isEnabled, currentStep, sayInstruction])\n\n  // Auto-play celebration on completion\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!isEnabled || !isComplete) return\n    sayCelebration()\n  }, [isEnabled, isComplete, sayCelebration])\n\n  // Stop audio on unmount\n  useEffect(() => {\n    return () => stop()\n  }, [stop])\n\n  return { replay: sayInstruction }\n}\n```\n\n## Step 3: Wire Into the Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMyFeatureAudioHelp } from ''./hooks/useMyFeatureAudioHelp''\nimport { useAudioManager } from ''@/hooks/useAudioManager''\n\nfunction MyFeature() {\n  const { isEnabled, isPlaying } = useAudioManager()\n  const { replay } = useMyFeatureAudioHelp({\n    currentStep: ''Tap the bead to move it up'',\n    isComplete: false,\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {isEnabled && (\n        <button onClick={replay} disabled={isPlaying}>\n          {isPlaying ? ''Speaking...'' : ''Replay''}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Step 4: Verify\n\n```bash\ncd apps/web && npx tsc --noEmit\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Dynamic text from state\n\n```typescript\nconst text = useMemo(\n  () => (terms ? termsToSentence(terms) : ''''),\n  [terms],\n)\nconst sayProblem = useTTS(text, { tone: MATH_TONE })\n```\n\n### One-shot playback (play once, don''t repeat)\n\n```typescript\nconst playedRef = useRef(false)\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (!shouldPlay || playedRef.current) return\n  playedRef.current = true\n  sayIt()\n}, [shouldPlay, sayIt])\n\n// Reset when trigger resets\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (!shouldPlay) playedRef.current = false\n}, [shouldPlay])\n```\n\n### Multiple utterances — play the right one\n\n```typescript\nconst sayStep1 = useTTS(''First, look at the abacus'', { tone: INST })\nconst sayStep2 = useTTS(''Now tap the bead'', { tone: INST })\n\n// speak() stops previous before starting\nif (step === 0) sayStep1()\nif (step === 1) sayStep2()\n```\n\n## Tone String Guidelines\n\nWrite tones as **voice-actor stage directions**. Be specific about emotion, pace, and audience.\n\n**Good examples:**\n- `''Speaking clearly and steadily, reading a math problem to a young child. Pause slightly between each number and operator.''`\n- `''Warmly congratulating a child. Genuinely encouraging and happy.''`\n- `''Gently guiding a child after a wrong answer. Kind, not disappointed.''`\n- `''Patiently guiding a young child through an abacus tutorial. Clear, slow, friendly.''`\n\n**Bad examples:**\n- `''Read this text''` — too vague\n- `` `Speaking ${mood}` `` — dynamic per render, creates new clips every time\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n1. **Never use raw `speechSynthesis`** — always go through `useTTS` so the voice chain and collection work\n2. **Never forget cleanup** — always `useEffect(() => () => stop(), [stop])`\n3. **Never use dynamic tone strings** — keep them as module-level constants\n4. **Never call `speak()` unconditionally in render** — always guard with refs and `isEnabled`\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `src/hooks/useTTS.ts` | Primary hook — declare (text, tone), get speak function |\n| `src/hooks/useAudioManager.ts` | Reactive state — isEnabled, isPlaying, volume, subtitles, stop() |\n| `src/lib/audio/TtsAudioManager.ts` | Core engine — voice chain, playback, collection, subtitles |\n| `src/lib/audio/voiceSource.ts` | Voice source class hierarchy — polymorphic `generate()` per voice type |\n| `src/contexts/AudioManagerContext.tsx` | React context — singleton manager, boot-time manifest loading |\n| `src/lib/audio/termsToSentence.ts` | `[5, 3]` → `\"five plus three\"` |\n| `src/lib/audio/buildFeedbackText.ts` | Correct/incorrect feedback sentences |\n| `src/lib/audio/numberToEnglish.ts` | `42` → `\"forty two\"` |\n\n## Voice Chain\n\nAudio plays through the voice chain in order. The typical chain is:\n\n```\npregenerated voice (nova) → auto-generate → browser TTS → subtitles\n```\n\n- **Pregenerated**: instant playback from pre-generated mp3 on disk\n- **Auto-generate**: calls OpenAI on-the-fly if the pregenerated mp3 is missing, caches result\n- **Browser TTS**: uses the browser''s built-in speech synthesis\n- **Subtitles**: shows text on screen with a reading-time timer\n\nYou don''t need to think about this when adding TTS to a feature — just use `useTTS()` and the chain handles fallback automatically. The admin configures the chain at `/admin/audio`.\n\n## Reference Implementations\n\n| Hook | Location | What it does |\n|------|----------|-------------|\n| `usePracticeAudioHelp` | `src/components/practice/hooks/` | Reads math problems, correct/incorrect feedback |\n| `useTutorialAudioHelp` | `src/components/tutorial/hooks/` | Speaks tutorial step instructions |\n\nFollow `usePracticeAudioHelp` as the most complete example.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:59:38.645Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced text-to-speech audio integration via voice chains and OpenAI TTS mp3 generation.","zh":"非常适合需要通过语音链和 OpenAI TTS mp3 生成实现高级文本转语音集成的 AI 代理。","ja":"OpenAI TTS mp3 生成やボイスチェーンを介した高度なテキストから音声への統合を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenAI TTS mp3 생성 및 음성 체인을 통한 고급 텍스트-음성 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan una integración avanzada de audio de texto a voz a través de cadenas de voz y generación de mp3 de OpenAI TTS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une intégration audio avancée de texte à parole via des chaînes vocales et une génération de mp3 OpenAI TTS.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Text-to-Speech-Audio-Integration über Sprachketten und OpenAI-TTS-mp3-Generierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de integração avançada de áudio de texto-para-fala via cadeias de voz e geração de mp3 OpenAI TTS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция текста в речь через голосовые цепочки и генерацию mp3 OpenAI TTS.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إدماج متقدم للصوت النصي-النطقي عبر سلاسل الصوت وتوليد OpenAI TTS mp3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality TTS audio clips via OpenAI, utilizing browser SpeechSynthesis and subtitles, and persisting them to a database for on-demand playback or batch generation.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的 TTS 音频剪辑的能力，利用 OpenAI、浏览器 SpeechSynthesis 和字幕，并将其持久化到数据库中，以实现按需播放或批量生成。","ja":"OpenAI、ブラウザの SpeechSynthesis、および字幕を利用して、高品質の TTS オーディオクリップを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、データベースに保存して、オンデマンド再生またはバッチ生成を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenAI, 브라우저 SpeechSynthesis 및 자막을 사용하여 고품질의 TTS 오디오 클립을 생성하여 데이터베이스에 저장하고, 필요에 따라 재생 또는 일괄 생성을 thực現하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar clips de audio de TTS de alta calidad a través de OpenAI, utilizando la síntesis de voz del navegador y subtítulos, y persistiéndolos en una base de datos para reproducción bajo demanda o generación por lotes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des clips audio TTS de haute qualité via OpenAI, en utilisant la synthèse vocale du navigateur et des sous-titres, et en les persistant dans une base de données pour une lecture à la demande ou une génération par lots.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, hochwertige TTS-Audio-Clips über OpenAI zu generieren, indem sie die Sprachsynthese des Browsers und Untertitel verwenden und diese in einer Datenbank für die Wiedergabe auf Abruf oder die Batch-Generierung persistieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar clips de áudio TTS de alta qualidade via OpenAI, utilizando SpeechSynthesis do navegador e legendas, e persistindo-os em um banco de dados para reprodução sob demanda ou geração em lote.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать клипы аудио TTS высокого качества через OpenAI, используя SpeechSynthesis браузера и субтитры, и сохраняя их в базе данных для воспроизведения по требованию или пакетной генерации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد مقاطع صوتية TTS ذات جودة عالية عبر OpenAI، باستخدام SpeechSynthesis للمتصفح والترجمة، وتحفيزها في قاعدة بيانات للتشغيل عند الطلب أو التوليد بالدفعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating on-demand TTS audio for interactive features","Persisting TTS clips to a database for later playback","Batch generating high-quality OpenAI TTS mp3s from the admin panel"],"zh":["为交互功能生成按需 TTS 音频","将 TTS 剪辑持久化到数据库以便后续播放","从管理面板批量生成高质量的 OpenAI TTS mp3"],"ja":["インタラクティブ機能のためにオンデマンド TTS オーディオを生成する","TTS クリップをデータベースに保存して後で再生する","管理パネルから高品質の OpenAI TTS mp3 をバッチ生成する"],"ko":["대화형 기능을 위해 실시간 TTS 오디오 생성하기","TTS 클립을 데이터베이스에 저장하여 후속 재생","관리 패널에서 고품질 OpenAI TTS mp3 일괄 생성"],"es":["Generar audio de TTS bajo demanda para características interactivas","Persistir clips de TTS en una base de datos para reproducción posterior","Generar por lotes mp3 de TTS de alta calidad de OpenAI desde el panel de administración"],"fr":["Générer de l''audio TTS à la demande pour des fonctionnalités interactives","Persister des clips TTS dans une base de données pour une lecture ultérieure","Générer par lots des mp3 TTS de haute qualité d''OpenAI depuis le panneau d''administration"],"de":["Erzeugen von TTS-Audio auf Abruf für interaktive Funktionen","Persistieren von TTS-Clips in einer Datenbank für spätere Wiedergabe","Erzeugen von hochwertigen OpenAI-TTS-mp3s in Chargen über das Admin-Panel"],"pt":["Gerar áudio TTS sob demanda para recursos interativos","Persistir clips TTS em um banco de dados para reprodução posterior","Gerar em lote mp3s TTS OpenAI de alta qualidade a partir do painel de administração"],"ru":["Генерировать аудио TTS по требованию для интерактивных функций","Сохранять клипы TTS в базе данных для последующего воспроизведения","Пакетная генерация mp3 TTS OpenAI высокого качества из панели администратора"],"ar":["توليد صوت TTS عند الطلب لميزات التفاعل","تحفيز مقاطع TTS في قاعدة بيانات للتشغيل في وقت لاحق","التوليد الدفعة لملفات mp3 TTS OpenAI عالية الجودة من لوحة التحكم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API configuration","Dependent on browser SpeechSynthesis compatibility","Needs database access for clip persistence"],"zh":["需要 OpenAI API 配置","依赖浏览器 SpeechSynthesis 兼容性","需要数据库访问以实现剪辑持久化"],"ja":["OpenAI API の設定が必要","ブラウザの SpeechSynthesis との互換性に依存する","クリップの永続化のためにデータベースへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["OpenAI API 구성이 필요합니다","브라우저 SpeechSynthesis 호환성에 종속됨","클립 영속화를 위해 데이터베이스 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la API de OpenAI","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de la síntesis de voz del navegador","Necesita acceso a la base de datos para la persistencia de clips"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''API OpenAI","Dépend de la compatibilité de la synthèse vocale du navigateur","Nécessite un accès à la base de données pour la persistance des clips"],"de":["Benötigt OpenAI-API-Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der Sprachsynthese des Browsers","Benötigt Datenbankzugriff für die Persistenz von Clips"],"pt":["Requer configuração da API OpenAI","Dependente da compatibilidade do SpeechSynthesis do navegador","Necessita acesso ao banco de dados para persistência de clips"],"ru":["Требует настройки API OpenAI","Зависит от совместимости SpeechSynthesis браузера","Требует доступа к базе данных для сохранения клипов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenAI","يعتمد على توافق SpeechSynthesis للمتصفح","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات لتحفيز المقاطع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7f01b83d8839d9b00a617a841d01be7645ea41d52eea649c413d058b539f8f33","qualityScore":40}');
