de":"KI-Tools: release-npm-trustme für automatisierte npm-Konf...","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: release-npm-trustme - Automatize npm T...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: release-npm-trustme - Автоматизация настройки ...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: release-npm-trustme - تلقيم إعداد...","en":"release-npm-trustme"},"description":{"zh":"release-npm-trustme 是一个自动化 npm Trusted Publisher 设置的 AI 工具，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"release-npm-trustme は npm Trusted Publisher の設定を自動化する AI エージェントです","ko":"release-npm-trustme는 npm 트러스트드 퍼블리셔 설정을 자동화하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"release-npm-trustme es una herramienta de AI que automatiza la configuración de Trusted Publisher en npm para mejorar la seguridad y la eficiencia","fr":"release-npm-trustme est un outil d''IA qui automatise la configuration de Trusted Publisher dans npm pour améliorer la sécurité et l''efficacité","de":"release-npm-trustme ist ein KI-Tool, das die Konfiguration von Trusted Publisher in npm automatisiert, um die Sicherheit und Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"O release-npm-trustme é uma ferramenta de automação para configuração do npm Trusted Publisher, garantindo a segurança e a eficiência do seu projeto","ru":"Release-npm-trustme - это инструмент для автоматизации настройки npm Trusted Publisher, обеспечивающий безопасность и эффективность вашего проекта","ar":"release-npm-trustme هو أداة تلقيم لإعدادات npm Trusted Publisher، مما يضمن أمان وكفاءة مشروعك","en":"npm-trustme automates npm Trusted Publisher setup"},"definition":{"en":"npm-trustme automates npm Trusted Publisher setup"},"features":{"zh":["自动化 npm Trusted Publisher 设置","提高开发效率","支持 Node.js 和 npm","易于使用和集成","提高代码安全性"],"ja":["npm Trusted Publisher の設定を自動化","開発効率を向上させる","Node.js と npm をサポート","簡単に使用および統合","コードのセキュリティを向上させる"],"ko":["npm 트러스트드 퍼블리셔 설정을 자동화","개발 효율성을 향상시키기","Node.js 및 npm 지원","쉽게 사용 및 통합","코드 보안 향상"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración de Trusted Publisher","Mejora de la seguridad en npm","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Configuración sencilla y rápida","Compatibilidad con Node.js y CLI"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration de Trusted Publisher","Amélioration de la sécurité dans npm","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Configuration simple et rapide","Compatibilité avec Node.js et CLI"],"de":["Automatisierung der Konfiguration von Trusted Publisher","Verbesserung der Sicherheit in npm","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Einfache und schnelle Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit Node.js und CLI"],"pt":["Automação da configuração do npm Trusted Publisher","Melhoria da segurança do projeto","Eficiência na gestão de dependências","Integração com o CLI","Suporte ao Node.js"],"ru":["Автоматизация настройки npm Trusted Publisher","Повышение безопасности проекта","Эффективность в управлении зависимостями","Интеграция с CLI","Поддержка Node.js"],"ar":["تلقيم إعدادات npm Trusted Publisher","تحسين أمان المشروع","كفاءة في إدارة الإعتماديات","التكامل مع CLI","دعم Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 release-npm-trustme","什么是 npm Trusted Publisher","release-npm-trustme 替代品","release-npm-trustme 安装","npm Trusted Publisher 设置指南","Node.js 开发工具","自动化 npm 设置","提高代码安全性"],"ja":["release-npm-trustme の使用方法","npm Trusted Publisher とは","release-npm-trustme の代替","release-npm-trustme のインストール","npm Trusted Publisher の設定ガイド","Node.js 開発ツール","npm の自動化","コードのセキュリティを向上させる"],"ko":["release-npm-trustme 사용 방법","npm 트러스트드 퍼블리셔란","release-npm-trustme 대체","release-npm-trustme 설치","npm 트러스트드 퍼블리셔 설정 가이드","Node.js 개발 도구","npm 자동화","코드 보안 향상"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","release-npm-trustme","Trusted Publisher en npm","cómo usar release-npm-trustme","mejora de la seguridad en npm","alternativas a release-npm-trustme","release-npm-trustme vs otras herramientas","instalación de release-npm-trustme","guía de configuración de release-npm-trustme"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","release-npm-trustme","Trusted Publisher dans npm","comment utiliser release-npm-trustme","amélioration de la sécurité dans npm","alternatives à release-npm-trustme","release-npm-trustme vs autres outils","installation de release-npm-trustme","guide de configuration de release-npm-trustme"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","release-npm-trustme","Trusted Publisher in npm","wie man release-npm-trustme verwendet","verbesserung der Sicherheit in npm","alternativen zu release-npm-trustme","release-npm-trustme vs andere Tools","installation von release-npm-trustme","konfigurationsanleitung für release-npm-trustme"],"pt":["como usar release-npm-trustme","o que é npm Trusted Publisher","release-npm-trustme vs npm","guia de instalação do release-npm-trustme","configuração do npm Trusted Publisher","ferramentas de automação para npm","segurança do projeto com release-npm-trustme","release-npm-trustme alternative"],"ru":["как использовать release-npm-trustme","что такое npm Trusted Publisher","release-npm-trustme vs npm","руководство по установке release-npm-trustme","настройка npm Trusted Publisher","инструменты автоматизации для npm","безопасность проекта с release-npm-trustme","release-npm-trustme альтернатива"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام release-npm-trustme","ما هو npm Trusted Publisher","release-npm-trustme vs npm","دليل تثبيت release-npm-trustme","إعدادات npm Trusted Publisher","أدوات تلقيم لنpm","أمان المشروع مع release-npm-trustme","release-npm-trustme بديل"]}},"owner":"regenrek","repo":"npm-trustme","repoPath":"regenrek/npm-trustme","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.741Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-npm-trustme","description":"Release automation for npm-trustme. Use when asked to cut a new npm-trustme version, run the release script, or tag/publish a new release.","bodyPreview":"# release-npm-trustme\n\n## Overview\n\nRun `scripts/release.ts` to bump the version, build, tag, and push a release for npm-trustme.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Open the repo: `cd ~/projects/npm-trustme`\n- Ensure the working tree is clean (the script will refuse to run otherwise).\n- Pick the version bump: `patch` | `minor` | `major` or a specific semver.\n- Run: `pnpm tsx scripts/release.ts <bump>`\n- The script builds, commits, tags, pushes, and (if `gh` is installed) creates/updates a GitHub Release.\n\n## Examp","body":"# release-npm-trustme\n\n## Overview\n\nRun `scripts/release.ts` to bump the version, build, tag, and push a release for npm-trustme.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Open the repo: `cd ~/projects/npm-trustme`\n- Ensure the working tree is clean (the script will refuse to run otherwise).\n- Pick the version bump: `patch` | `minor` | `major` or a specific semver.\n- Run: `pnpm tsx scripts/release.ts <bump>`\n- The script builds, commits, tags, pushes, and (if `gh` is installed) creates/updates a GitHub Release.\n\n## Examples\n\n```\npnpm tsx scripts/release.ts patch\npnpm tsx scripts/release.ts minor\npnpm tsx scripts/release.ts 0.2.0\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The script pushes to the current branch and tags; confirm the branch before running.\n- Release notes use `CHANGELOG.md` if present. Set `GH_NOTES_REF` to override the changelog section.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:06:12.450Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub Agents automating npm package releases with version bumping and tagging capabilities.","zh":"适合用于 GitHub Agents 自动化 npm 包发布，具有版本升级和标签功能。","ja":"GitHub Agents が npm パッケージのリリースを自動化するのに適しています。バージョンアップとタグ付けの機能を備えています。","ko":"GitHub Agents가 npm 패키지 릴리스를 자동화하는 데 적합하며 버전 업그레이드 및 태그 지정 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de GitHub que automatizan lanzamientos de paquetes npm con capacidad de incremento y etiquetado de versiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents GitHub automatisant les sorties de packages npm avec des fonctionnalités d''incrémentation et d''étiquetage de versions.","de":"Ideal für GitHub-Agents, die npm-Paket-Veröffentlichungen mit Versionsinkrement- und Tagging-Funktionen automatisieren.","pt":"Ideal para agentes do GitHub que automatizam a liberação de pacotes npm com recursos de aumento de versão e marcação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов GitHub, автоматизирующих выпуск пакетов npm с возможностью увеличения версии и тегирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل GitHub الذي يقوم بتشغيل إصدارات حزمة npm مع زيادة إصدار وتوصيف القدرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate npm Trusted Publisher setup, handling version bumps, builds, and GitHub Releases using scripts like `release.ts` and tools such as `pnpm` and `gh` for seamless deployment and version control.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化 npm 受信任的发布者设置、处理版本升级、构建和 GitHub Releases 的能力，使用诸如 `release.ts` 的脚本和诸如 `pnpm` 和 `gh` 的工具，以实现无缝的部署和版本控制。","ja":"エージェントが npm 信頼されたパブリッシャーの設定、バージョンアップ、ビルド、および GitHub Releases を自動化できるようにします。`release.ts` のようなスクリプトと、`pnpm` および `gh` のようなツールを使用して、シームレスなデプロイとバージョン管理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 npm 트러스트된 퍼블리셔 설정, 버전 업그레이드, 빌드 및 GitHub 릴리스를 자동화할 수 있도록 해줍니다. `release.ts`와 같은 스크립트와 `pnpm` 및 `gh`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 무결점 배포 및 버전 관리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la configuración de npm Trusted Publisher, manejo de incrementos de versión, compilaciones y GitHub Releases utilizando scripts como `release.ts` y herramientas como `pnpm` y `gh` para una implementación y control de versiones sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la configuration de npm Trusted Publisher, la gestion des increments de version, des builds et des GitHub Releases en utilisant des scripts tels que `release.ts` et des outils tels que `pnpm` et `gh` pour un déploiement et un contrôle de version sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die npm Trusted Publisher-Konfiguration zu automatisieren, versionsbezogene Inkremente, Builds und GitHub-Veröffentlichungen mithilfe von Skripten wie `release.ts` und Tools wie `pnpm` und `gh` für eine reibungslose Bereitstellung und Versionskontrolle zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a configuração do Publicador Confiável do npm, manipulando aumentos de versão, compilações e Lançamentos do GitHub usando scripts como `release.ts` e ferramentas como `pnpm` e `gh` para implantação e controle de versão sem interrupções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать настройку доверенного издателя npm, обрабатывая увеличение версии, сборку и выпуск GitHub с помощью скриптов, таких как `release.ts`, и инструментов, таких как `pnpm` и `gh`, для бесшовной развертывания и контроля версий.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من توفير إعدادات الناشر الموثوق به لبرنامج npm ، معالجة زيادة الإصدار ، والبناء ، وإصدار GitHub باستخدام سكريبتات مثل `release.ts` وأدوات مثل `pnpm` و `gh` لنشر ومراقبة الإصدارات بسلاسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating npm package releases with semantic versioning","Streamlining GitHub Release creation and updates","Simplifying version bumping and tagging for npm packages"],"zh":["使用语义化版本自动化 npm 包发布","简化 GitHub Release 创建和更新","简化 npm 包的版本升级和标签"],"ja":["セマンティック バージョニングを使用した npm パッケージのリリースを自動化する","GitHub Release の作成と更新を簡素化する","npm パッケージのバージョンアップとタグ付けを簡素化する"],"ko":["시맨틱 버저닝을 사용한 npm 패키지 릴리스 자동화","GitHub 릴리스 생성 및 업데이트 간소화","npm 패키지의 버전 업그레이드 및 태그 지정 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar lanzamientos de paquetes npm con versiones semánticas","Optimizar la creación y actualización de GitHub Release","Simplificar el incremento y etiquetado de versiones para paquetes npm"],"fr":["Automatiser les sorties de packages npm avec des versions sémantiques","Optimiser la création et la mise à jour de GitHub Release","Simplifier l''incrémentation et l''étiquetage des versions pour les packages npm"],"de":["Automatisierung von npm-Paket-Veröffentlichungen mit semantischer Versionierung","Optimierung der Erstellung und Aktualisierung von GitHub-Veröffentlichungen","Vereinfachung des Versionsinkrements und Taggings für npm-Pakete"],"pt":["Automatizar a liberação de pacotes npm com versionamento semântico","Streamlining a criação e atualização de Lançamentos do GitHub","Simplificar o aumento de versão e marcação para pacotes npm"],"ru":["Автоматизация выпуска пакетов npm с семантическим версионированием","Упрощение создания и обновления выпусков GitHub","Упрощение увеличения версии и тегирования для пакетов npm"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إصدار حزمة npm مع إصدار متوافق","تسهيل إنشاء وتحديث إصدارات GitHub","تسهيل زيادة الإصدار وتسمية حزمة npm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a clean working tree to run","Needs `gh` installed for GitHub Release functionality","Specific to npm package management"],"zh":["需要一个干净的工作树来运行","需要安装 `gh` 来实现 GitHub Release 功能","仅特定于 npm 包管理"],"ja":["実行するにはクリーンなワーキングツリーが必要","GitHub Release 機能を実現するには `gh` をインストールする必要がある","npm パッケージ管理にのみ特化"],"ko":["실행하기 위해 깨끗한 워킹 트리가 필요함","GitHub 릴리스 기능을 구현하기 위해 `gh`를 설치해야 함","npm 패키지 관리에만 특화"],"es":["Requiere un árbol de trabajo limpio para ejecutarse","Necesita `gh` instalado para la funcionalidad de GitHub Release","Específico para la gestión de paquetes npm"],"fr":["Nécessite un arbre de travail propre pour s''exécuter","A besoin de `gh` installé pour la fonctionnalité de GitHub Release","Spécifique à la gestion de packages npm"],"de":["Benötigt einen sauberen Arbeitsbereich, um ausgeführt zu werden","Benötigt `gh` installiert für die GitHub-Release-Funktionalität","Spezifisch für die Verwaltung von npm-Paketen"],"pt":["Exige uma árvore de trabalho limpa para executar","Necessita `gh` instalado para funcionalidade de Lançamento do GitHub","Específico para gerenciamento de pacotes npm"],"ru":["Требует чистого рабочего дерева для запуска","Требует `gh` для функциональности выпуска GitHub","Относится к управлению пакетами npm"],"ar":["يتطلب شجرة عمل نظيفة للتشغيل","يحتاج إلى `gh` لتثبيت وظيفة إصدار GitHub","محدد لإدارة حزمة npm"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"791ea43dceba043365688697b2a7f08302efdd3938a291ed632dfd5e973c8b73","qualityScore":40}');
