requisitos","Análise de necessidades","Documentação de requisitos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js"],"ru":["Идентификация требований","Анализ потребностей","Документирование требований","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка языков программирования seperti Python и Node.js"],"ar":["تحديد المتطلبات","تحليل الاحتياجات","توثيق المتطلبات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","需求分析工具","如何使用AI智能代理","什么是需求分析","AI智能代理替代品","需求分析工具安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","要件分析ツール","AIエージェントの使用方法","要件分析とは","AIエージェントの代替品","要件分析ツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","요구사항 분석 도구","AI 에이전트 사용법","요구사항 분석이란","AI 에이전트 대체품","요구사항 분석 도구 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de inteligencia artificial","qué es el análisis de requisitos","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para YouTube","alternativas a las herramientas de análisis de requisitos","instalación de herramientas de inteligencia artificial","guía de configuración para herramientas de inteligencia artificial","análisis de requisitos vs análisis de datos","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''intelligence artificielle","quoi est l''analyse de besoins","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour YouTube","alternatives aux outils d''analyse de besoins","installation d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","guide de configuration pour les outils d''intelligence artificielle","analyse de besoins vs analyse de données","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Anforderungsanalyse","KI-Tools für YouTube","Alternativen zu Anforderungsanalyse-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools","Anforderungsanalyse vs Datenanalyse","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["análise de requisitos","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de software","requisitos de projeto","como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é análise de requisitos","alternativas para análise de requisitos","instalação de ferramentas de IA","guia de configuração de ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","анализ требований","разработка программного обеспечения","требования проекта","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое анализ требований","альтернативы для анализа требований","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل المتطلبات","تطوير البرمجيات","متطلبات المشروع","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تحليل المتطلبات","بديلات لتحليل المتطلبات","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"aizhimou","repo":"pigeon-pod","repoPath":"aizhimou/pigeon-pod","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.754Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"requirements-analysis","description":"Analyze product/feature requirements for the PigeonPod project with software engineering rigor. Use when users ask to evaluate a requirements value, feasibility, architecture fit, implementation impact, risk, delivery scope, or tradeoffs. Always inspect current repository docs/code first (especially architecture and README files), then use MCP tools (including Context7) to verify external library/framework/API constraints before concluding.","bodyPreview":"# Requirements Analysis\n\nAnalyze requirements against PigeonPod goals, current architecture, and implementation reality.\n\n## Follow This Workflow\n\n1. Restate the requirement in one short paragraph.\n2. Identify requirement type: `feature`, `enhancement`, `bugfix`, `non-functional`, `integration`, or `migration`.\n3. Define expected user value and business value.\n4. Read relevant project docs and code before giving conclusions.\n5. Use MCP/Context7 to confirm dependency or API constraints when exter","body":"# Requirements Analysis\n\nAnalyze requirements against PigeonPod goals, current architecture, and implementation reality.\n\n## Follow This Workflow\n\n1. Restate the requirement in one short paragraph.\n2. Identify requirement type: `feature`, `enhancement`, `bugfix`, `non-functional`, `integration`, or `migration`.\n3. Define expected user value and business value.\n4. Read relevant project docs and code before giving conclusions.\n5. Use MCP/Context7 to confirm dependency or API constraints when external libraries/services are involved.\n6. Evaluate architecture fit, implementation complexity, data impact, and operational impact.\n7. Propose an implementation strategy with phased scope (`MVP`, `next`, `later`).\n8. Output a decision with explicit rationale and open questions.\n\n## Read Local Context First\n\nPrioritize these files for PigeonPod:\n\n- `README.md`\n- `dev-docs/architecture/architecture-design-en.md`\n- `backend/src/main/resources/application.yml`\n- `backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/*.sql`\n- Relevant backend packages under `backend/src/main/java/top/asimov/pigeon/`\n- Relevant frontend routes/components under `frontend/src/pages/` and `frontend/src/components/`\n\nUse fast discovery commands when needed:\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"keyword|concept|module\" backend/src/main/java frontend/src dev-docs README.md\nrg --files dev-docs/\n```\n\n## Use Context7 and MCP Deliberately\n\nUse Context7/MCP when the requirement depends on framework/library/service behavior, version constraints, configuration, or integration details.\n\nTypical triggers:\n\n- Spring Boot/MyBatis-Plus/Sa-Token behavior or config decisions\n- React/Mantine/React Router/i18next/Axios constraints\n- YouTube Data API v3 limits/quotas/contract details\n- RSS/Podcasting namespace compatibility details\n- yt-dlp options/behavior and compatibility implications\n\nRules:\n\n- Resolve library ID first, then query focused questions.\n- Prefer primary/official docs and version-aware guidance.\n- Distinguish facts from inference.\n- If docs conflict with local implementation, prioritize local code reality and call out the gap.\n\n## Evaluate With These Dimensions\n\nAssess each dimension explicitly:\n\n1. Value Alignment: Match with PigeonPod core goals (YouTube-to-podcast conversion, auto-sync/download, feed usability, operations simplicity).\n2. Feasibility: Confirm technical possibility with current stack and constraints.\n3. Architecture Fit: Check compatibility with backend service boundaries, scheduler/event flow, DB schema, and frontend route/state model.\n4. Data and Migration Impact: Identify new fields/tables, migration requirements, backfill, and backward compatibility.\n5. API and Contract Impact: Identify REST/RSS contract changes and consumer compatibility risks.\n6. Security and Compliance: Review auth, permissions, secrets/API keys, abuse vectors.\n7. Performance and Cost: Estimate queue pressure, I/O/download load, external API quota consumption, and storage growth.\n8. Testability and Operability: Define unit/integration/e2e coverage and monitoring/logging needs.\n\n## Produce This Output Format\n\nUse this structure in final analysis:\n\n```markdown\n## Requirement Summary\n- User request:\n- Requirement type:\n- Assumptions:\n\n## Value Assessment\n- User value:\n- Product/business value:\n- Priority suggestion: High/Medium/Low\n\n## Feasibility and Architecture Fit\n- Current touchpoints:\n- Proposed changes:\n- Architecture fit verdict: Good/Partial/Poor\n\n## Impact Analysis\n- Backend impact:\n- Frontend impact:\n- Database/migration impact:\n- External dependency impact:\n- Security/performance/ops impact:\n\n## Delivery Plan\n- MVP scope:\n- Non-MVP scope:\n- Estimated complexity: S/M/L/XL\n- Key risks and mitigations:\n\n## Decision\n- Recommendation: Proceed / Proceed with constraints / Defer / Reject\n- Reasoning:\n- Open questions:\n```\n\n## Decision Heuristics\n\n- Recommend `Proceed` when value is clear, fit is good, and risk is manageable.\n- Recommend `Proceed with constraints` when value is high but scope/risk needs staged delivery.\n- Recommend `Defer` when value exists but prerequisites are missing.\n- Recommend `Reject` when requirement conflicts with core goals or creates disproportional cost/risk.\n\n## Quality Bar\n\nBefore finalizing, verify all checks:\n\n- Base conclusions on repository evidence, not assumptions only.\n- Confirm external-library/API claims through Context7/MCP when relevant.\n- Separate facts, assumptions, and unknowns.\n- Include at least one feasible implementation path.\n- Include explicit tradeoffs and rollback/fallback considerations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:13:22.758Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced requirements analysis capabilities to align with project goals and architecture.","zh":"适用于Claude Code和AutoGPT等AI代理，需要高级需求分析能力以符合项目目标和架构。","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのようなAIエージェントに適しています。プロジェクトの目標やアーキテクチャと一致するために、高度な要件分析機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 프로젝트 목표와 아키텍처에 맞추기 위해 고급 요구 사항 분석 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren capacidades avanzadas de análisis de requisitos para alinearlos con los objetivos y la arquitectura del proyecto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités avancées d''analyse des exigences pour les aligner sur les objectifs et l''architecture du projet.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Anforderungsanalysefunktionen benötigen, um sie mit den Projektzielen und der Architektur abzustimmen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que requerem capacidades avançadas de análise de requisitos para alinhar com os objetivos e arquitetura do projeto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа требований для соответствия целям и архитектуре проекта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يتطلبون khảائات متقدمة لتحليل المتطلبات للتطابق مع أهداف ومعمارية المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate requirements against project objectives, identify requirement types such as feature, enhancement, and bugfix, and define expected user and business value using MCP/Context7 for dependency confirmation.","zh":"赋予代理评估需求与项目目标的一致性，识别需求类型（如功能、增强和bug修复），并使用MCP/Context7定义预期用户和业务价值以确认依赖关系。","ja":"エージェントが要件をプロジェクトの目的と照合し、機能、強化、バグ修正などの要件タイプを識別し、MCP/Context7を使用して期待されるユーザーとビジネス価値を定義する依存関係の確認を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 요구 사항을 프로젝트 목표와 일치시키고, 기능, 향상, 버그 수정 등의 요구 사항 유형을 식별하며, MCP/Context7를 사용하여 예상 사용자 및 비즈니스 가치를 정의하여 의존성을 확인할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes evaluar los requisitos frente a los objetivos del proyecto, identificar tipos de requisitos como características, mejoras y correcciones de errores, y definir el valor esperado para el usuario y el negocio utilizando MCP/Context7 para la confirmación de dependencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer les exigences par rapport aux objectifs du projet, d''identifier les types d''exigences tels que les fonctionnalités, les améliorations et les corrections de bogues, et de définir la valeur attendue pour l''utilisateur et l''entreprise en utilisant MCP/Context7 pour la confirmation des dépendances.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Anforderungen im Vergleich zu den Projektzielen zu bewerten, Anforderungstypen wie Funktionen, Verbesserungen und Fehlerbehebungen zu identifizieren und den erwarteten Nutzen für den Benutzer und das Unternehmen unter Verwendung von MCP/Context7 für die Bestätigung von Abhängigkeiten zu definieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar os requisitos contra os objetivos do projeto, identificar tipos de requisitos, como recurso, melhoria e correção de bugs, e definir o valor esperado do usuário e do negócio usando MCP/Context7 para confirmação de dependência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценивать требования в соответствии с целями проекта, определять типы требований, такие как функция, улучшение и исправление ошибок, и определять ожидаемую ценность пользователя и бизнеса с использованием MCP/Context7 для подтверждения зависимости.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقييم المتطلبات مقابل أهداف المشروع، وتحديد أنواع المتطلبات مثل الميزة و التحسين وإصلاح العيوب، وتحديد القيمة المتوقعة للمستخدم والأعمال باستخدام MCP/Context7 للتأكيد على الارتباط."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing requirements for integration and migration projects","Evaluating feature requests for alignment with business objectives","Identifying non-functional requirements for system optimization"],"zh":["集成和迁移项目的需求分析","评估功能请求与业务目标的一致性","识别系统优化的非功能需求"],"ja":["統合と移行プロジェクトの要件分析","ビジネス目標との整合性を評価する機能リクエスト","システム最適化の非機能要件の特定"],"ko":["통합 및 마이그레이션 프로젝트의 요구 사항 분석","비즈니스 목표와 일치하는 기능 요청 평가","시스템 최적화를 위한 비기능적 요구 사항 식별"],"es":["Análisis de requisitos para proyectos de integración y migración","Evaluación de solicitudes de características para alinearlas con los objetivos empresariales","Identificación de requisitos no funcionales para la optimización del sistema"],"fr":["Analyse des exigences pour les projets d''intégration et de migration","Évaluation des demandes de fonctionnalités pour les aligner sur les objectifs commerciaux","Identification des exigences non fonctionnelles pour l''optimisation du système"],"de":["Analyse von Anforderungen für Integrations- und Migrationsprojekte","Bewertung von Funktionsanforderungen zur Ausrichtung an Geschäftszielen","Identifizierung von nichtfunktionalen Anforderungen zur Systemoptimierung"],"pt":["Analisar requisitos para projetos de integração e migração","Avaliar solicitações de recursos para alinhar com os objetivos comerciais","Identificar requisitos não funcionais para otimização do sistema"],"ru":["Анализ требований для проектов интеграции и миграции","Оценка запросов на функции для соответствия бизнес-целям","Определение нефункциональных требований для оптимизации системы"],"ar":["تحليل المتطلبات لمشاريع التكامل والهجرة","تقييم طلبات الميزات لتتوافق مع أهداف الأعمال","تحديد المتطلبات الغير وظيفية لتحسين النظام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation and codebase","Dependent on MCP/Context7 for constraint validation","Limited to analysis, does not include implementation"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档和代码库","依赖MCP/Context7进行约束验证","仅限分析，不包括实现"],"ja":["プロジェクトのドキュメントとコードベースへのアクセスが必要","MCP/Context7に依存して制約を検証","分析のみ、実装は含まない"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서와 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","MCP/Context7에 의존하여 제약을 검증합니다.","분석만 포함되며, 구현은 포함되지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación y base de código del proyecto","Depende de MCP/Context7 para la validación de restricciones","Limitado al análisis, no incluye la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation et à la base de code du projet","Dépend de MCP/Context7 pour la validation des contraintes","Limité à l''analyse, n''inclut pas la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdokumentation und den Codebestand","Hängt von MCP/Context7 für die Validierung von Einschränkungen ab","Begrenzt auf die Analyse, enthält keine Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do projeto e código-fonte","Depende de MCP/Context7 para validação de restrições","Limitado à análise, não inclui implementação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта и кодовой базе","Зависит от MCP/Context7 для проверки ограничений","Ограничен анализом, не включает реализацию"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق المشروع وقاعدة الشفرة","يعتمد على MCP/Context7 للتأكيد على القيود","محدود بالتحليل، ولا يتضمن التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b73f74282df21ce869477991d072a637711dfc98cc2775d1f59372486c4a8d04","qualityScore":40}');
