,"고성능 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de inteligencia artificial","qué es la inferencia para ecuaciones diferenciales estocásticas","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para operaciones de matriz","alternativas a las herramientas de inteligencia artificial","instalación de herramientas de inteligencia artificial","guía de configuración de herramientas de inteligencia artificial","operaciones de matriz en inteligencia artificial","aprendizaje automático con operaciones de matriz"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce que l''inférence pour les équations différentielles stochastiques","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les opérations matricielles","alternatives aux outils d''intelligence artificielle","installation d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","guide de configuration d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","opérations matricielles en intelligence artificielle","apprentissage automatique avec des opérations matricielles"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Inferenz für lineare stochastische Differentialgleichungen","KI-Tools für Matrix-Operationen","Alternativen zu KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools","Matrix-Operationen in der künstlichen Intelligenz","maschinelles Lernen mit Matrix-Operationen"],"pt":["como usar operações matriciais","o que são operações matriciais","alternativas para operações matriciais","operações matriciais vs numpy","instalar operações matriciais","guia de configuração para operações matriciais","operações matriciais para IA","operações matriciais para aprendizado de máquina"],"ru":["как использовать операции с матрицами","что такое операции с матрицами","альтернативы операциям с матрицами","операции с матрицами vs numpy","установка операций с матрицами","руководство по настройке операций с матрицами","операции с матрицами для ИИ","операции с матрицами для машинного обучения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام عمليات المصفوفة","ما هي عمليات المصفوفة","بديل لعمليات المصفوفة","عمليات المصفوفة مقابل numpy","تثبيت عمليات المصفوفة","دليل إعداد لعمليات المصفوفة","عمليات المصفوفة للذكاء الاصطناعي","عمليات المصفوفة للتعلم الالي"]}},"owner":"EddieCunningham","repo":"linsdex","repoPath":"EddieCunningham/linsdex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.909Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"matrix-operations","description":"Use specialized matrix types with symbolic tags for efficient linear algebra. Use when working with diagonal, block, or tagged matrices to avoid unnecessary dense computations.","bodyPreview":"# Matrix Operations\n\nlinsdex provides specialized matrix types that track structural properties for automatic optimization. Instead of always using dense matrices, the library uses diagonal, block, and tagged matrices to avoid unnecessary computation.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Working with diagonal covariance matrices\n- Building block-structured systems (e.g., position + velocity states)\n- Optimizing linear algebra with zero or identity matrices\n- Understanding the matrix type system in linsdex\n\n## Mat","body":"# Matrix Operations\n\nlinsdex provides specialized matrix types that track structural properties for automatic optimization. Instead of always using dense matrices, the library uses diagonal, block, and tagged matrices to avoid unnecessary computation.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Working with diagonal covariance matrices\n- Building block-structured systems (e.g., position + velocity states)\n- Optimizing linear algebra with zero or identity matrices\n- Understanding the matrix type system in linsdex\n\n## Matrix Types\n\n### DiagonalMatrix\n\nStores only diagonal elements for O(n) operations instead of O(n²) or O(n³).\n\n```python\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom linsdex import DiagonalMatrix\n\n# Create from diagonal elements\ndiag_elements = jnp.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\nD = DiagonalMatrix(diag_elements)\n\n# Create identity matrix\nI = DiagonalMatrix.eye(3)\n\n# Efficient operations\nD_inv = D.get_inverse()    # O(n) instead of O(n³)\nlog_det = D.get_log_det()  # O(n) instead of O(n³)\nelements = D.get_elements()  # Get diagonal as array\n```\n\n### DenseMatrix\n\nGeneral dense matrices when structure cannot be exploited.\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import DenseMatrix, TAGS\n\n# Create a dense matrix\nelements = jnp.array([[1.0, 0.5], [0.5, 2.0]])\nM = DenseMatrix(elements, tags=TAGS.no_tags)\n\n# Operations\nM_inv = M.get_inverse()\nchol = M.get_cholesky()\nlog_det = M.get_log_det()\n```\n\n### Block Matrices\n\nFor higher-order systems with natural block structure (e.g., position + velocity in tracking).\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex.matrix.block import Block2x2Matrix\nfrom linsdex import DiagonalMatrix, DenseMatrix, TAGS\n\n# Create a 2x2 block matrix\n# [[A, B],\n#  [C, D]]\nA = DiagonalMatrix.eye(2)\nB = DenseMatrix(jnp.zeros((2, 2)), tags=TAGS.zero_tags)\nC = DenseMatrix(jnp.zeros((2, 2)), tags=TAGS.zero_tags)\nD = DiagonalMatrix.eye(2)\n\nblock_matrix = Block2x2Matrix(A, B, C, D)\n\n# Operations work on the block structure\ninv = block_matrix.get_inverse()\n```\n\n## Matrix Tags\n\nTags track properties like zero and infinite values, enabling symbolic simplification before numerical computation.\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import TAGS\n\n# Available tag configurations\nTAGS.no_tags   # Regular matrix (non-zero, non-infinite)\nTAGS.zero_tags # Matrix is zero\nTAGS.inf_tags  # Matrix has infinite elements (represents total uncertainty)\n```\n\n### How Tags Work\n\nTags propagate through operations automatically:\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import DenseMatrix, TAGS\n\n# Create a zero matrix\nzero = DenseMatrix(jnp.zeros((3, 3)), tags=TAGS.zero_tags)\nnonzero = DenseMatrix(jnp.eye(3), tags=TAGS.no_tags)\n\n# Operations are detected symbolically\nresult = zero @ nonzero  # Detected as zero without computation\nresult = nonzero + zero  # Detected as nonzero without addition\n```\n\n### Infinite Tags for Uncertainty\n\nInfinite matrices represent total uncertainty (precision = 0):\n\n```python\n# Used in potentials to represent uninformative priors\ninf_precision = DenseMatrix(jnp.zeros((3, 3)), tags=TAGS.inf_tags)\n\n# This indicates \"no information\" about a variable\n```\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### Efficient Diagonal Operations\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import DiagonalMatrix, StandardGaussian\n\ndim = 100\n\n# Independent dimensions with diagonal covariance\nvariances = jnp.ones(dim)\nSigma = DiagonalMatrix(variances)\n\n# All operations are O(n) instead of O(n³)\nprecision = Sigma.get_inverse()\nlog_det = Sigma.get_log_det()\nchol = Sigma.get_cholesky()\n\n# Use in Gaussian distributions\nmu = jnp.zeros(dim)\ndist = StandardGaussian(mu, Sigma)\n```\n\n### Block Matrix for State Space Models\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex.matrix.block import Block2x2Matrix\nfrom linsdex import DiagonalMatrix, DenseMatrix, TAGS\n\n# 2D state: [position, velocity]\n# Continuous-time dynamics: d/dt [x, v] = [[0, 1], [0, 0]] [x, v]\n# Discrete transition matrix (Euler approximation):\n\ndt = 0.1\ndim = 1\n\n# Position block\nA11 = DiagonalMatrix.eye(dim)  # x_new = x + ...\nA12 = DiagonalMatrix(jnp.ones(dim) * dt)  # ... + dt * v\nA21 = DenseMatrix(jnp.zeros((dim, dim)), tags=TAGS.zero_tags)  # v_new = ...\nA22 = DiagonalMatrix.eye(dim)  # ... + v\n\ntransition_matrix = Block2x2Matrix(A11, A12, A21, A22)\n```\n\n### Creating Matrices with Correct Tags\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import DenseMatrix, DiagonalMatrix, TAGS\n\n# Regular (non-zero) matrix\nM = DenseMatrix(jnp.eye(3), tags=TAGS.no_tags)\n\n# Zero matrix (will be detected in operations)\nZ = DenseMatrix(jnp.zeros((3, 3)), tags=TAGS.zero_tags)\n\n# Diagonal matrix (automatically handles tags)\nD = DiagonalMatrix(jnp.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0]))\n```\n\n### Matrix Operations\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import DiagonalMatrix, DenseMatrix, TAGS\n\nD = DiagonalMatrix(jnp.array([2.0, 3.0]))\nM = DenseMatrix(jnp.array([[1.0, 0.5], [0.5, 1.0]]), tags=TAGS.no_tags)\n\n# Matrix-vector multiplication\nv = jnp.array([1.0, 2.0])\nresult = D @ v  # Efficient diagonal multiplication\n\n# Matrix-matrix operations\nresult = D @ M  # Diagonal times dense\n\n# Inverse\nD_inv = D.get_inverse()\n\n# Cholesky decomposition\nchol = M.get_cholesky()\n\n# Log determinant\nlog_det = D.get_log_det()\n```\n\n### Using with Gaussian Distributions\n\n```python\nfrom linsdex import StandardGaussian, NaturalGaussian, DiagonalMatrix\n\ndim = 5\n\n# Independent Gaussian with diagonal covariance\nmu = jnp.zeros(dim)\nSigma = DiagonalMatrix.eye(dim) * 0.5  # Scalar multiplication\n\nstd_dist = StandardGaussian(mu, Sigma)\n\n# Convert to natural form\nnat_dist = std_dist.to_nat()  # Precision is also DiagonalMatrix\n```\n\n## Key Classes\n\n- `DiagonalMatrix(elements)` - Diagonal matrix from 1D array\n- `DenseMatrix(elements, tags)` - Dense matrix with symbolic tags\n- `Block2x2Matrix(A, B, C, D)` - 2x2 block matrix\n- `Block3x3Matrix(...)` - 3x3 block matrix\n- `TAGS` - Symbolic tags for optimization\n\n## Common Methods\n\nAll matrix types support:\n\n- `get_inverse()` - Matrix inverse\n- `get_cholesky()` - Cholesky decomposition\n- `get_log_det()` - Log determinant\n- `get_elements()` - Raw array elements\n- `@` operator - Matrix multiplication (matmul)\n- Scalar multiplication and addition\n\n## Tips\n\n- Use `DiagonalMatrix` whenever dimensions are independent to save computation\n- Set correct tags when creating `DenseMatrix` to enable symbolic optimization\n- Block matrices are useful for higher-order state space models\n- Tags propagate automatically through operations\n- The library chooses the most efficient representation for operation results\n- Use `DiagonalMatrix.eye(n)` for identity matrices\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:00:14.799Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Math and Science Agents requiring efficient linear algebra computations with specialized matrix types.","zh":"非常适合需要利用专用矩阵类型进行高效线性代数计算的数学和科学AI Agent。","ja":"特殊な行列タイプを用いた効率的な線形代数計算を必要とする数学および科学エージェントに理想的です。","ko":"특수화된 행렬 유형을 사용하여 효율적인 선형 대수 계산이 필요한 수학 및 과학 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Matemáticas y Ciencia que requieren cálculos de álgebra lineal eficientes con tipos de matrices especializados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de mathématiques et de sciences nécessitant des calculs d''algèbre linéaire efficaces avec des types de matrices spécialisés.","de":"Ideal für Mathematik- und Wissenschaftsagenten, die effiziente lineare Algebra-Berechnungen mit spezialisierten Matrixtypen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Matemática e Ciência que exigem computações de álgebra linear eficientes com tipos de matrizes especializados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов математики и науки, требующих эффективных вычислений линейной алгебры с особыми типами матриц.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الرياضيات والعلوم التي تتطلب حسابات الجبر الخطي الفعال مع أنواع مصفوفات متخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize linear algebra with diagonal, block, and tagged matrices, reducing unnecessary computation and leveraging structural properties for fast inference in linear SDEs using libraries like linsdex.","zh":"使Agent能够使用linsdex等库，通过对角矩阵、分块矩阵和标记矩阵优化线性代数，减少不必要的计算，并利用结构特性在线性SDE中实现快速推理。","ja":"linsdexなどのライブラリを使用して、対角行列、ブロック行列、タグ付き行列による線形代数の最適化を可能にし、不必要な計算を削減し、構造的特性を活用して線形SDEにおける高速な推論を実現します。","ko":"linsdex와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 대각 행렬, 블록 행렬 및 태그가 지정된 행렬로 선형 대수를 최적화하여 불필요한 계산을 줄이고 구조적 속성을 활용하여 선형 SDE에서 빠른 추론을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el álgebra lineal con matrices diagonales, bloques y etiquetadas, reduciendo cálculos innecesarios y aprovechando propiedades estructurales para una inferencia rápida en SDE lineales utilizando bibliotecas como linsdex.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser l''algèbre linéaire avec des matrices diagonales, des blocs et des matrices étiquetées, en réduisant les calculs inutiles et en exploitant les propriétés structurelles pour une inférence rapide dans les SDE linéaires en utilisant des bibliothèques comme linsdex.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die lineare Algebra mit diagonalen, blockweise und markierten Matrizen zu optimieren, unnötige Berechnungen zu reduzieren und strukturelle Eigenschaften für eine schnelle Inferenz in linearen SDEs unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie linsdex auszunutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar a álgebra linear com matrizes diagonais, em bloco e marcadas, reduzindo cálculos desnecessários e aproveitando propriedades estruturais para inferência rápida em SDEs lineares usando bibliotecas como linsdex.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать линейную алгебру с диагональными, блоковыми и помеченными матрицами, сокращая ненужные вычисления и используя структуры свойств для быстрого вывода в линейных СДУ с использованием библиотек như linsdex.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين الجبر الخطي مع مصفوفات القطر والكتلة والموسومة، وتقليل الحسابات غير الضرورية وتفويض الخواص الهيكلية للاستدلال السريع في السدية الخطية باستخدام المكتبات مثل linsdex."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating linear SDE simulations with diagonal covariance matrices","Building and optimizing block-structured systems for position and velocity states","Debugging linear algebra performance with zero or identity matrices"],"zh":["使用对角协方差矩阵自动化线性SDE模拟","为位置和速度状态构建并优化块结构系统","使用零矩阵或单位矩阵调试线性代数性能"],"ja":["対角共分散行列を用いた線形SDEシミュレーションの自動化","位置および速度状態のためのブロック構造システムの構築と最適化","ゼロ行列または単位行列を用いた線形代数パフォーマンスのデバッグ"],"ko":["대각 공분산 행렬을 사용한 선형 SDE 시뮬레이션 자동화","위치 및 속도 상태를 위한 블록 구조 시스템 구축 및 최적화","영행렬 또는 단위 행렬을 사용한 선형 대수 성능 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar simulaciones de SDE lineales con matrices de covarianza diagonales","Crear y optimizar sistemas estructurados en bloques para estados de posición y velocidad","Depurar el rendimiento del álgebra lineal con matrices cero o identidad"],"fr":["Automatiser les simulations de SDE linéaires avec des matrices de covariance diagonales","Construire et optimiser des systèmes structurés en blocs pour les états de position et de vitesse","Déboguer les performances de l''algèbre linéaire avec des matrices nulles ou identité"],"de":["Automatisieren von SDE-Linear-Simulationen mit diagonalen Kovarianzmatrizen","Erstellen und Optimieren von blockstrukturierten Systemen für Positions- und Geschwindigkeitszustände","Fehlerbehebung der Leistung des linearen Algebra mit Null- oder Identitätsmatrizen"],"pt":["Automatizar simulações de SDE lineares com matrizes de covariância diagonais","Construir e otimizar sistemas estruturados em bloco para estados de posição e velocidade","Depurar o desempenho da álgebra linear com matrizes zero ou identidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать симуляции линейных СДУ с диагональными матрицами ковариации","Создавать и оптимизировать блок-структурированные системы для состояний позиции и скорости","Отлаживать производительность линейной алгебры с нулевыми или тождественными матрицами"],"ar":["تأتمة محاكاة السدية الخطية مع مصفوفات التباين القطرية","بناء وتحسين الأنظمة المهيكلة في الكتلة لمراحل الموقع والسرعة","تصحيح أخطاء أداء الجبر الخطي مع مصفوفات الصفر أو الهوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires linsdex library integration","Limited to linear SDEs and specialized matrix types"],"zh":["需要集成linsdex库","仅限于线性SDE和专用矩阵类型"],"ja":["linsdexライブラリの統合が必要","線形SDEおよび特殊な行列タイプに限定される"],"ko":["linsdex 라이브러리 통합이 필요함","선형 SDE 및 특수 행렬 유형으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración de la biblioteca linsdex","Limitado a SDE lineales y tipos de matrices especializados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque linsdex","Limité aux SDE linéaires et aux types de matrices spécialisés"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der Bibliothek linsdex","Begrenzt auf lineare SDEs und spezialisierte Matrixtypen"],"pt":["Exige integração da biblioteca linsdex","Limitada a SDEs lineares e tipos de matrizes especializados"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с библиотекой linsdex","Ограничена линейными СДУ и особыми типами матриц"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل المكتبة linsdex","محدودة بالسدية الخطية وأشكال المصفوفات المتخصصة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f5b6998191302ee8384c1c4c553d26c36308e47c3a9bf28f642cc7b166a89f4c","qualityScore":40}');
