ration d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","Collaboration efficace entre humains et agents IA","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans la production musicale"],"de":["Musikproduktions-Workflow von Mensch und KI","Konfiguration von Fähigkeiten und Vorlagen für Suno","Integration von KI-Tools","Erfolgreiche Zusammenarbeit zwischen Mensch und KI-Agents","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Musikproduktion"],"pt":["Integração com React e Python","Uso de templates e ferramentas avançadas","Otimização da workflow de produção musical","Compatibilidade com Node.js e CLI","Ajuste de habilidades de IA para produção musical"],"ru":["Интеграция с React и Python","Использование шаблонов и инструментов","Оптимизация рабочего процесса музыкального производства","Совместимость с Node.js и CLI","Настройка ИИ Агентов для музыкального производства"],"ar":["التكامل مع React و Python","استخدام القوالب والأدوات المتقدمة","تحسين سير عمل إنتاج الموسيقى","التوافق مع Node.js و CLI","ضبط مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنتاج الموسيقى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理配置","Suno音乐生产工作流","音乐创作效率","AI工具","音乐制作软件","如何使用Suno","Suno与其他音乐制作软件的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント設定","Suno音楽制作ワークフロー","音楽制作効率","AIエージェント","音楽制作ソフトウェア","Sunoの使い方","Sunoと他の音楽制作ソフトウェアの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 설정","Suno 음악 제작 워크플로우","음악 제작 효율성","AI 에이전트","음악 제작 소프트웨어","Suno 사용 방법","Suno와 다른 음악 제작 소프트웨어의 비교"],"es":["cómo configurar agentes de IA","producción musical con IA","Suno alternativa","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para música","configuración de habilidades de IA","guía de instalación de Suno","mejora de la eficiencia en la producción musical"],"fr":["comment configurer des agents IA","production musicale avec IA","Suno alternative","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour la musique","configuration de compétences IA","guide d''installation de Suno","amélioration de l''efficacité dans la production musicale"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents konfiguriert","Musikproduktion mit KI","Suno Alternative","KI-Tools für Musik","Konfiguration von KI-Fähigkeiten","Installationsanleitung für Suno","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Musikproduktion"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é configuração de ferramentas de IA","ferramentas de IA para produção musical","Suno alternative","Suno vs Ableton","instalar ferramentas de IA","guia de configuração de ferramentas de IA","ferramentas de IA para música eletrônica"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое настройка ИИ Агентов","ИИ Агенты для музыкального производства","Suno альтернатива","Suno vs Ableton","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","ИИ Агенты для электронной музыки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي تكوين أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنتاج الموسيقى","بديل Suno","Suno مقابل Ableton","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل تكوين أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للموسيقى الإلكترونية"]}},"owner":"bitwize-music-studio","repo":"claude-ai-music-skills","repoPath":"bitwize-music-studio/claude-ai-music-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.961Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"configure","description":"Sets up or edits the plugin configuration file interactively. Use on first-time setup, when config is missing, or when the user wants to change settings.","bodyPreview":"## Your Task\n\n**Input**: $ARGUMENTS\n\nRoute based on argument:\n- `setup` or no argument → Interactive first-time setup\n- `edit` → Edit specific settings\n- `show` → Display current configuration\n- `validate` → Check config for issues\n- `reset` → Delete config and start fresh\n\n---\n\n# Plugin Configuration Skill\n\nYou help users set up and manage their `~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml` configuration.\n\n## Config Location\n\n```\n~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### `/configure` or `/configure s","body":"## Your Task\n\n**Input**: $ARGUMENTS\n\nRoute based on argument:\n- `setup` or no argument → Interactive first-time setup\n- `edit` → Edit specific settings\n- `show` → Display current configuration\n- `validate` → Check config for issues\n- `reset` → Delete config and start fresh\n\n---\n\n# Plugin Configuration Skill\n\nYou help users set up and manage their `~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml` configuration.\n\n## Config Location\n\n```\n~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### `/configure` or `/configure setup`\n\nInteractive first-time setup. Guide user through creating their config.\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. Check if `~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml` exists\n2. If exists, ask if they want to overwrite or edit instead\n3. If creating new:\n   - Create `~/.bitwize-music/` directory if needed\n   - Ask for each required setting interactively\n   - Write the config file\n   - Validate the result\n\n**Required settings to ask:**\n1. `artist.name` - \"What''s your artist/project name?\"\n2. `paths.content_root` - \"Where should albums and projects be stored? (e.g., ~/music-projects)\"\n3. `paths.audio_root` - \"Where should mastered audio files go? (e.g., ~/music-projects/audio)\"\n4. `paths.documents_root` - \"Where should research documents/PDFs go? (e.g., ~/music-projects/documents)\"\n\n**Optional settings:**\n5. `artist.genres` - \"What are your primary genres? (comma-separated, or skip)\"\n6. `urls.soundcloud` - \"SoundCloud profile URL? (or skip)\"\n\n**Step 5: Overrides Directory (Optional)**\n\nAsk:\n> You can optionally provide a path to a directory containing override files.\n> This is where you can customize workflows and skills without plugin update conflicts.\n>\n> Override files you can create:\n>   - CLAUDE.md (custom workflow instructions)\n>   - pronunciation-guide.md (artist names, character names)\n>   - explicit-words.md (custom explicit word list)\n>\n> Default: ~/music-projects/overrides\n>\n> Enter path (or press Enter to use default):\n\nIf user provides path:\n- Add to config: `paths.overrides: \"[user-path]\"`\n\nIf user presses Enter (accepts default):\n- Add to config: `paths.overrides: \"~/music-projects/overrides\"`\n- Tell user: \"Note: Directory doesn''t need to exist yet. Create override files when you want to customize.\"\n\n**Step 6: Album Ideas File (Optional)**\n\nAsk:\n> You can optionally provide a path to a file for tracking album ideas.\n> This is managed by the /bitwize-music:album-ideas skill for brainstorming and planning.\n>\n> Default: ~/music-projects/IDEAS.md\n>\n> Enter path (or press Enter to use default):\n\nIf user provides path:\n- Add to config: `paths.ideas_file: \"[user-path]\"`\n\nIf user presses Enter (accepts default):\n- Add to config: `paths.ideas_file: \"~/music-projects/IDEAS.md\"`\n- Tell user: \"Note: File doesn''t need to exist yet. The album-ideas skill creates it when first used.\"\n\n**Example interaction:**\n```\nLet''s set up your bitwize-music configuration.\n\nWhat''s your artist/project name?\n> Neon Circuits\n\nWhere should albums and projects be stored?\n(This is where your album folders, lyrics, and research will live)\n> ~/music-projects\n\nWhere should mastered audio files go?\n> ~/music-projects/audio\n\nWhere should research documents/PDFs go?\n> ~/music-projects/documents\n\nWhat are your primary genres? (comma-separated, or press Enter to skip)\n> electronic, synthwave\n\nSoundCloud profile URL? (or press Enter to skip)\n> https://soundcloud.com/neon-circuits\n\nOverrides directory path? (press Enter for default: ~/music-projects/overrides)\n> [Enter]\n\nAlbum ideas file path? (press Enter for default: ~/music-projects/IDEAS.md)\n> [Enter]\n\nCreating config at ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml...\n\n✓ Configuration saved!\n\nYour settings:\n  Artist: Neon Circuits\n  Content: ~/music-projects\n  Audio: ~/music-projects/audio\n  Documents: ~/music-projects/documents\n  Genres: electronic, synthwave\n  SoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/neon-circuits\n  Overrides: ~/music-projects/overrides (will be used if created)\n  Ideas File: ~/music-projects/IDEAS.md (will be created when first used)\n\nYou''re ready to start creating albums!\n```\n\n### `/configure edit`\n\nEdit specific settings without recreating the whole config.\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Read existing config\n2. Show current values\n3. Ask what they want to change\n4. Update just that setting\n5. Validate and save\n\n**Example:**\n```\nCurrent configuration:\n\n  artist.name: Neon Circuits\n  paths.content_root: ~/music-projects\n  paths.audio_root: ~/music-projects/audio\n  paths.documents_root: ~/music-projects/documents\n  artist.genres: [electronic, synthwave]\n  urls.soundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/neon-circuits\n\nWhat would you like to change?\n```\n\n### `/configure show`\n\nDisplay the current configuration in a readable format.\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Read `~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml`\n2. Display all settings in a formatted table\n3. Note any missing required settings\n\n**Example output:**\n```\nbitwize-music Configuration\nLocation: ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml\n\n┌─────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Setting             │ Value                              │\n├─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ artist.name         │ Neon Circuits                      │\n│ artist.genres       │ electronic, synthwave              │\n│ paths.content_root  │ ~/music-projects                   │\n│ paths.audio_root    │ ~/music-projects/audio             │\n│ paths.documents_root│ ~/music-projects/documents         │\n│ paths.overrides     │ ~/music-projects/overrides         │\n│ paths.ideas_file    │ ~/music-projects/IDEAS.md          │\n│ urls.soundcloud     │ https://soundcloud.com/neon-circuits│\n│ generation.service  │ suno                               │\n└─────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n✓ All required settings present\n```\n\n### `/configure validate`\n\nCheck the config for issues.\n\n**Checks:**\n1. Config file exists\n2. All required fields present\n3. Paths are valid (directories exist or can be created)\n4. No syntax errors in YAML\n\n**Example output:**\n```\nValidating ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml...\n\n✓ Config file exists\n✓ artist.name: Neon Circuits\n✓ paths.content_root: ~/music-projects (exists)\n✓ paths.audio_root: ~/music-projects/audio (exists)\n✓ paths.documents_root: ~/music-projects/documents (will be created)\n✓ paths.overrides: ~/music-projects/overrides (will be used if created)\n✓ paths.ideas_file: ~/music-projects/IDEAS.md (will be created when first used)\n✓ generation.service: suno\n\nAll checks passed!\n```\n\nOr with issues:\n```\nValidating ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml...\n\n✓ Config file exists\n✓ artist.name: Neon Circuits\n✗ paths.content_root: not set (required)\n✓ paths.audio_root: ~/music-projects/audio\n✗ paths.documents_root: /invalid/path (directory doesn''t exist)\n\n2 issues found. Run /configure edit to fix.\n```\n\n### `/configure reset`\n\nDelete config and optionally start fresh.\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Confirm user really wants to reset\n2. Back up existing config to `config.yaml.bak`\n3. Delete `~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml`\n4. Ask if they want to run setup now\n\n**Example:**\n```\n⚠️  This will delete your configuration at ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml\n\nCurrent config will be backed up to config.yaml.bak\n\nAre you sure you want to reset? (yes/no)\n```\n\nIf yes:\n```\n✓ Backed up to ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml.bak\n✓ Deleted ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml\n\nConfig has been reset.\n\nWould you like to set up a new config now? (yes/no)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Config Template\n\nWhen creating a new config, use this structure:\n\n```yaml\n# bitwize-music Plugin Configuration\n# Generated by /configure\n\nartist:\n  name: \"{artist_name}\"\n  genres:\n    - \"{genre1}\"\n    - \"{genre2}\"\n\npaths:\n  content_root: \"{content_root}\"\n  audio_root: \"{audio_root}\"\n  documents_root: \"{documents_root}\"\n  overrides: \"{overrides}\"\n  ideas_file: \"{ideas_file}\"\n\nurls:\n  soundcloud: \"{soundcloud_url}\"\n\ngeneration:\n  service: suno\n```\n\n---\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n### Config exists but is invalid YAML\n- Back up the existing file: `config.yaml.bak`\n- Offer to create fresh config\n\n### Directory doesn''t exist\n- Offer to create it: \"Directory ~/music-projects doesn''t exist. Create it?\"\n\n### User provides relative path\n- Expand to absolute: `./projects` → `/Users/name/projects`\n- Or use `~` prefix: `~/projects`\n\n---\n\n## Remember\n\n- **Preserve exact casing** - If user says \"bitwize\", write \"bitwize\" not \"Bitwize\"\n- Always expand `~` in paths for display\n- Create directories if they don''t exist (with permission)\n- Back up existing config before overwriting\n- Validate after any changes\n- Be friendly and explain what each setting does\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:45.358Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced configuration management capabilities, particularly those interacting with YAML files.","zh":"适合需要高级配置管理功能的AI代理，特别是那些与YAML文件交互的代理。","ja":"YAMLファイルとやり取りするものを含む、高度な設定管理機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"YAML 파일과 상호 작용하는 것을 포함하여 고급 구성 관리 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de gestión de configuración avanzadas, particularmente aquellos que interactúan con archivos YAML.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de configuration avancées, en particulier ceux qui interagissent avec des fichiers YAML.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Konfigurationsmanagementfunktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die mit YAML-Dateien interagieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de configuração, particularmente aqueles que interagem com arquivos YAML.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления конфигурацией, особенно тех, которые взаимодействуют с файлами YAML.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة التنفيذ، خاصة تلك التي تتفاعل مع ملفات YAML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage and validate configuration settings through interactive setup, editing, and validation using YAML format, specifically for the ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml file.","zh":"赋予代理通过交互式设置、编辑和验证使用YAML格式来管理和验证设置的能力，特别是针对~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml文件。","ja":"YAML形式を使用したインタラクティブなセットアップ、編集、検証を通じて、設定を管理および検証する能力をエージェントに与え、特に ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml ファイルの場合。","ko":"YAML 형식을 사용하여 대화형 설정, 편집 및 유효성을 검사하는 것을 통해 설정을 관리하고 유효성을 검사하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, 특히 ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml 파일의 경우에 해당합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar y validar la configuración a través de la configuración interactiva, edición y validación utilizando el formato YAML, específicamente para el archivo ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et de valider les paramètres de configuration via une configuration interactive, l''édition et la validation en utilisant le format YAML, spécifiquement pour le fichier ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Konfiguration zu verwalten und zu überprüfen durch interaktive Einrichtung, Bearbeitung und Validierung unter Verwendung des YAML-Formats, speziell für die Datei ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar e validar configurações por meio de configuração interativa, edição e validação usando o formato YAML, especificamente para o arquivo ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность управлять и проверять конфигурационные настройки через интерактивную настройку, редактирование и проверку с использованием формата YAML, в частности для файла ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على إدارة وإ�� تأكيد الإعدادات من خلال الإعداد التفاعلي و التحرير والإ�� باستخدام تنسيق YAML، خاصة لملف ~/.bitwize-music/config.yaml."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing configuration files","Editing specific settings within the config.yaml","Validating configuration for potential issues"],"zh":["初始化配置文件","编辑config.yaml中的特定设置","验证配置中的潜在问题"],"ja":["設定ファイルの初期化","config.yaml内の特定の設定の編集","設定の潜在的な問題の検証"],"ko":["구성 파일 초기화","config.yaml 내의 특정 설정 편집","구성의 잠재적 문제 유효성 검사"],"es":["Inicialización de archivos de configuración","Edición de ajustes específicos dentro del config.yaml","Validación de la configuración para posibles problemas"],"fr":["Initialisation des fichiers de configuration","Édition de paramètres spécifiques à l''intérieur du config.yaml","Validation de la configuration pour les problèmes potentiels"],"de":["Initialisierung von Konfigurationsdateien","Bearbeitung spezifischer Einstellungen innerhalb der config.yaml","Überprüfung der Konfiguration auf mögliche Probleme"],"pt":["Inicialização de arquivos de configuração","Edição de configurações específicas dentro do config.yaml","Validação de configuração para problemas potenciais"],"ru":["Инициализация файлов конфигурации","Редактирование определенных настроек внутри config.yaml","Проверка конфигурации на наличие потенциальных проблем"],"ar":["تثبيت ملفات التنفيذ","تحرير إعدادات محددة داخل config.yaml","إ�� إعدادات التنفيذ للعثور على مشاكل محتملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the ~/.bitwize-music directory","Limited to managing config.yaml files"],"zh":["需要访问 ~/.bitwize-music 目录","仅限管理 config.yaml 文件"],"ja":[" ~/.bitwize-music ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","config.yamlファイルのみを管理する"],"ko":[" ~/.bitwize-music 디렉토리 접근 권한 필요","config.yaml 파일만 관리"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio ~/.bitwize-music","Limitado a la gestión de archivos config.yaml"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au répertoire ~/.bitwize-music","Limité à la gestion des fichiers config.yaml"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis ~/.bitwize-music","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von config.yaml-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório ~/.bitwize-music","Limitado a gerenciar arquivos config.yaml"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу ~/.bitwize-music","Ограничен управлением файлами config.yaml"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل ~/.bitwize-music","محدود بإ