c LLM","Compatibilité avec des descriptions libres","Intégration avec des outils de développement","CLI facile à utiliser"],"de":["Persönliche Arbeitsqueue-CLI","LLM-generierte Titel","Unterstützung für freie Beschreibungen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Benutzerfreundliche CLI"],"pt":["Fila de trabalho personalizada em linha de comando","Dumping de descrições freeform","Títulos gerados por LLM","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","CLI fácil de usar"],"ru":["Персональная очередь работы CLI","Dumping свободных описаний","Названия, сгенерированные ИИ","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Простой CLI"],"ar":["قائمة عمل مخصصة سطر أوامر","تفريغ وصفات حرة","عناوينGenerated من LLM","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","سطر أوامر سهل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Hopper Coordinator","个人工作队列","LLM自动标题生成","CLI工具","如何使用Hopper Coordinator","Hopper Coordinator安装","Hopper Coordinator设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Hopper Coordinator","パーソナルワークキュー","LLM自動タイトル生成","CLIツール","Hopper Coordinatorの使い方","Hopper Coordinatorのインストール","Hopper Coordinatorの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Hopper Coordinator","개인 작업 큐","LLM 자동 제목 생성","CLI 도구","Hopper Coordinator 사용 방법","Hopper Coordinator 설치","Hopper Coordinator 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","cola de trabajo personal","generador de títulos","LLM","CLI","desarrollo de software","productividad","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["outils d''IA","file d''attente personnelle","générateur de titres","LLM","CLI","développement de logiciels","productivité","outils de développement"],"de":["KI-Tools","persönliche Arbeitsqueue","Titelgenerierung","LLM","CLI","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["como usar Hopper Coordinator","o que é Hopper Coordinator","Hopper Coordinator alternativa","Hopper Coordinator vs outras ferramentas","instalar Hopper Coordinator","guia de configuração do Hopper Coordinator","ferramentas de Agente de IA","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["как использовать Hopper Coordinator","что такое Hopper Coordinator","ИИ Агенты","Hopper Coordinator альтернатива","Hopper Coordinator vs другие инструменты","установить Hopper Coordinator","руководство по настройке Hopper Coordinator","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Hopper Coordinator","ما هو Hopper Coordinator","أدوات الوكيل الذكي","بديل Hopper Coordinator","Hopper Coordinator مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Hopper Coordinator","دليل إعداد Hopper Coordinator","أدوات التطوير","وكيل ذكي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"svetzal","repo":"hopper","repoPath":"svetzal/hopper","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T01:33:30Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hopper-coordinator","description":"Manage a hopper work queue as a coordinator — add tasks, monitor progress, and review completed work items","bodyPreview":"# Hopper Coordinator\n\nYou are acting as a **coordinator** using the `hopper` work queue CLI. Your role is to manage work items — adding tasks, reviewing queue status, and organizing work for agents to pick up.\n\n## What is Hopper?\n\nHopper is a personal work queue that distributes tasks to agents. Work items flow through a simple lifecycle:\n\n```\nqueued → (claim) → in_progress → (complete) → completed\n  ↑                                    │\n  └──────── (requeue) ────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Your Resp","body":"# Hopper Coordinator\n\nYou are acting as a **coordinator** using the `hopper` work queue CLI. Your role is to manage work items — adding tasks, reviewing queue status, and organizing work for agents to pick up.\n\n## What is Hopper?\n\nHopper is a personal work queue that distributes tasks to agents. Work items flow through a simple lifecycle:\n\n```\nqueued → (claim) → in_progress → (complete) → completed\n  ↑                                    │\n  └──────── (requeue) ────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Your Responsibilities\n\nAs coordinator, you:\n\n1. **Break down work** into discrete, actionable items that an agent can complete independently\n2. **Add items to the queue** using `hopper add`\n3. **Monitor progress** using `hopper list`\n4. **Review completed work** using `hopper list --completed`\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n### Adding Work Items\n\n```bash\nhopper add \"<description>\"\nhopper add \"<description>\" --dir <path> --branch <branch>\n```\n\n- The description should be a clear, self-contained task that an agent can complete without further context\n- Hopper auto-generates a short title from the description using an LLM (falls back to truncation if unavailable)\n- Each item gets a unique ID\n- Use `--dir` to specify a working directory for the task and `--branch` to specify the git branch — `--branch` is required when `--dir` is set\n- Workers will create an isolated git worktree on that branch rather than operating in the main repo directory, preventing interference with active in-progress work\n\n**Tips for good descriptions:**\n- Include enough context that a worker agent can act on it independently\n- Be specific about what \"done\" looks like\n- Reference file paths, function names, or other concrete details when relevant\n- One task per item — avoid compound tasks (\"do X and Y\")\n\n### Viewing Item Details\n\n```bash\nhopper show <id>             # Full details of a single item\nhopper show <id> --json      # Machine-readable output\n```\n\n- Use the item `id` (or a unique prefix of it)\n- Displays all fields: title, description, status, timestamps, agent info, result, and requeue reason\n- Useful for reviewing completed work results or understanding why an item was requeued\n\n### Listing Items\n\n```bash\nhopper list                  # Show queued + in-progress items\nhopper list --all            # Include completed items\nhopper list --completed      # Show only completed items\nhopper list --json           # Machine-readable output\n```\n\n### Machine-Readable Output\n\nAll commands support `--json` for structured output. Use this when you need to parse results programmatically.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze the work** — Understand what needs to be done and break it into independent tasks\n2. **Add items** — Queue each task with a clear description\n3. **Monitor** — Check `hopper list` to see what''s been claimed and what''s still queued\n4. **Review** — Check completed items with `hopper show <id>` to see full results\n\n## Example\n\n```bash\n# Break a feature into tasks\nhopper add \"Add input validation to the signup form in src/components/SignupForm.tsx — validate email format, password strength (min 8 chars, 1 number), and display inline error messages\"\nhopper add \"Write unit tests for SignupForm validation logic covering valid inputs, invalid email, and weak password cases\"\nhopper add \"Update the API endpoint POST /api/users to return 422 with field-level errors when validation fails\"\n\n# Check progress\nhopper list\n\n# See what''s been done\nhopper list --completed\n\n# Review a specific completed item''s result\nhopper show <id>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T04:03:29.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents needing advanced work queue coordination and LLM-generated task titles.","zh":"适合需要高级工作队列协调和LLM生成任务标题的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが高度なワークキューの調整とLLM生成のタスクタイトルを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 작업 큐 조정 및 LLM 생성 작업 제목이 필요한 작업 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que necesitan una coordinación avanzada de cola de trabajo y títulos de tareas generados por LLM.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une coordination avancée de file d''attente de travail et des titres de tâches générés par LLM.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die eine erweiterte Arbeitswarteschlangen-Koordination und LLM-generierte Aufgabentitel benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de coordenação avançada de fila de trabalho e títulos de tarefas gerados por LLM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих продвинутой координации очереди работ и названий задач, сгенерированных LLM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق متقدم لصف عمل وآلات محطة المهام التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة LLM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage work items using the hopper work queue CLI, distributing tasks through a queued, in_progress, and completed lifecycle, utilizing LLM-generated titles and freeform descriptions, while supporting requeue and claim protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用hopper工作队列CLI管理工作项的能力，通过排队、进行中和完成的生命周期分配任务，利用LLM生成的标题和自由形式的描述，同时支持重新排队和声明协议。","ja":"エージェントがhopperワークキューCLIを使用して作業項目を管理する機能を提供します。キューされた、進行中、完了されたライフサイクルを通じてタスクを分配し、LLM生成のタイトルと自由形式の説明を利用し、再キューと請求プロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 hopper 작업 큐 CLI를 사용하여 작업 항목을 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 큐된, 진행 중, 완료된 생명 주기를 통해 작업을 분배하고, LLM 생성 제목 및 자유 형식 설명을 활용하며, 재 큐 및 청구 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar elementos de trabajo utilizando la CLI de cola de trabajo hopper, distribuyendo tareas a través de un ciclo de vida encolado, en progreso y completado, utilizando títulos generados por LLM y descripciones de forma libre, mientras que admite protocolos de re cola y reclamación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des éléments de travail en utilisant la CLI de file d''attente hopper, en distribuant des tâches à travers un cycle de vie mis en file d''attente, en cours et terminé, en utilisant des titres générés par LLM et des descriptions de forme libre, tout en prenant en charge les protocoles de re file d''attente et de revendication.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Arbeitselemente mithilfe der hopper-Arbeitswarteschlangen-CLI zu verwalten, Aufgaben durch einenwarteschlangen-, in Bearbeitung und abgeschlossenen Lebenszyklus zu verteilen, LLM-generierte Titel und freie Beschreibungen zu verwenden und gleichzeitig Re-Warteschlangen- und Claim-Protokolle zu unterstützen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem itens de trabalho usando a fila de trabalho hopper CLI, distribuindo tarefas por meio de um ciclo de vida em fila, em andamento e concluído, utilizando títulos e descrições em forma livre gerados por LLM, além de suportar protocolos de requeue e claim.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять элементами работы с помощью очереди работы hopper CLI, распределяя задачи через цикл жизни в очереди, в процессе и завершенные, используя названия и свободные описания, сгенерированные LLM, а также поддерживая протоколы повторной очереди и претензии.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة عناصر العمل باستخدام صف العمل hopper CLI، ويتوزع المهام من خلال دورة حياة في الصف، قيد التقدم والانتهاء، باستخدام عناوين ووصف حر تم إنشاؤه بواسطة LLM، بالإضافة إلى دعم بروتوكولات إعادة الصف والطلب."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing task queues with LLM-generated titles","Automating work item distribution to agents","Reviewing and organizing queue status for efficient task completion"],"zh":["使用LLM生成的标题管理任务队列","自动将工作项分配给代理","查看和组织队列状态以实现任务的高效完成"],"ja":["LLM生成のタイトルを使用してタスクキューを管理する","エージェントに作業項目を自動的に割り当てる","タスクの効率的な完了のためにキューの状態を確認して整理する"],"ko":["LLM 생성 제목을 사용하여 작업 큐 관리","에이전트에 작업 항목 자동 할당","작업의 효율적인 완료를 위해 큐 상태 검토 및 조직"],"es":["Gestionar colas de tareas con títulos generados por LLM","Automatizar la distribución de elementos de trabajo a agentes","Revisar y organizar el estado de la cola para una finalización de tareas eficiente"],"fr":["Gérer des files d''attente de tâches avec des titres générés par LLM","Automatiser la distribution d''éléments de travail aux agents","Réviser et organiser l''état de la file d''attente pour une finalisation de tâches efficace"],"de":["Warteschlangen von Aufgaben mit LLM-generierten Titeln verwalten","Die Verteilung von Arbeitselementen an Agenten automatisieren","Den Status der Warteschlange überprüfen und organisieren, um eine effiziente Aufgabenerledigung zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de filas de tarefas com títulos gerados por LLM","Automatização da distribuição de itens de trabalho para agentes","Revisão e organização do status da fila para conclusão eficiente de tarefas"],"ru":["Управление очередями задач с названиями, сгенерированными LLM","Автоматизация распределения элементов работы среди агентов","Просмотр и организация статуса очереди для эффективного завершения задач"],"ar":["إدارة صفوف المهام مع عناوين تم إنشاؤها بواسطة LLM","أتمتة توزيع عناصر العمل على الوكلاء","استعراض وتحسين حالة الصفوف من أجل إكمال المهام بكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires hopper work queue CLI installation","Limited to personal work queue management"],"zh":["需要hopper工作队列CLI安装","仅限个人工作队列管理"],"ja":["hopperワークキューCLIのインストールが必要","個人用ワークキュー管理に限定される"],"ko":["hopper 작업 큐 CLI 설치 필요","개인 작업 큐 관리로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de cola de trabajo hopper","Limitado a la gestión de cola de trabajo personal"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI de file d''attente hopper","Limité à la gestion de file d''attente de travail personnel"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der hopper-Arbeitswarteschlangen-CLI","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung der persönlichen Arbeitswarteschlange"],"pt":["Requer instalação do hopper work queue CLI","Limitado ao gerenciamento de fila de trabalho pessoal"],"ru":["Требует установки hopper work queue CLI","Ограничен управлением личной очередью работы"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت hopper work queue CLI","محدود بإدارة صف العمل الشخصي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"192bb1cd1533f8e2f5c813459e165638621c8880bd190480fdfc5f77e9e21237","qualityScore":40}');
