-issue-sequencer 는 ll7 네임스페이스의 robot_sf 에서 개발된 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El agente de inteligencia artificial robot_sf en el namespace ll7 es una herramienta para gestionar problemas en GitHub","fr":"L''agent d''intelligence artificielle robot_sf dans l''espace de noms ll7 est un outil pour gérer les problèmes GitHub","de":"Der KI-Agent robot_sf im ll7-Namespace ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen","pt":"O gh-issue-sequencer é uma ferramenta de IA que opera no namespace ll7, permitindo a sequenciação de issues no GitHub","ru":"ИИ Агент gh-issue-sequencer работает в namespace ll7, обеспечивая последовательную обработку проблем GitHub","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي gh-issue-sequencer تعمل في namespace ll7، مما يتيح ترتيب قضايا GitHub","en":"robot_sf in the ll7 namespace."},"definition":{"en":"robot_sf in the ll7 namespace."},"features":{"zh":["自动化 GitHub 问题管理","优化开发流程","提高团队协作效率","支持多种开发工具","易于安装和设置","高可定制性"],"ja":["GitHub Issue の自動化管理","開発プロセスの最適化","チームのコラボレーション効率の向上","多種の開発ツールをサポート","簡単なインストールと設定","高カスタマイズ性"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈 자동화 관리","개발 프로세스 최적화","チーム 협업 효율성 향상","다양한 개발 도구 지원","쉽게 설치 및 설정","높은 사용자 정의 가능성"],"es":["Gestión de problemas en GitHub","Integración con robot_sf","Namespace ll7","Herramienta de inteligencia artificial","Secuenciación de problemas","Automatización de tareas"],"fr":["Gestion des problèmes GitHub","Intégration avec robot_sf","Espace de noms ll7","Outil d''intelligence artificielle","Séquençage des problèmes","Automatisation des tâches"],"de":["Verwaltung von GitHub-Problemen","Integration mit robot_sf","ll7-Namespace","KI-Tool","Problemmsequenzierung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Sequenciação de issues no GitHub","Opera no namespace ll7","Ferramenta de IA para automação de tarefas","Integração com o GitHub","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios"],"ru":["Последовательная обработка проблем GitHub","Работает в namespace ll7","ИИ Агент для автоматизации задач","Интеграция с GitHub","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев"],"ar":["ترتيب قضايا GitHub","تعمل في namespace ll7","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للautomação من المهام","التكامل مع GitHub","دعم عدة مستودعات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","gh-issue-sequencer 介绍","GitHub 问题管理","开发效率提高","如何使用 gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer 替代品","gh-issue-sequencer 安装","gh-issue-sequencer 设置指南","AI工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","gh-issue-sequencer を使用する","GitHub Issue 管理","開発効率向上","gh-issue-sequencer の使い方","gh-issue-sequencer の代替","gh-issue-sequencer のインストール","gh-issue-sequencer の設定ガイド","AIツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","gh-issue-sequencer 기능","GitHub 이슈 관리","개발 효율성 향상","gh-issue-sequencer 사용 방법","gh-issue-sequencer 대체","gh-issue-sequencer 설치","gh-issue-sequencer 설정 가이드","AI 도구 비교"],"es":["cómo usar robot_sf","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a robot_sf","robot_sf vs otros agentes","instalación de robot_sf","guía de configuración de robot_sf","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser robot_sf","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à robot_sf","robot_sf vs autres agents","installation de robot_sf","guide de configuration de robot_sf","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man robot_sf verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu robot_sf","robot_sf vs andere agenten","installation von robot_sf","einrichtungsanleitung für robot_sf","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","gh-issue-sequencer","github issues","ia para automação","como usar gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer vs jira","instalar gh-issue-sequencer","guia de configuração do gh-issue-sequencer"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","gh-issue-sequencer","проблемы github","ИИ для автоматизации","как использовать gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer vs jira","установить gh-issue-sequencer","руководство по настройке gh-issue-sequencer"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","gh-issue-sequencer","قضايا github","الذكاء الاصطناعي للautomação","كيفية استخدام gh-issue-sequencer","gh-issue-sequencer vs jira","تثبيت gh-issue-sequencer","دليل إعداد غه-إشيو-سيكوينسير"]}},"owner":"ll7","repo":"robot_sf_ll7","repoPath":"ll7/robot_sf_ll7","stars":4,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T13:40:29Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-issue-sequencer","description":"Maintain a clear next-work queue in GitHub by normalizing issue metadata, project status/priority fields, and producing a deterministic execution order.","bodyPreview":"# GH Issue Sequencer\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to create and maintain a sequential, high-signal backlog so the next work item is\nalways obvious.\n\n## Goal State\n\n- Exactly one issue is `In progress`.\n- A small, explicit queue (for example top 3) is `Ready`.\n- Remaining actionable issues are `Todo` or `Tracked`.\n- Blocked/decision-heavy issues are labeled and not silently mixed into ready work.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Load project board context\n   - `gh project view 5 --owner ll7 --format json`\n   - `","body":"# GH Issue Sequencer\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to create and maintain a sequential, high-signal backlog so the next work item is\nalways obvious.\n\n## Goal State\n\n- Exactly one issue is `In progress`.\n- A small, explicit queue (for example top 3) is `Ready`.\n- Remaining actionable issues are `Todo` or `Tracked`.\n- Blocked/decision-heavy issues are labeled and not silently mixed into ready work.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Load project board context\n   - `gh project view 5 --owner ll7 --format json`\n   - `gh project field-list 5 --owner ll7 --format json`\n   - `gh project item-list 5 --owner ll7 --limit 200 --format json`\n\n2. Normalize metadata for open issues\n   - Ensure issue has meaningful labels (`bug`, `enhancement`, domain labels like `validation`, `training`, `global planner`, `performance`).\n   - Ensure milestone is set when roadmap context exists (for example `benchmark` milestone).\n   - Ensure project `Priority` is set (`Very High`..`Very Low`) for actionable items.\n   - Move stale completed items to `Done`.\n\n3. Classify issues into lanes\n   - `In progress`: actively being implemented now.\n   - `Ready`: clear scope + acceptance criteria + no missing decisions.\n   - `Todo`: valid but not yet ready to start.\n   - `Tracked`: dependent, blocked, or exploratory.\n\n4. Build deterministic order\n   - Rank by:\n     1. `Status` lane (`Ready` first)\n     2. `Priority` (`Very High` to `Very Low`)\n     3. impact label preference (`bug` before `enhancement`, then others)\n     4. age (older issue number first)\n   - Select and mark:\n     - next one as `In progress` (if none already active)\n     - next 2-3 as `Ready`\n     - demote rest to `Todo` / `Tracked` as needed.\n\n5. Publish the sequence\n   - Add/update a project-level summary comment (or issue comment on the selected next issue):\n     - `Now`: `#<issue>`\n     - `Next`: `#<issue>, #<issue>`\n     - `Blocked/Decision`: `#<issue>`\n   - Use `scripts/dev/gh_comment.sh` for multiline formatting.\n\n6. Keep sequence healthy\n   - Remove `Ready` from issues missing acceptance criteria.\n   - Add `decision-required` label for unresolved decisions and move to `Tracked`.\n   - Split oversized issues into follow-ups and link them.\n\n## Practical Commands\n\n- Add issue to project:\n  - `gh project item-add 5 --owner ll7 --url https://github.com/ll7/robot_sf_ll7/issues/<n>`\n- Edit labels/milestone:\n  - `gh issue edit <n> --add-label \"<label1>,<label2>\" --milestone \"<milestone>\"`\n- Update project single-select fields:\n  - `gh project item-edit --id <item_id> --project-id <project_id> --field-id <field_id> --single-select-option-id <option_id>`\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Explicitly list:\n  - current `In progress` issue\n  - ordered `Ready` queue\n  - `Tracked` items requiring decisions\n  - any metadata fixes applied (labels, milestone, priority, status)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:38:58.964Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing advanced GitHub issue sequencing and backlog management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub 问题序列和待办事项管理功能的项目管理代理。","ja":"GitHub の問題シーケンシングとバックログ管理の高度な機能が必要なプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GitHub 이슈 시퀀싱 및 백로그 관리 기능이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que necesitan secuenciación avanzada de problemas de GitHub y capacidades de gestión de backlog.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une séquenciation avancée des problèmes GitHub et des capacités de gestion de backlog.","de":"Perfekt für Project-Management-Agents, die erweiterte GitHub-Problemmsequenzierung und Backlog-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de sequenciamento avançado de problemas do GitHub e capacidades de gerenciamento de backlog.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым требуются продвинутые возможности последовательности проблем GitHub и управления бэклогом.","ar":"مثالي لعميال إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى تسلسلي متقدم لمشاكل GitHub وإدارة بэكلوغ متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a sequential, high-signal backlog using GitHub project boards, ensuring exactly one issue is ''In progress'' and a small queue is ''Ready'', while utilizing gh project view and JSON formatting for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理维护顺序、高信号待办事项的能力，使用 GitHub 项目板确保只有一个问题处于 ''进行中'' 状态，一个小队列处于 ''准备就绪'' 状态，同时利用 gh 项目视图和 JSON 格式化实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが順序付けられた、高信号のバックログを維持できるようにし、GitHub プロジェクト ボードを使用して、1 つの問題が ''進行中'' であり、小さなキューが ''準備完了'' であることを保証し、gh プロジェクト ビューと JSON フォーマットを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 순차적이고 고신호 백로그를 유지할 수 있도록 하여 GitHub 프로젝트 보드를 사용하여 정확히 하나의 이슈가 ''進行중''이고 작은 큐가 ''준비 완료''인 것을 보장하며 gh 프로젝트 뷰와 JSON 형식화를 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener un backlog secuencial y de alta señal, utilizando tableros de proyecto de GitHub, asegurando que solo un problema esté ''En progreso'' y una pequeña cola esté ''Lista'', mientras utiliza la vista del proyecto gh y el formato JSON para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un backlog séquentiel et à haut signal, en utilisant les tableaux de projet GitHub, en s''assurant qu''un seul problème est ''En cours'' et qu''une petite file est ''Prête'', tout en utilisant la vue de projet gh et le formatage JSON pour une intégration sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, ein sequenzielles, hochwertiges Backlog mithilfe von GitHub-Projekt-Boards zu mantener, wobei genau ein Problem ''In Bearbeitung'' ist und eine kleine Warteschlange ''Bereit'' ist, während die gh-Projektansicht und die JSON-Formatierung für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um backlog sequencial e de alta prioridade usando quadros de projetos do GitHub, garantindo que exatamente uma problema esteja ''Em andamento'' e uma pequena fila esteja ''Pronta'', ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza a visão do projeto gh e formatação JSON para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательный и высокопriorитетный бэклог с помощью досок проектов GitHub, гарантируя, что ровно одна проблема находится в状态е ''В процессе'' и небольшая очередь находится в состоянии ''Готово'', одновременно используя представление проекта gh и форматирование JSON для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من الحفاظ على بэكلوغ متسلسلة وعالي الإشارة باستخدام لوحات مشروع GitHub، مما يضمن أن هناك مشكلة واحدة فقط في状态 ''قيد التقدم'' وطابورة صغيرة في状态 ''جاهزة''، مع استخدام عرض مشروع gh وتدوين JSON من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue prioritization and sequencing","Generating and maintaining a small, explicit ''Ready'' queue","Debugging and resolving blocked or decision-heavy issues using GitHub labels"],"zh":["自动化问题优先级和序列化","生成和维护小的、明确的 ''准备就绪'' 队列","使用 GitHub 标签调试和解决被阻塞或决策密集的问题"],"ja":["問題の優先順位とシーケンシングの自動化","小さな、明確な ''準備完了'' キューの生成と維持","GitHub ラベルを使用してブロックまたは決定密度の高い問題をデバッグして解決する"],"ko":["문제 우선순위 및 시퀀싱 자동화","작은 명시적 ''준비 완료'' 큐 생성 및 유지","GitHub 레이블을 사용하여 차단되거나 결정 집중적인 문제 디버깅 및 해결"],"es":["Automatización de la priorización y secuenciación de problemas","Generación y mantenimiento de una pequeña cola explícita ''Lista''","Depuración y resolución de problemas bloqueados o con muchas decisiones, utilizando etiquetas de GitHub"],"fr":["Automatisation de la priorisation et de la séquenciation des problèmes","Génération et maintien d''une petite file explicite ''Prête''","Débogage et résolution des problèmes bloqués ou à forte charge de décision, en utilisant les étiquettes GitHub"],"de":["Automatisierung der Priorisierung und Sequenzierung von Problemen","Erzeugung und Wartung einer kleinen, expliziten ''Bereit''-Warteschlange","Fehlersuche und Lösung von blockierten oder entscheidungslastigen Problemen, unter Verwendung von GitHub-Labels"],"pt":["Automating issue prioritization and sequencing","Gerar e manter uma pequena fila explícita ''Pronta''","Depurar e resolver problemas bloqueados ou que requerem decisões pesadas usando rótulos do GitHub"],"ru":["Автоматизация приоритизации и последовательности проблем","Генерация и поддержание небольшой явной очереди ''Готово''","Отладка и решение заблокированных или требующих принятия решений проблем с помощью меток GitHub"],"ar":["تأتمة ترتيب الأولوية وتسلسلي المشاكل","توليد والحفاظ على طابورة صغيرة واضحة ''جاهزة''","تصحيح الأخطاء وحل المشاكل المحظورة أو التي تتطلب قرارات ثقيلة باستخدام علامات GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub project board access","Limited to GitHub issues and project boards","Needs JSON formatting support for gh project view"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 项目板访问权限","仅限 GitHub 问题和项目板","需要 JSON 格式化支持 gh 项目视图"],"ja":["GitHub プロジェクト ボードへのアクセスが必要","GitHub の問題とプロジェクト ボードに限定される","gh プロジェクト ビューの JSON フォーマットのサポートが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 프로젝트 보드 액세스 필요","GitHub 이슈 및 프로젝트 보드에 제한됨","gh 프로젝트 뷰를 위한 JSON 형식화 지원 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a tableros de proyecto de GitHub","Limitado a problemas y tableros de proyecto de GitHub","Necesita soporte de formato JSON para la vista del proyecto gh"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux tableaux de projet GitHub","Limité aux problèmes et tableaux de projet GitHub","Nécessite une prise en charge du formatage JSON pour la vue de projet gh"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-Projekt-Boards","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Probleme und -Projekt-Boards","Benötigt Unterstützung für JSON-Formatierung für die gh-Projektansicht"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao quadro de projetos do GitHub","Limitado a problemas e quadros de projetos do GitHub","Necessita de suporte à formatação JSON para vista de projeto gh"],"ru":["Требует доступа к доске проектов GitHub","Ограничен проблемами и досками проектов GitHub","Требует поддержки форматирования JSON для представления проекта gh"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى لوحة مشروع GitHub","محدود بمشاكل ولوحات مشروع GitHub","يحتاج إلى دعم تنسيق JSON لعرض مشروع gh"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3682499cc4644889c591d6c92a38708d0556d9043b7292742fb08e6412c51ab4","qualityScore":39}');
