ferramentas","instalar tundra-cli-smoke","guia de configuração do tundra-cli-smoke"],"ru":["как использовать tundra-cli-smoke","что такое SAST","альтернативы tundra-cli-smoke","tundra-cli-smoke vs другие инструменты","установка tundra-cli-smoke","руководство по настройке tundra-cli-smoke"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tundra-cli-smoke","ما هو اختبار SAST","بديل أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tundra-cli-smoke","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tundra-cli-smoke مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tundra-cli-smoke","دليل إعداد أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tundra-cli-smoke"]}},"owner":"ryanmaclean","repo":"tundra","repoPath":"ryanmaclean/tundra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:50:20Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tundra-cli-smoke","description":"Use when developing or refactoring at-cli. Runs deterministic smoke checks for run/agent/skill/doctor commands, including --dry-run and --out artifact paths.","bodyPreview":"# Tundra CLI Smoke\n\n## Trigger\nUse this skill whenever CLI behavior changes in `/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/`, or when validating API contract drift from the CLI side.\n\n## Required Checks\nRun these in order:\n\n1. Build and unit tests\n```bash\ncargo check -p at-cli\ncargo test -p at-cli\n```\n\n2. Skill discovery/validation\n```bash\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill list -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill validate -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\n```\n\n3. Dry-run payloa","body":"# Tundra CLI Smoke\n\n## Trigger\nUse this skill whenever CLI behavior changes in `/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/`, or when validating API contract drift from the CLI side.\n\n## Required Checks\nRun these in order:\n\n1. Build and unit tests\n```bash\ncargo check -p at-cli\ncargo test -p at-cli\n```\n\n2. Skill discovery/validation\n```bash\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill list -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill validate -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\n```\n\n3. Dry-run payload checks with artifacts\n```bash\nOUT1=\"$(mktemp -t at-run.XXXXXX).json\"\nOUT2=\"$(mktemp -t at-agent.XXXXXX).json\"\n\ncargo run -p at-cli -- run -t \"cli smoke run\" --dry-run --emit-prompt -j --out \"$OUT1\"\ncargo run -p at-cli -- agent run -r qa-reviewer -t \"cli smoke agent\" --dry-run -j --out \"$OUT2\"\n```\n\n4. Doctor checks\n```bash\nOUT3=\"$(mktemp -t at-doctor.XXXXXX).json\"\ncargo run -p at-cli -- doctor -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j --out \"$OUT3\"\n```\n\n## Expected Invariants\n- `run` and `agent run` dry-runs must emit valid JSON with `mode: dry-run`.\n- `--out` must write a pretty JSON artifact file.\n- `skill validate` should return `ok: true` for clean repo skill definitions.\n- `doctor` JSON must include `api`, `project_exists`, `skill_count`, `env`, and `failures`.\n\n## Reporting Format\nAlways report:\n- files changed\n- commands executed\n- pass/fail by command\n- any artifact path used for validation\n- any regression found and the likely root cause\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:49:07.669Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing comprehensive CLI testing and validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面CLI测试和验证能力的基于Rust的AI代理。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが包括的なCLIテストと検証機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전체 CLI 테스트 및 검증 기능이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Rust que necesitan capacidades de prueba y validación de CLI comprehensivas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Rust nécessitant des capacités de test et de validation de CLI complètes.","de":"Perfekt für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die umfassende CLI-Test- und Validierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que precisam de capacidades de teste e validação de CLI abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, требующих всесторонних возможностей тестирования и проверки CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى روست التي تحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار و التحقق من CLI الشاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate SAST testing, pipeline demos, and PR bot automation using Cargo and Rust, ensuring API contract drift validation and CLI behavior consistency through skills like ''skill list'' and ''skill validate'' with JSON output.","zh":"通过Cargo和Rust赋予代理自动化SAST测试、管道演示和PR机器人自动化的能力，确保API契约漂移验证和CLI行为一致性，通过类似''技能列表''和''技能验证''的技能实现JSON输出。","ja":"CargoとRustを使用して、SASTテスト、パイプラインデモ、PRボット自動化を自動化し、API契約ドリフト検証とCLI動作の一貫性を確保する能力をエージェントに付与します。''スキルリスト''や''スキル検証''などのスキルでJSON出力を実現します。","ko":"Cargo 및 Rust를 사용하여 SAST 테스트, 파이프라인 데모 및 PR봇 자동화를 자동화하고 API 계약 드리프트 검증 및 CLI 동작 일관성을 보장하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하며 ''스킬 목록'' 및 ''스킬 유효성 검사''와 같은 기능을 사용하여 JSON 출력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas de SAST, demos de pipelines y automatización de bots de PR utilizando Cargo y Rust, garantizando la validación del contrato de API y la consistencia del comportamiento de CLI a través de habilidades como ''skill list'' y ''skill validate'' con salida JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de SAST, les démos de pipeline et l''automatisation des bots de PR en utilisant Cargo et Rust, en garantissant la validation du contrat d''API et la cohérence du comportement de la CLI via des compétences comme ''skill list'' et ''skill validate'' avec une sortie JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, SAST-Tests, Pipeline-Demos und PR-Bot-Automatisierung mithilfe von Cargo und Rust zu automatisieren, wodurch die API-Vertragsdrift-Validierung und die Konsistenz des CLI-Verhaltens durch Fähigkeiten wie ''skill list'' und ''skill validate'' mit JSON-Ausgabe sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes SAST, demos de pipeline e automação de bot PR usando Cargo e Rust, garantindo validação de derivação de contrato de API e consistência de comportamento de CLI por meio de habilidades como ''skill list'' e ''skill validate'' com saída JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать тестиро